11:33:34'),(151,'index','Hero','hero.5','Paragraph: In the ever-changing global landscape, compan…','textarea','In the ever-changing global landscape, companies today need more than individual service providers. They need partners with the right resources, domain expertise, scalable state of the art infrastructure and the latest technology to deliver consistently. At Intelliworkz, we provide offshore solutions to deliver <strong>creative and digital</strong> marketing services that operate as an extended team under one roof.',4,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 11:33:34'),(152,'index','Hero','hero.6','Paragraph: A seamless flow: your creative ideas transfor…','text','A seamless flow: your creative ideas transformed into digital growth',9,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 02:06:43'),(153,'index','Domain Expertise','domain-expertise.2','Heading: Domain Expertise Across Creative, Digital & T…','text','Domain Expertise Across Creative, Digital &amp; Technology',10,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 02:06:43'),(154,'index','Domain Expertise','domain-expertise.3','Paragraph: Your business may need a new brand, a website…','textarea','Intelliworkz brings together <strong>brand development</strong>, <strong>creative design</strong>, digital marketing, technology, and outsourcing capabilities, backed by teams with expertise across the domains they work in.',11,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 11:33:34'),(155,'index','Domain Expertise','domain-expertise.4','Paragraph: Intelliworkz brings together brand developmen…','textarea','This allows us to understand not only what needs to be delivered but also the business context, audience, workflows, and objectives behind the requirement.',12,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 11:33:34'),(156,'index','Domain Expertise','domain-expertise.5','Paragraph: Our domain expertise spans creative and commu…','textarea','Our domain expertise spans creative and communication, digital marketing, web and mobile applications, enterprise sys