,'index','Outsourcing','outsourcing.4','Paragraph: Intelliworkz provides IT outsourcing services…','textarea','Intelliworkz provides <strong>IT outsourcing services</strong>, creative service outsourcing, and engineering service outsourcing through 100% in-house teams. You can outsource a specific function, a complete project or build a dedicated team around your ongoing requirements.',26,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 11:33:34'),(164,'index','Outsourcing','outsourcing.5','Sub-heading: OUR 4-STEP ENGAGEMENT PROCESS','text','OUR 4-STEP ENGAGEMENT PROCESS',27,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 02:06:43'),(165,'index','Outsourcing','outsourcing.6','Sub-heading: WHITE-LABEL & OFFSHORE SUPPORT','text','WHITE-LABEL &amp; OFFSHORE SUPPORT',28,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 02:06:43'),(166,'index','Outsourcing','outsourcing.7','Small heading: Extend Delivery Without Extending Your Brand','text','Extend Delivery Without Extending Your Brand',29,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 02:06:43'),(167,'index','Outsourcing','outsourcing.8','List item: Confidential collaboration','text','Confidential collaboration',30,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 02:06:43'),(168,'index','Outsourcing','outsourcing.9','List item: Brand-safe delivery standards','text','Brand-safe delivery standards',31,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 02:06:43'),(169,'index','Outsourcing','outsourcing.10','List item: Scalable offshore resources','text','Scalable offshore resources',32,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 02:06:43'),(170,'index','Outsourcing','outsourcing.11','List item: Consistent project execution','text','Consistent project execution',33,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:01','2026-10-23 02:06:43'),(171,'index','Outsourcing','outsourcing.12','Paragraph: Build a team around your specific requirement…','textarea','For agencies and businesses that need additional delivery capacity, our teams can work behind your brand or as an offshore extension of your organization while maintaining confidentialit