2','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(308,'ppt-design','Hero','hero.4','Paragraph: A presentation is often where your idea first…','textarea','A business presentation is often the first to represent your company to your clients, investors and stakeholders. This makes it very important to have a professionally designed presentation that enables you to communicate effectively to your audience. However the biggest challenge is the lack of time you have on hand and that most of the presentations are needed at the very last moment or closer to the deadline. This is where we step in to support our clients by providing timely and creative presentation design services.',4,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(309,'ppt-design','Hero','hero.5','Bold label: Dedicated In-House Design Team','text','Dedicated In-House Team',5,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(310,'ppt-design','Hero','hero.6','Text: Professional presentation designers deliverin…','text','Our in-house team coordinates ppt design, feedback and final delivery through a clear project workflow.',6,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(311,'ppt-design','Hero','hero.7','Heading: Let’s Bring Your Presentation to Life.','text','Let’s Transform Your Ideas into Powerful Presentations',7,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(312,'ppt-design','Hero','hero.8','Paragraph: Tell us about your project.','text','Share your ideas and core messaging and we will transfer it into engaging presentations.',8,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(313,'ppt-design','Hero','hero.9','Text: Subject','text','Subject',9,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(314,'ppt-design','Hero','hero.10','Text: Your Message','text','Your Message',10,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(315,'ppt-design','Hero','hero.11','Button text: Start a Project','text','Start a Project',11,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(316,'ppt-design','Selected Work','selected-work.5','Heading: Selected PPT Design Work','text','Selected PPT design Work',12,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(317,'ppt-design','Selected Work','selected-work.6','Paragraph: Our presentation design work supports busines…','textarea','Explore approved ppt design examples across relevant formats and applications.',13,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(318,'ppt-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.1','Heading: Why Intelliworkz','text','A Clear Message Matters More Than a Full Slide',20,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(319,'ppt-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2','Paragraph: Most presentations fail for the same reason: …','textarea','Most presentations fail to impress primarily because the presentation is not in line with the brand guideline or it is too cluttered or because it is not simply presentable.  Our experience of working in multiple domains ranging from Manufacturing &amp; Engineering, Education , B2B services enables us to understand what our clients expect and deliver the output that is aligned with their expectations.',21,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(320,'ppt-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Paragraph: We start with your content and your goal, whe…','textarea','We start with a discovery call to understand your communication goal with the presentation and request for the draft content that will go into the presentation. We arrange this information in a storyboard fashion to help you understand the flow of the presentation and continue to work on the design. We collaborate with our clients to ensure they have first hand information of how the design is shaping up and know how the final design will look like.',22,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(321,'ppt-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Paragraph: As a branding partner, we also make sure your…','textarea','',23,0,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 04:57:19'),(322,'ppt-design','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz