on capabilities to help businesses deliver more, scale faster and operate efficiently.',4,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(753,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.5','First button text','text','Start a Project',5,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(754,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.6','First button link','url','contact-us.php',6,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(755,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.7','Second button text','text','Our Services',7,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(756,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.8','Second button link','url','services.php',8,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(757,'about-us','01 Hero','hero.9','Words at the right edge','html','Creative<br>Digital<br>Production<br>Scale',9,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(758,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.1','Small heading','text','About Intelliworkz',10,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(759,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','Built for Scale.<br>Designed for<br>Partnership.',11,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(760,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.3','First paragraph','textarea','We are a creative, digital and production services company building a strong global outsourcing practice for businesses that need reliable execution, consistent quality and the capacity to handle work at scale.<br><br>From creative design and video post-production to publishing, pre-press and print production, we help organisations streamline workflows, manage high-volume projects and extend their delivery capabilities without the cost and complexity of building larger in-house teams.<br><br>Our approach combines skilled professionals, structured workflows, quality-focused delivery and flexible engagement models to make outsourcing a seamless extension of your business.',12,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(761,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.4','Second paragraph','textarea','We believe outsourcing is more than delegating tasks. It is about building a dependable partnership that strengthens your operations and supports long-term growth.<br><br>Whether you need a dedicated team working alongside your organisation or a managed services partner to handle recurring production requirements, Intelliworkz offers the flexibility to adapt to your business needs.<br><br>We work with agencies, publishers, brands, production companies and enterprises that require dependable execution across large volumes of creative and production work. Our focus is on building lasting relationships through transparent communication, predictable delivery and the ability to scale with demand.',13,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(762,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.5','Button text','text','More About Us',14,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(763,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.6','Button link','url','#team',15,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(764,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.7','Big picture','image','assets/images/about/who-we-are-1.webp',16,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(765,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.8','Small picture','image','assets/images/about/who-we-are-2.webp',17,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(766,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.9','Dark card: number','text','7+',18,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(767,'about-us','02 Who We Are','who.10','Dark card: label','html','Countries<br>Global Presence',19,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(768,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.1','Small heading','text','Our Vision',20,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(769,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','A Dependable Partner<br>of Choice.',21,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(770,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.3','Paragraph','textarea','We endeavor to be a dependable partner of choice which provides creative, digital and production services, known for dependable delivery, scalable capabilities and enduring client partnerships.<br><br>We aim to help businesses across international markets achieve more by connecting them with the right talent, efficient production systems and flexible delivery models.',22,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(771,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.4','Big picture','image','assets/images/process-2.png',23,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(772,'about-us','04 Our Purpose','purpose.5','Picture bottom right (shown in black and white)','image','assets/images/about/our-purpose-2.webp',24,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(773,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.1','Small heading','text','Our Capabilities',25,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(774,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','Creative, Video &amp;<br>Production Expertise.',26,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(775,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.3','Paragraph','textarea','<strong>Creative Design &amp; Digital Production:</strong> From brand communication and marketing collateral to digital assets and campaign adaptations, we support businesses with consistent, high-quality creative output across channels and formats.<br><br><strong>Video Production &amp; Post-Production:</strong> We help production houses, agencies and brands manage editing backlogs, recurring video requirements and demanding delivery schedules through scalable post-production support.<br><br><strong>Publishing, Pre-press &amp; Print Production:</strong> We support publishers, content owners and print service providers with document production, layout and typesetting, artwork adaptation, pre-press preparation and print-ready file delivery.<br><br><strong>Industry-Focused Creative Support:</strong> We support manufacturing businesses with product catalogues and technical collateral; financial services with reports, presentations and investor communications; healthcare with educational and promotional materials; and real estate with project brochures, sales presentations and marketing assets.',27,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(776,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.4','Button text','text','Explore Our Services',28,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(777,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.5','Button link','url','services.php',29,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(778,'about-us','05 Our Approach','approach.6','Centre of the diagram','html','Your<br>Capability,<br>Extended.',30,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(779,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.1','Small heading','text','Why Intelliworkz',31,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(780,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','A Team Built Around<br>Your Business.',32,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(781,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.3','Paragraph','textarea','<strong>Integrated Capabilities:</strong> Creative, video, digital and production expertise within one operating environment.<br><br><strong>Scalable Delivery:</strong> The ability to expand capacity and capabilities as your requirements evolve.<br><br><strong>Transparent Engagements:</strong> Clear commercial terms and a practical approach to revisions, requests and ongoing support.<br><br><strong>Process-Driven Execution:</strong> Workflows built around quality, consistency, turnaround times and accountability.<br><br><strong>Long-Term Partnership:</strong> A team that works to understand your business, adapt to your requirements and contribute to your operational goals.',33,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(782,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.4','Button text','text','Explore Our Services',34,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(783,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.5','Button link','url','services.php',35,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(784,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.6','Big picture','image','assets/images/about/our-team-1.webp',36,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(785,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.7','Picture top right','image','assets/images/about/our-team-2.webp',37,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(786,'about-us','06 Our Team','team.8','Picture bottom right','image','assets/images/about/our-team-3.webp',38,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-13 06:54:50'),(790,'about-us','07 Why Choose Us','why.1','Small heading','text','Our Delivery Model',39,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(791,'about-us','07 Why Choose Us','why.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','A Delivery Model<br>That Works for You.',40,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(792,'about-us','07 Why Choose Us','why.3','Text at the right','textarea','Every business has different production demands. Our outsourcing models are designed to accommodate them.',41,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(793,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.1','Small heading','text','Our Commitment',42,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(794,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.2','Heading (last line is red)','html','Intelliworkz —<br>Your Capability, Extended.',43,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(795,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.3','First button text','text','Start a Project',44,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(796,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.4','First button link','url','contact-us.php',45,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(797,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.5','Second button text','text','Talk to Our Team',46,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(798,'about-us','08 Call to Action','cta.6','Second button link','url','contact-us.php',47,0,'2026-10-13 06:54:50','2026-10-23 02:08:22'),(799,'3d-modeling-rendering','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.1.url','Bu