mber','text','06',27,0,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(993,'case-study','06 Services Delivered','services.2','Section heading','text','Services Delivered',28,0,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(994,'case-study','06 Services Delivered','services.3','Heading of the capabilities strip','text','Capabilities applied',29,0,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(995,'case-study','Call To Action','cta.1','Heading','text','Want One Brand Across Every Business?',30,0,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(996,'case-study','Call To Action','cta.2','Paragraph','text','Tell us about your group and we will map out the identity, website and content it needs.',31,0,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(997,'case-study','Call To Action','cta.3','Button text','text','Start a Conversation',32,0,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(998,'case-study','Call To Action','cta.4','Button link','url','contact-us.php',33,0,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(1013,'brand-identity-and-design','Dark Showcase','dark-showcase.1','Heading: What Our Packaging Design Services …','text','What Our Packaging Design Services Cover',32,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(1014,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.1','Image (hero.png)','image','assets/images/brand-identity/hero.webp',1,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 23:13:14'),(1015,'brand-identity-and-design','Stats','stats.1','Image (stats.png)','image','assets/images/brand-identity/statistics.webp',16,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-24 01:13:37'),(1016,'brand-identity-and-design','Tools Strip','tools-strip.1','Image (tools-bg.png)','image','assets/images/packaging/tools-bg.png',23,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(1017,'brand-identity-and-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.1','Image: Packaging design services ove… (services.png)','image','assets/images/packaging/services.png',29,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(1018,'brand-identity-and-design','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.1','Button text: Let’s Talk','text','Let’s Talk',36,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(1019,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.2','Paragraph: Home / Services / Branding & Creative / Packa…','html','<a href=\"index.php\">Home</a> / <a href=\"services.php\">Services</a> / <a href=\"services.php#svc-1\">Branding &amp; Creative</a> / <span> Brand Identity &amp; design</span>',2,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:56:08'),(1020,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.3','Main heading: PACKAGING DESIGN SERVICES','text','Brand Identity &amp; Design Services',3,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:55:15'),(1021,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.4','Paragraph: Successful packaging goes beyond creative des…','textarea','Your brand identity goes beyond a logo. It encompasses your colours, typography, imagery, and visual language that shape how your business is recognised and remembered. At Intelliworkz, we bring these elements together into a cohesive brand identity system, supported by clear brand guidelines and production-ready design assets. From websites and packaging to corporate stationery, marketing collateral, and digital communications, we ensure your brand remains consistent, distinctive, and professionally presented across every touchpoint.',4,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:55:00'),(1022,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.5','Bold label: Dedicated In-House Packaging Team','text','Dedicated In-House Team',5,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:58:48'),(1023,'brand-identity-and-design','Hero','hero.6','Text: Creative and technical expertise focused on a…','text','We manage every stage of brand identity and design through a structured workflow—from initial concepts and feedback to refinements and final delivery—ensuring consistent quality, seamless coordination, and timely execution.',6,0,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:58:48'),(1024,'