nd-identity-and-design~why-uaws','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2','Paragraph: The value of a render is simple: people belie…','textarea','Most businesses develop their brand across different stages, often ending up working with multiple partners for logos, websites, and marketing collateral. While each element may look good individually, inconsistencies in design, colours, and typography can weaken the overall brand identity. We take a unified approach to brand development, ensuring every visual element follows a consistent design language and works together to create a cohesive, recognisable brand across all touchpoints.',22,0,'2026-10-23 05:47:39','2026-10-23 06:06:38'),(1059,'brand-identity-and-design~why-uaws','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Paragraph: Our team is involved in the entire workflow: …','textarea','We begin by engaging closely with you to understand your business, brand journey, aspirations, and challenges. Through focused discussions, we define the core problem statement and conduct competitor analysis to understand the market landscape, identify opportunities, and establish meaningful differentiation. Building on these insights, we define your brand purpose, target audience, positioning, and personality before translating them into a distinctive visual and verbal identity.',23,0,'2026-10-23 05:47:39','2026-10-24 01:28:43'),(1060,'brand-identity-and-design~why-uaws','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Paragraph: Because everything is produced by our own tea…','textarea','Collaboration drives every stage of our process. From discovery and strategy to design development and final delivery, we work closely with you, incorporating feedback and aligning decisions at every milestone. This ensures the resulting brand identity reflects your vision, addresses your business needs, and maintains consistency across every brand touchpoint.&quot;',24,0,'2026-10-23 05:47:39','2026-10-23 06:06:38'),(1061,'brand-identity-and-design~why-uaws','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.5','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Request a Brand Consultation',26,0,'2026-10-23 05:47:39','2026-10-23 06:06:38'),(1062,'brand-identity-and-design~why-uaws','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.6','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',25,0,'2026-10-23 05:47:39','2026-10-23 05:47:39'),(1063,'brand-identity-and-design~why-uaws','Why Intelliworkz','card-numbers.1','Numbers on the cards (01, 02 …)','toggle','1',28,0,'2026-10-23 05:47:39','2026-10-23 05:47:39'),(1064,'brand-identity-and-design~tools-xjvk','Tools Strip','tools-strip.1','Image (tools-bg.png)','image','assets/images/brand-identity/tools-bg.webp',26,0,'2026-10-23 05:48:45','2026-10-24 01:13:37'),(1077,'logo-design','Dark Showcase','dark-showcase.1','Heading: What Our Packaging Design Services …','text','Selected Logo Design Case Studies',32,0,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(1078,'logo-design','Hero','hero.1','Image (hero.png)','image','assets/images/logo-design/hero.webp',1,0,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(1079,'logo-design','Stats','stats.1','Image (stats.png)','image','assets/images/logo-design/statistics.webp',16,0,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(1080,'logo-design','Tools Strip','tools-strip.1','Image (tools-bg.png)','image','assets/images/logo-design/tool.jpg',23,0,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(1081,'logo-design','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.1','Image: Packaging design services ove… (services.png)','image','assets/images/logo-design/services.webp',29,0,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(1082,'logo-design','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.1','Button text: Let’s Talk','text','Get Your Logo Designed',36,0,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(1083,'logo-design','Hero','hero.2','Paragraph: Home / Services / Branding & Creative / Packa…','html','<a href=\"index.php\">Home</a> / <a href=\"services.php\">Services</a> / <a href=\"services.php