text','The Idea Comes First, and Everything Follows From It',12,0,'2026-10-24 04:32:21','2026-10-24 04:58:24'),(1251,'campaign-concepts-and-ad-creatives~why-4w5w','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2','Paragraph: Most design problems in publishing are not cr…','textarea','Plenty of teams can design an ad. Fewer start by asking what the ad should say and why anyone should care. We begin with the idea, the single thought that gives your campaign a reason to exist, because this is what makes the creative work rather than just look good.',13,0,'2026-10-24 04:32:21','2026-10-24 04:58:24'),(1252,'campaign-concepts-and-ad-creatives~why-4w5w','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Request a Quote',15,0,'2026-10-24 04:32:21','2026-10-24 04:58:24'),(1253,'campaign-concepts-and-ad-creatives~why-4w5w','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',14,0,'2026-10-24 04:32:21','2026-10-24 04:32:21'),(1254,'campaign-concepts-and-ad-creatives~why-4w5w','Why Intelliworkz','card-numbers.1','Numbers on the cards (01, 02 …)','toggle','1',16,0,'2026-10-24 04:32:21','2026-10-24 04:32:21'),(1255,'campaign-concepts-and-ad-creatives~why-4w5w','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2~1','Added after “Paragraph: Most design problems in publi...”','textarea','Once the idea is right, we build everything around it. The same concept runs through your video, your static ads, and your social posts, so the campaign feels connected wherever someone sees it. As a branding partner, we hold that consistency across the whole campaign, not one asset at a time, which is what makes advertising land and stay in memory.',13,0,'2026-10-24 04:58:24','2026-10-24 04:58:24'),(1256,'corporate-communication','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.1','Image: Marketing and sales collatera… (services.png)','image','assets/images/collaterals/services.png',27,0,'2026-10-24 05:15:24','2026-10-24 05:15:24'),(1257,'corporate-communication','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.1','Button text: Let’s Talk','text','Get a Quote',34,0,'2026-10-24 05:15:24','2026-10-24 05:15:24'),(1258,'corporate-communication','Hero','hero.1','Paragraph: Home / Services / Branding & Creative / Marke…','html','<a href=\"index.php\">Home</a> / <a href=\"services.php\">Services</a> / <a href=\"services.php#svc-1\">Branding &amp; Creative</a> / <span>Corporate Communication</span>',1,0,'2026-10-24 05:15:24','2026-10-24 05:15:24'),(1259,'corporate-communication','Hero','hero.2','Main heading: Marketing & Sales Collaterals','html','Corporate Communication<br>Services',2,0,'2026-10-24 05:15:24','2026-10-24 05:15:24'),(1260,'corporate-communication','Hero','hero.3','Paragraph: Marketing and sales collateral is the set of …','textarea','Every company communicates constantly, with employees, customers, investors, and the public. When those messages are planned and consistent, they build trust. When they are scattered, they create confusion. We help you shape your business’s communication so the same clear message reaches every audience that matters.',3,0,'2026-10-24 05:15:24','2026-10-24 05:15:24'),(1261,'corporate-communication','Hero','hero.4','Bold label: Dedicated In-House Design Team','text','Dedicated In-House Team',4,0,'2026-10-24 05:15:24','2026-10-24 05:15:24'),(1262,'corporate-communication','Hero','hero.5','Text: Experienced designers creating consistent, hi…','textarea','Our in-house team coordinates corporate communication, feedback and final delivery through a clear project workflow.',5,0,'2026-10-24 05:15:24','2026-10-24 05:15:24'),(1263,'corporate-communication','Hero','hero.6','Heading: Let’s Bring Your Presentation to Life.','text','Let’s Discuss Your Corporate Communication',6,0,'2026-10-24 05:15:24','2026-10-24 05:15:24'),(1264,'corporate-communication','Hero','hero.7','Paragraph: Tell us about your project.','text','Have a project in mind? Let’s discuss how we can bring it to life.',7,0,'2