4'),(1524,'digital-marketing~why-gynp','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Paragraph: We start with your content and your goal, whe…','textarea','We focus on what matters most to your business: revenue and measurable growth. While impressions and clicks offer useful insights, they don’t always translate into business results. We measure performance through meaningful outcomes such as qualified leads, conversions, and sales, giving you a clear picture of what’s working and where improvements are needed. As a full-service digital marketing partner, we work across digital channels to build an integrated strategy, prioritising the activities that deliver real business value over those that simply generate activity',22,0,'2026-10-24 06:15:04','2026-10-24 06:15:04'),(1525,'digital-marketing~why-gynp','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Paragraph: As a branding partner, we also make sure your…','textarea','',23,0,'2026-10-24 06:15:04','2026-10-24 06:15:04'),(1526,'digital-marketing~why-gynp','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.5','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Request a Consultation',25,0,'2026-10-24 06:15:04','2026-10-24 06:15:04'),(1527,'digital-marketing~why-gynp','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.6','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',24,0,'2026-10-24 06:15:04','2026-10-24 06:15:04'),(1528,'digital-marketing~why-gynp','Why Intelliworkz','card-numbers.1','Numbers on the cards (01, 02 …)','toggle','1',27,0,'2026-10-24 06:15:04','2026-10-24 06:15:04'),(1529,'aeo-services','Dark Showcase','dark-showcase.1','Heading: What Our SEO Services Cover','text','What Our SEO Services Cover',32,0,'2026-10-24 06:21:52','2026-10-24 06:21:52'),(1530,'aeo-services','Selected Work','selected-work.1','Image (portfolio-bg.png)','image','assets/images/seo/portfolio-bg.png',13,0,'2026-10-24 06:21:52','2026-10-24 06:21:52'),(1531,'aeo-services','Selected Work','selected-work.2','Image: SEO results dashboard: keywor… (portfolio-main.png)','image','assets/images/s