i adipiscing proin facilisis semper tortor viverra sed nulla duis. Ut eu.',17,0,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(1634,'content-marketing','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.1','Heading: Why Intelliworkz','text','Content Mapped to Your Buyer&#039;s Questions',18,0,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(1635,'content-marketing','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2','Paragraph: Picking an SEO agency in India comes down to …','textarea','Content generates leads when it is built around what your buyers are researching. A considered purchase involves multiple people and a lengthy evaluation process, and each one will ask questions. At the beginning of every campaign, we lay out each individual’s questions across their entire customer’s journey - from acknowledging a need to investigate the best solution, right up until the deal is closed - and we plan content that addresses each stage.',19,0,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(1636,'content-marketing','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Paragraph: SEO counts when it shows up in the places tha…','textarea','That mapping is what turns content into a pipeline. Early-stage content brings in prospects researching the problem you solve. Mid-stage content helps a buyer compare you against other suppliers on the criteria that matter to them. Late-stage content gives the decision-maker the evidence they need to justify the choice internally. Every piece is written to move a specific type of buyer one step closer to a purchase.',20,0,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(1637,'content-marketing','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Paragraph: Our team knows both sides of the search. Audi…','textarea','',21,0,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(1638,'content-marketing','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.5','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Book a Content Review',23,0,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(1639,'content-marketing','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliwo