\">Post-Production</a> / <span>Product video</span>',3,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2074,'product-video','Hero','hero.4','Main heading: Video Editing Services','text','Product Demo Videos',4,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2075,'product-video','Hero','hero.5','Paragraph: Most of the planning for a video happens befo…','textarea','Most products are easier to use than they are to explain. A prospect lands on your site, sees a list of features, and leaves without understanding what your product actually does for them. A product demo video closes that gap. As a product demo video agency, we turn your product into a short, clear story that shows its value in under a minute, so a viewer understands it, believes it, and moves closer to buying.',5,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2076,'product-video','Hero','hero.6','Bold label: Dedicated Project Manager','text','Dedicated In-House Team',6,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2077,'product-video','Hero','hero.7','Text: One point of contact throughout the project.','text','Our in-house team coordinates product video, feedback and final delivery through a clear project workflow.',7,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2078,'product-video','Hero','hero.8','Heading: Let\'s bring your magazine to life.','text','Let&#039;s Discuss Your Product video',8,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2079,'product-video','Hero','hero.9','Paragraph: Tell us about your project.','text','Share your requirements and our team will contact you to discuss scope, deliverables and next steps.',9,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2080,'product-video','Hero','hero.10','Text: Subject','text','Subject',10,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2081,'product-video','Hero','hero.11','Text: Your Message','text','Your Message',11,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2082,'product-video','Hero','hero.12','Button text: Start a Project','text','S