business needs, from a short launch demo to a full library for onboarding and sales. You can bring us a live product, a prototype, or just an idea and a set of features.',26,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2091,'product-video','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.4','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Enquire Now',28,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2092,'product-video','Services + Workflow','services-workflow.5','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',27,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2093,'product-video','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.3','Heading: what we offer','text','What We Offer',31,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2094,'product-video','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.4','Paragraph: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Portt…','textarea','Explore related Intelliworkz services that support your wider business needs.',32,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2095,'product-video','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.5','Heading: Book a Free Consultation','html','Show Buyers Exactly Why Your Product Is Worth It',34,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2096,'product-video','FAQs','faqs.1','Heading: FAQs','text','FAQs',36,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2097,'product-video','Dark Showcase','dark-showcase.1','Heading: What Our Video Editing Services Cov…','text','Selected Product video Case Studies',30,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2098,'product-video','Dark Showcase (shared)','dark-showcase-shared.1','Heading: What Our Video Editing Services Cov…','text','Selected Product video Case Studies',30,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2099,'product-video','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.2.url','Button link: Let’s Talk','url','contact-us.php',36,0,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(2100,'prod