cale.',21,0,'2026-10-26 00:34:36','2026-10-26 00:34:36'),(2115,'product-video~why-kw2c','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Paragraph: We start with your content and your goal, whe…','textarea','That is why we start with the outcome, not the animation. We define who the video is for, the decision you want them to make, and the one thing about your product that makes the strongest case, then build the script and visuals around it. As a branding partner, we make sure the demo carries your brand in how it looks and sounds, so it adds to your reputation rather than sitting apart from it. What you get is product demo videos the sales team can send, your website can lead with, and your onboarding can rely on.',22,0,'2026-10-26 00:34:36','2026-10-26 00:34:36'),(2116,'product-video~why-kw2c','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Paragraph: As a branding partner, we also make sure your…','textarea','',23,0,'2026-10-26 00:34:36','2026-10-26 00:34:36'),(2117,'product-video~why-kw2c','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.5','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Request a Quote',25,0,'2026-10-26 00:34:36','2026-10-26 00:34:36'),(2118,'product-video~why-kw2c','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.6','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',24,0,'2026-10-26 00:34:36','2026-10-26 00:34:36'),(2119,'product-video~why-kw2c','Why Intelliworkz','card-numbers.1','Numbers on the cards (01, 02 …)','toggle','1',27,0,'2026-10-26 00:34:36','2026-10-26 00:34:36'),(2120,'explainer-videos~offers-aouz','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.1','Button text: Let’s Talk','text','Let’s Talk',36,0,'2026-10-26 00:37:07','2026-10-26 00:37:07'),(2121,'explainer-videos~offers-aouz','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.2','Heading: what we offer','text','What We Offer',33,0,'2026-10-26 00:37:07','2026-10-26 00:37:07'),(2122,'explainer-videos~offers-aouz','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','what-we-offer-cta-engagement.3','Paragraph: Lorem i