lor sit amet consectetur.','text','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur.',16,0,'2026-10-26 00:45:40','2026-10-26 00:45:40'),(2150,'presentation-videos','Selected Work','selected-work.7','Paragraph: Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Conva…','textarea','Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur. Convallis sed dui netus suscipit quis. Porttitor ut egestas faucibus consectetur scelerisque magna. Orci adipiscing proin facilisis semper tortor viverra sed nulla duis. Ut eu.',17,0,'2026-10-26 00:45:40','2026-10-26 00:45:40'),(2151,'presentation-videos','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.1','Heading: Why Intelliworkz','text','Bringing Sales-Ready Prospects to Your Team',18,0,'2026-10-26 00:45:40','2026-10-26 00:45:40'),(2152,'presentation-videos','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.2','Paragraph: Picking an SEO agency in India comes down to …','textarea','First, we determine what the definition of an ideal lead is for your business - this encompasses the industry, job level and title, company size, and the intent, which identifies a high-value opportunity. Next, we create a lead generation campaign to reach this audience at the relevant touchpoints, engage with them, and identify who aligns with your ideal customer profile, before scoring them. Your sales team receives leads that match your criteria, with the context they need to have a useful first conversation, so they spend their time on prospects worth pursuing.',19,0,'2026-10-26 00:45:40','2026-10-26 00:45:40'),(2153,'presentation-videos','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.3','Paragraph: SEO counts when it shows up in the places tha…','textarea','Because we run the channels together, each one supports the others. Search and content bring in people actively looking for a solution, paid campaigns extend the reach to the right audience, and landing pages and forms turn that interest into a captured, qualified lead. One team manages all of it against a single target: qualified leads in your pipeline.',20,0,'2026-1