orking and where improvements are needed. As a full-service digital marketing partner, we work across digital channels to build an integrated strategy, prioritising the activities that deliver real business value over those that simply generate activity',22,0,'2026-10-26 00:59:59','2026-10-26 00:59:59'),(2241,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~why-ilgj','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.4','Paragraph: As a branding partner, we also make sure your…','textarea','',23,0,'2026-10-26 00:59:59','2026-10-26 00:59:59'),(2242,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~why-ilgj','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.5','Button text: Enquire Now','text','Request a Consultation',25,0,'2026-10-26 00:59:59','2026-10-26 00:59:59'),(2243,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~why-ilgj','Why Intelliworkz','why-intelliworkz.6','Button link: Enquire Now','url','contact-us.php',24,0,'2026-10-26 00:59:59','2026-10-26 00:59:59'),(2244,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~why-ilgj','Why Intelliworkz','card-numbers.1','Numbers on the cards (01, 02 …)','toggle','1',27,0,'2026-10-26 00:59:59','2026-10-26 00:59:59'),(2245,'3d-animation','Hero','hero.1','Image (hero-bg-d31711.png)','image','assets/images/video/hero-bg-d31711.png',1,0,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(2246,'3d-animation','Hero','hero.2','Image (floor-glow.png)','image','assets/images/video/floor-glow.png',2,0,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(2247,'3d-animation','Portfolio','portfolio.1','Image (pf-base-19393f.png)','image','assets/images/video/pf-base-19393f.png',15,0,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(2248,'3d-animation','Portfolio','portfolio.2','Image (pf-play.png)','image','assets/images/video/pf-play.png',16,0,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(2249,'3d-animation','Stats','stats.1','Image (stats-bg-1.png)','image','assets/images/video/stats-bg-1.png',17,0,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(2250,'3d-animation','Stat