uction.\"},{\"c\":\"#E31E36\",\"no\":\"02\",\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-2.png\",\"title\":\"Production-Ready Packaging Design\",\"text\":\"We develop packaging concepts with layouts, dielines and print requirements aligned to your product and production needs.\"},{\"c\":\"#141717\",\"no\":\"03\",\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-3.png\",\"title\":\"Confidential Artwork Handling\",\"text\":\"Product specifications, packaging concepts, artwork and supplied dielines are handled within the agreed workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-4.png\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Packaging formats, artwork deliverables, review rounds, deadlines and pricing are agreed before work begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-24 01:58:00'),(68,'packaging-design','pk_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/adobe-illustrator-6ttngtil.svg\",\"#54001A\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Design | Dieline\"],[\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/adobe-photoshop-0jukwxqi.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Mockup | Retouch\"],[\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/adobe-indesign-y0aeenhx.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Prepare\"]]',50,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-24 02:01:40'),(69,'packaging-design','pk_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Custom Packaging Design\",\"Packaging rollout\",\"Custom Box Packaging Design\",\"Product Label Design\",\"Packaging Concepts\",\"Brand Identity Integration\",\"Product Mockups & 3D Visualizations\"]},{\"title\":\"Packaging Rollout\",\"points\":[\"Approved artwork adapted across multiple SKUs\",\"Product variants and packaging formats\",\"Language and artwork localisation\"]}]',60,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(70,'packaging-design','pk_flow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"c\":\"#F6B700\",\"nx\":47.51,\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"iw\":296,\"ih\":222,\"title\":\"Discovery\",\"text\":\"Understand your products, packaging requirements, brand guidelines, production workflow, and project objectives.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"c\":\"#CF6CB9\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":212,\"title\":\"Design\",\"text\":\"Develop packaging concepts that balance creativity, functionality, and brand consistency.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"c\":\"#59B38D\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"iw\":287.34,\"ih\":198.77,\"title\":\"Packaging Rollout\",\"text\":\"Adapt approved artwork across multiple SKUs, product variants, languages, and packaging formats.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"c\":\"#7F68CE\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"iw\":296,\"ih\":211,\"title\":\"Pre-Press\",\"text\":\"Validate artwork, refine technical specifications, and prepare accurate print-ready files.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"nx\":31.01,\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":217,\"title\":\"Delivery\",\"text\":\"Deliver production-ready artwork that supports faster approvals and efficient manufacturing.\"}]',70,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(71,'packaging-design','pk_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Brand Identity & Design\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"Create a distinctive brand identity through consistent visual design, packaging graphics & creative elements that strengthen brand recognition across every customer touchpoint.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Marketing & Sales Collaterals\",\"img\":\"offer-2-56586a.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"Develop professionally designed brochures, catalogues, presentations and promotional materials that communicate your brand support your marketing and sales activities.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"img\":\"offer-3-56586b.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"Design consistent, brand-aligned corporate materials that help businesses communicate effectively through company profiles, internal publications, professional business documents.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Pre-Press Services\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"Validated artwork and accurate print-ready files, prepared for a smooth transition from design to press.\"}]',80,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(72,'packaging-design','pk_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What are packaging design services, and what do they include?\",\"Packaging design services encompass activities such as design of packaging, revisions on current packaging designs and artwork, and preparation of the design for printing. Services may include label design, packaging launch, artwork revision, pre-press assistance, and file preparation. The objective is to ensure that your packaging design is perfect and production-ready.\"],[\"How do I choose the right packaging design company?\",\"Select a design company that specializes in design and printing services. This partner will ensure the successful design of your packaging as well as update the artwork, and at the same time keep all packaging designs consistent.\"],[\"Do you offer custom box packaging design for unique product shapes?\",\"Yes, because we customize unique box packaging design as per your product needs, packaging needs, and your branding. No matter what kind of box packaging you need for your product, be it unique or regular, we will develop it for you.\"],[\"What makes a luxury packaging design agency different from a standard one?\",\"Luxury packaging design requires careful thought not only for content but also for the design itself. In terms of colour, typography, finishing, and layout \\u2013 every element of luxury packaging design needs consideration.\"],[\"Do you provide product label design along with packaging design?\",\"Yes, we provide label design as part of our packaging design solutions. We ensure that the label fits well within the packaging while remaining clear and consistent in terms of content.\"],[\"Can you redesign our existing packaging instead of starting from scratch?\",\"Yes, we can update your current packaging to make it look better, function better, or improve branding without needing to create a completely new design for you. We make sure that your packaging is still production-ready after updating it.\"]]',90,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-24 03:25:10'),(73,'ppt-design','ppt_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Corporate Presentation Design\",\"Sales & Pitch Decks\",\"Editable Presentation Templates\",\"Data Visualization & Infographics\"]',5,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(74,'ppt-design','ppt_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','[]',19,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-26 03:39:32'),(75,'ppt-design','ppt_thumbs','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"design-1.png\",\"cats\":\"investor business\"},{\"img\":\"design-2.png\",\"cats\":\"templates business\"}]',20,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(76,'ppt-design','ppt_stats_top','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"30\",\"Industries Served\"]]',30,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(77,'ppt-design','ppt_stats_bottom','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(78,'ppt-design','ppt_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"tint\":\"#B5DEEB\",\"no\":\"01\",\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House Presentation Designers\",\"text\":\"Our in-house team manages slide design, visual consistency, review rounds and presentation file delivery.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"tint\":\"#FFD5D9\",\"no\":\"02\",\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Story-Led Presentation Design\",\"text\":\"We structure your content into clear slides, visual hierarchy and charts that support the message.\"},{\"c\":\"#141717\",\"tint\":\"#666666\",\"no\":\"03\",\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Presentation Handling\",\"text\":\"Your business figures, draft presentations and internal messages are handled within the agreed project workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"tint\":\"#8DAC65\",\"no\":\"04\",\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Slide counts, design scope, review rounds, deadlines and pricing are agreed before design begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(79,'ppt-design','ppt_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"svg\",\"tool-powerpoint.svg\",null,\"Microsoft PowerPoint\",\"Design | Present\"],[\"mag\",\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Google Slides\",\"Build | Collaborate\"]],[[\"png\",\"tool-slides.png\",null,\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Simplify\"],[\"mag\",\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Enhance\"]],[[\"png\",\"tool-keynote.png\",null,\"Apple Keynote\",\"\"]]]',50,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(80,'ppt-design','ppt_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Business and Sales\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Sales and pitch presentations\",\"Company profiles and capability decks\",\"Product and service presentations\",\"Proposal and tender decks\"]},{\"title\":\"Investor and Corporate\",\"points\":[\"Investor and fundraising pitch decks\",\"Board and management presentations\",\"Annual and financial review decks\",\"Conference and keynote presentations\"]},{\"title\":\"Templates and Internal\",\"points\":[\"Custom PowerPoint design templates your team can reuse\",\"Training and onboarding decks\",\"Internal and town-hall presentations\",\"Report and data-heavy presentations\"]}]',60,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(81,'ppt-design','ppt_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"step-1.png\",25.96,83.58,165.86,122.08,\"Brief\",\"We start with your content, your audience, and what you need the presentation to achieve, so the design has a clear purpose from the outset.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"step-2.png\",25.2,100.31,167.37,88.62,\"Structure\",\"We shape the story and the slide flow, making sure the message is clear and builds in the right order before any design begins.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"step-3.png\",20,95.62,164.91,98,\"Design\",\"We design each slide to your brand, turning your content into clean, clear visuals and simplifying anything dense or hard to follow.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"step-4.png\",16.64,96,167.37,97.23,\"Your feedback\",\"You review the deck, and we refine it across the revision rounds we agree upfront.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"step-5.png\",10.5,90.29,167.29,108.66,\"Delivery\",\"We hand over fully editable files, ready to present, along with a reusable template where you need one.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"step-6.png\",23.7,97.44,170.37,94.37,\"Ongoing support\",\"Where you present regularly, we keep producing decks to the same standard as you need them, so your presentations stay consistent over time.\"]]',70,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(82,'ppt-design','ppt_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/logo-design-glssk2br-qxvx.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We create original, scalable logos with practical variations and editable files, helping your identity remain clear across print, digital and real-world applications.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Brand Identity &amp; Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/brand-identity-design-oklw0mbh-hn5p.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We bring logos, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system for print, screen and everyday touchpoints.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Marketing and Sales Collaterals\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/marketing-and-sales-collaterals-cmqaiy7h.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We design brochures, presentations, proposals, product sheets and case studies that keep sales and marketing materials clear and on-brand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/packaging-design-cdduhohq-gpcc.webp\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts, with production requirements in mind.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/campaign-concepts-ad-creatives-yajptult-pe20.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We shape the campaign idea, then carry it across banners, video and social creative so every format feels connected.\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/corporate-communication-egaswotl.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We align communication for employees, customers, investors and the public through clear strategy, messaging and supporting materials.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"08\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/ui-ux-design-gowtpvlc-oxt9.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We connect advertising strategy, creative, media and reporting so campaigns work toward a shared goal across platforms.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"09\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"img\":\"\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes.\",\"href\":\"\"}]',80,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-24 05:56:13'),(83,'ppt-design','ppt_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is included in your PPT design services?\",\"Content structuring, slide design, custom icons, charts and data visuals, and a finished deck built to your brand. We can also build a reusable template. You always receive fully editable files, and you can bring us raw content, a draft, or an existing deck to rebuild.\"],[\"In which file formats do you deliver the presentation?\",\"Usually PowerPoint (PPTX), Google Slides or Keynote, whichever you present in, plus PDF for sharing. All files are fully editable, so your team can update them later without coming back to us.\"],[\"Is it safe to outsource confidential presentation content?\",\"Yes. Every presentation is handled by our in-house team under confidentiality agreements, and we do not pass work to freelancers or outside teams. Your content, financials, and business information stay within our team.\"],[\"What types of PowerPoint presentations do you design?\",\"Pitch and investor decks, sales and corporate presentations, company profiles, board and management decks, training material and conference keynotes. If it needs to inform or persuade an audience, we design it.\"],[\"Can I outsource PowerPoint design to your team?\",\"Yes. Businesses outsource PowerPoint design to us to save time and get a professional, consistent result. Our team works in your preferred shift, so delivery stays reliable wherever you are based.\"],[\"Do you design pitch decks and investor presentations?\",\"Yes, and this is some of our most requested work. We structure the story, present your numbers clearly, and design a deck that holds an investor\'s attention, so your idea comes across as clearly as it deserves to.\"]]',90,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(84,'pre-press-service','pp_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Print-Ready Files\",\"Packaging Rollout\",\"Packaging Artwork\",\"Design Adaptation\"]',5,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-26 01:46:06'),(85,'pre-press-service','pp_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','[]',19,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-26 01:47:35'),(86,'pre-press-service','pp_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"packaging\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"commercial\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"digital\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"colour\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"packaging commercial\"}]',20,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(87,'pre-press-service','pp_stats_top','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"30\",\"Industries Served\"]]',30,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(88,'pre-press-service','pp_stats_bottom','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(89,'pre-press-service','pp_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"tint\":\"#B5DEEB\",\"no\":\"01\",\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House Pre-Press Team\",\"text\":\"Every artwork file is prepared and checked by our experienced in-house pre-press specialists, with no freelancers or subcontracting.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"tint\":\"#FFD5D9\",\"no\":\"02\",\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Dedicated Project Team\",\"text\":\"The same or similarly skilled specialists work across your print projects, maintaining technical accuracy and consistency without repeated briefing.\"},{\"c\":\"#141717\",\"tint\":\"#666666\",\"no\":\"03\",\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Data Security & Confidentiality\",\"text\":\"Your artwork files, packaging designs and confidential production information are handled securely within our in-house team.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"tint\":\"#8DAC65\",\"no\":\"04\",\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Flexible & Transparent Pricing\",\"text\":\"Choose an engagement model that suits your pre-press requirements, with the scope, timelines and pricing agreed before work begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(90,'pre-press-service','pp_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"mag\",\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Vector | Prepare\"],[\"png\",\"tool-esko-artpro.png\",null,\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Preflight\"],[\"svg\",\"tool-gmg.svg\",null,\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Retouch | Prepare\"]],[[\"mag\",\"tool-indesign.svg\",\"#54001A\",\"Adobe Acrobat Pro\",\"Preflight | Proof\"],[\"png\",\"tool-esko-automation.png\",null,\"Esko ArtPro+\",\"\"],[\"png\",\"tool-pitstop.png\",null,\"Esko Automation Engine\",\"\"]],[[\"mag\",\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"GMG Color Management\",\"\"],[\"mag\",\"tool-acrobat.svg\",\"#B40B00\",\"Pitshop Pro\",\"\"]]]',50,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-26 01:51:37'),(91,'pre-press-service','pp_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Artwork Verification &amp; File Preparation\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Prior to beginning production, all artwork is checked for the sizes, resolution, fonts, profiles, bleed setup, and print specifications.\"},{\"title\":\"Colour Management\",\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Getting the color right to keep branding consistent. We also colour profile artwork, balance your files, and have them colour-balanced, ready for the chosen printing method.\"},{\"title\":\"Print Proofing\",\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Proofing in print is important so we can ensure nothing will go wrong during a bulk run! We supply both digital and production proofs to ensure layouts, color, text placement, and overall print will look as expected.\"},{\"title\":\"Packaging Pre-Press\",\"points\":[],\"para\":\"The level of technical finesse in packaging is one of higher expertise, and we specialize in preparing artwork for cartons, labels, flexible packages, sleeves, and our client\\u2019s product packaging, paying keen attention to the dielines, trapping, overprints, and finishing for the final production stages.\"},{\"title\":\"Commercial Print Preparation\",\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Let\\u2019s move that content online\\u2026 or the other way around! Whether you need anything from catalogues and brochures to leaflets, posters, yearly reports, or just about any general marketing material, our reports-ready art is created to commercial standards and minimizes errors, which save you money on your print production.\"},{\"title\":\"Digital Pre-Press Services\",\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Short runs, printing on demand, variable data printing \\u2013 our digital pre-press services cover your digital printing workflow completely, and your files are prepared and adjusted specifically for the print and their associated RIPs.\"}]',60,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-26 01:54:39'),(92,'pre-press-service','pp_flow','Process','Process cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"bg\":\"#EFF7FA\",\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"Artwork Review\",\"text\":\"First, we examine your design files. We then use the dimensions, specifications, and production guidelines for the print run and the colors you require to check for any problems before the file gets into production.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"bg\":\"#FAEFEF\",\"c\":\"#CF6CB9\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"File Preparation\",\"text\":\"After that, artwork will be prepared, where we will be checking image quality and resolution, fonts used, bleed settings, profiles used, etc., and also overprinting and trapping will be checked; layout is also checked.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"bg\":\"#FAF6EF\",\"c\":\"#C9AC61\",\"iy\":263.23,\"title\":\"Proofing & Quality Checks\",\"text\":\"Digital proofs & pre-flights: they run a check for color(s), alignment(s), and typos and check for any technical problem(s) & omissions (the \\u2018pre\\u2019 phase for pre-press).\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"bg\":\"#EFF7FA\",\"c\":\"#59B38D\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"Print Optimization\",\"text\":\"The artwork file is adapted for the print method of choice (offset, flexo, gravure, or digital) so as to enable an accurate color result and efficient production.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"bg\":\"#FAEFFA\",\"c\":\"#7F68CE\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"Client Review & Approval\",\"text\":\"Final proofs are then sent out for production approval. Any necessary amendments are made to ensure artwork complies with specifications and the brand.\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"bg\":\"#FAF6EF\",\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"Production-Ready Delivery\",\"text\":\"Files are then delivered as final, ready-to-print; specifications will transition seamlessly to the printing stage.\"}]',70,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(93,'pre-press-service','pp_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Magazine Design\",\"img\":\"\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design editorial layouts, covers and recurring templates for print and digital magazines, maintaining a consistent reading experience across every issue.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Academic &amp; Technical Publishing Support\",\"img\":\"\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We assist with manuscript editing, journal-aligned formatting, technical figures and submission preparation while keeping your research content and intended meaning intact.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Multilingual Publishing &amp; Localization\",\"img\":\"\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We adapt page layouts, typography and document formatting across languages, accounting for text expansion, reading patterns and production requirements.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Catalog\",\"img\":\"\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise product imagery, specifications and categories into clear, consistent catalogue layouts that help buyers compare options and find relevant information.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"InDesign Services\",\"img\":\"\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We create structured, editable layouts for brochures, reports, publications and catalogues, using consistent styles and print or digital output settings.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Newsletter Design\",\"img\":\"\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design branded newsletters for email and print, using clear hierarchy, reusable layouts and readable content blocks for recurring communication.\",\"href\":\"\"}]',80,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-26 01:59:35'),(94,'pre-press-service','pp_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What are pre-press services?\",\"Pre-press services prepare and check design files before printing. They help identify issues with layout, images, colour, fonts and production settings that could affect the printed result.\"],[\"What is included in professional pre-press services?\",\"Typical checks include page size, bleed and trim, image resolution, font handling, colour mode, overprint settings and print-ready PDF preparation. The exact checks depend on your printer&#039;s specifications and the job.\"],[\"How long does the pre-press process take?\",\"Timing depends on the number of files, pages or packaging variants and the corrections required. We review the supplied artwork and production specifications before confirming a turnaround.\"],[\"What software is used for pre-press?\",\"Adobe Acrobat Pro, InDesign, Illustrator and Photoshop are commonly used for checking, adjusting and preparing print files. The tools depend on the artwork format and production requirements.\"],[\"What industries use pre-press services?\",\"Businesses producing packaging, labels, catalogues, books, magazines, marketing collateral and other printed materials can benefit from pre-press checks before production.\"],[\"Do I need pre-press services for digital printing?\",\"Yes, digital printing also requires correctly prepared files. Resolution, page size, trim, bleed, fonts and colour settings should match the print provider&#039;s specifications to reduce preventable output issues.\"]]',90,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-26 02:06:09'),(95,'seo-services','seo_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Technical SEO Audits\",\"On-Page SEO Optimization\",\"Keyword & Content Strategy\",\"Search Performance Reporting\"]',5,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(96,'seo-services','seo_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"technical\":\"Technical SEO\",\"onpage\":\"On-Page & Content SEO\",\"offpage\":\"Off-Page SEO & Link Building\"}',19,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(97,'seo-services','seo_gallery','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"thumb-1.png\",\"cats\":\"technical\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-2.png\",\"cats\":\"onpage\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-3.png\",\"cats\":\"offpage\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-4.png\",\"cats\":\"technical onpage\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-5.png\",\"cats\":\"onpage offpage\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-featured.png\",\"cats\":\"technical offpage\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-6.png\",\"cats\":\"technical\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-7.png\",\"cats\":\"onpage\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-8.png\",\"cats\":\"offpage\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-9.png\",\"cats\":\"technical onpage\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-10.png\",\"cats\":\"onpage offpage\"}]',20,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(98,'seo-services','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(99,'seo-services','seo_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House SEO Specialists\",\"text\":\"Our in-house SEO and development teams coordinate audits, implementation, quality checks and performance reporting.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"no\":\"02\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Technical and Content SEO\",\"text\":\"We combine technical reviews, on-page improvements and search intent research into a focused optimization plan.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-charcoal)\",\"no\":\"03\",\"noa\":0.15,\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Website Data Handling\",\"text\":\"Website access, analytics information and audit findings are handled within the agreed SEO workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Audit scope, optimization activities, reporting cadence and fees are agreed before SEO work begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(100,'seo-services','seo_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"tool-gsc.png\",\"Google Search Console\",\"Monitor | Optimise\"],[\"tool-gtm.png\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Manage | Track\"],[\"tool-ahrefs.svg\",\"Ahrefs\",\"Backlinks | Research\"]],[[\"tool-gbp.png\",\"Google Business Profile\",\"Local | Visibility\"],[\"tool-bing.png\",\"Bing Webmaster\",\"Index | Monitor\"],[\"tool-screamingfrog.png\",\"Screaming Frog\",\"Crawl | Audit\"]],[[\"tool-ga4.png\",\"Google Analytics 4\",\"Track | Analyse\"],[\"tool-semrush.png\",\"Semrush\",\"Research | Analyse\"],[\"tool-surfer.svg\",\"Surfer\",\"Content | Optimise\"]]]',50,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(101,'seo-services','seo_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Technical SEO\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Site architecture and crawlability\",\"Core Web Vitals and page speed\",\"Schema and structured data\",\"Indexation management\",\"JavaScript SEO\",\"Site-health monitoring\"]},{\"title\":\"On-Page &amp; Content SEO\",\"points\":[\"Keyword and intent mapping\",\"On-page optimisation\",\"Internal linking structure\",\"SEO content and copywriting\",\"Topical authority building\"]},{\"title\":\"Off-Page SEO &amp; Link Building\",\"para\":\"As a B2B SEO agency, we are comfortable with long, considered buying cycles where technical buyers research for weeks before they enquire. And as an international SEO agency, we handle multi-language, multi-region rollouts with hreflang and market-specific content.\",\"points\":[\"Digital PR and editorial outreach\",\"Backlink strategy and vetting\",\"Brand-authority building\",\"Competitor link analysis\",\"Local and international link acquisition\"]}]',60,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(102,'seo-services','seo_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"art\":[-0.92,0,301.84,300],\"title\":\"Discover\",\"text\":\"Understand your business, market, competitors, target audience, and commercial objectives.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"art\":[0,31.19,300,237.61],\"title\":\"Audit\",\"text\":\"Assess technical health, content gaps, backlink profile, and ranking opportunities in a clear, prioritised report.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Strategy\",\"text\":\"Build a keyword and content roadmap mapped to buyer intent and ranked by commercial impact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Execution\",\"text\":\"Implement technical fixes, on-page optimisation, content, and authority building against the roadmap.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"text\":\"Deliver transparent monthly reporting tied to traffic, leads, and revenue, with clear next steps.\"}]',70,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(103,'seo-services','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Digital Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We coordinate search, paid advertising, social campaigns, content and measurement to help businesses reach relevant audiences and turn attention into enquiries.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"AEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise content around customer questions, clear answers and structured signals that make information easier for search engines and assistants to understand.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"GEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We strengthen content structure, entity information and technical signals to help AI-powered discovery systems understand and reference your brand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Content Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We plan, research and develop useful content for each stage of the buyer journey, aligned with your audience, brand voice and search goals.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Lead Generation Campaigns\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We build and manage campaigns around your ideal customers, agreed lead criteria and measurable enquiries, connecting acquisition channels with follow-up workflows.\"}]',80,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(104,'seo-services','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is included in your SEO services?\",\"A technical audit to begin with, then keyword and content strategy, on-page optimisation, content production, link building, and monthly reporting. The technical fixes get implemented by our own developers rather than handed back to you as a to-do list. Scope is agreed upfront, based on what you are trying to achieve.\"],[\"What engagement models do you offer for SEO outsourcing?\",\"Three of them. A Monthly SEO Retainer, where we run the programme end-to-end. An FTE model, where dedicated resources work 40 hours a week on your account alone, in your preferred shift. And a GCC model, where we build and operate an offshore team for you and handle compliance, infrastructure, and hiring.\"],[\"How is your SEO outsourcing model different from hiring a freelancer or building an in-house team?\",\"We are an established business and operate from a state of the art infrastructure that supports scalability. We take complete ownership and accountability for projects that we sign-up. A freelancer is more suited if you are looking for one specific skill. Hiring an in-house team is time consuming and adds to the overall operational overheads.\"],[\"Can your team work in our time zone?\",\"Yes. Resources work in your preferred shift, whether that is US, UK, or Gulf hours. Plenty of clients use the overlap for daily standups and the offset for overnight delivery, so work keeps progressing while their own team sleeps.\"],[\"Do you only work with a specific industry?\",\"No. We are deepest in Manufacturing, MSMEs, Startups, Financial Services, and FMCG, but the methodology adapts. Over 18 years we have worked with more than 1,200 clients across 30+ industry domains.\"],[\"How do you measure SEO success?\",\"On what matters commercially: qualified leads, conversions, and revenue from organic search. Rankings and traffic get tracked too, but as leading indicators rather than the headline. Every monthly report ties performance back to the pipeline.\"],[\"How long does SEO take to show results?\",\"Most clients see measurable movement inside three to four months. Competitive terms can take six to twelve months to reach the top positions. We would rather set a realistic timeline at the start than promise quick wins we cannot deliver.\"],[\"Do you provide white-label SEO for agencies?\",\"Yes. We deliver under your brand, with NDA-protected confidentiality and reporting formatted so you can pass it straight to your clients.\"]]',90,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(105,'video-editing','ve_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Corporate Event Videos\",\"Corporate Films\",\"Social Media Reels\",\"YouTube Videos\"]',5,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(106,'video-editing','ve_form_fields','Enquiry form','Enquiry form fields','[[\"Full Name\",\"Enter your first name\",\"text\",\"name\"],[\"Company Name\",\"Enter your company name\",\"text\",\"company\"],[\"Email ID\",\"Enter your email ID\",\"email\",\"email\"],[\"Contact Number\",\"Enter your contact number\",\"tel\",\"phone\"]]',2,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(107,'video-editing','ve_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"editing\":\"Editing and Assembly\",\"finishing\":\"Finishing and Post\",\"delivery\":\"Delivery and Localisation\"}',19,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(108,'video-editing','ve_cards','Portfolio','Portfolio videos','[{\"title\":\"Brand Film\",\"meta\":\"Brand Films&nbsp; /&nbsp; Commercials\",\"cats\":\"editing\",\"overlay\":null,\"video\":\"uploads/videos/2026/10/hiring-video-new-trfkwnwb.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"meta\":\"Product Videos&nbsp; /&nbsp; Social\",\"cats\":\"finishing\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-1.png\",\"video\":\"https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Commercial\",\"meta\":\"Commercials&nbsp; /&nbsp; Brand Films\",\"cats\":\"delivery\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-2.png\",\"video\":\"https://interactive-examples.mdn.mozilla.net/media/cc0-videos/flower.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Event Film\",\"meta\":\"Events&nbsp; /&nbsp; Social\",\"cats\":\"editing finishing\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/AEICMeqa1B8\"}]',20,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-15 02:08:40'),(109,'video-editing','ve_stats_top','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"30\",\"Industries Served\"]]',30,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(110,'video-editing','ve_stats_bottom','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(111,'video-editing','ve_pillars','Why Intelliworkz','Feature cards','[{\"img\":\"feature-1.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"bg\":\"#EDF4FA\",\"x\":116.58,\"title\":\"Dedicated In-House Video Editors\",\"text\":\"A dedicated editing team maintains accountability, continuity, and quality control throughout the project, reducing the risks associated with fragmented freelance support\"},{\"img\":\"feature-2-19c91a.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"bg\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"x\":116.58,\"title\":\"Story-Driven Video Editing\",\"text\":\"We transform raw footage into engaging videos through precise sequencing, pacing, graphics, and sound, aligned with your brand, message, and audience.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-3.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #EDF2FC 0%, #FFFFFF 100%), #F5F5F5\",\"x\":56,\"title\":\"Confidential Footage Handling\",\"text\":\"Raw footage, recordings, personal data, and unpublished edits are handled securely and returned or deleted in accordance with agreed terms.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-4-68b7aa.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"bg\":\"#FEFEFE\",\"x\":77.82,\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Footage duration, deliverables, revision limits, timelines, and pricing are agreed upon before work begins, ensuring clarity and predictable project delivery\"}]',40,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(112,'video-editing','ve_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-premiere.png\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro\",\"Cut | Sequence\"],[\"tool-aftereffects.png\",\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Animate | Enhance\"],[\"tool-finalcut.png\",\"Final Cut Pro\",\"Edit | Export\"],[\"tool-davinci.png\",\"DaVinci Resolve\",\"Grade | Finish\"],[\"tool-audition.png\",\"Adobe Audition\",\"Clean | Mix\"],[\"tool-frameio-1658d8.png\",\"Frame.io\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(113,'video-editing','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Editing and Assembly\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Footage review, take selection, and story structure\",\"Multi-camera synchronisation\",\"Pacing, sequencing, and narrative construction\",\"Versioning for different durations and placements\"]},{\"title\":\"Finishing and Post\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Colour correction and professional colour grading\",\"Audio cleanup, noise reduction, sound design, and mixing\",\"Music integration and voiceover placement\",\"Motion graphics, titles, lower-thirds, and visual effects\"]},{\"title\":\"Delivery and Localisation\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Subtitling, captions, and multilingual translation\",\"Platform-specific exports in the required aspect ratios\",\"4K and higher-resolution workflows\",\"Delivery in the formats set out in your technical specification\"]}]',60,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(114,'video-editing','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"step-art-1.png\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Brief and goal\",\"We start by agreeing on what the video is for, who it is for, and where it will be shown. Everything after this follows from it.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"step-art-2.png\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Footage review\",\"We go through all your raw footage, pick the best material, and plan the edit before we start.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"step-art-3.png\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"First cut\",\"We put together the first version so you can see the structure and pacing early.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"step-art-4.png\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Refinement\",\"We add color grading, sound, motion graphics, and final timing to complete the video.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"step-art-5.png\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Your review\",\"You share your feedback, and we make the changes for as many rounds as you need.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"step-art-6.png\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Final delivery\",\"We export the video in every resolution and aspect ratio you need, ready for each platform.\"]]',70,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(115,'video-editing','ve_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Motion Graphics\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"text\":\"We create animated typography, illustrations and graphic sequences that make messages more engaging while maintaining your brand\'s visual style.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Explainer Videos\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-2-56586a.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We turn products, services and complex ideas into understandable video stories through scripting, storyboards, visual design and animation.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-3-56586b.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"text\":\"We create product-focused videos that demonstrate features, benefits and real-world use, helping audiences understand what the product does and why it matters.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Social Media Reels\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We edit short-form videos with purposeful pacing, captions and platform-appropriate formats that keep your message clear and visually consistent.\"}]',80,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(116,'video-editing','ve_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What video editing services do professional video editing companies offer?\",\"Editing and assembly, colour grading, audio, motion graphics, subtitling, and platform-ready exports.\"],[\"What are the different types of video editing?\",\"Brand films, commercials, product videos, explainer videos, documentaries, events, and social content - we create content across a range of formats and lengths.\"],[\"What video editing software do you use?\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro, After Effects, Final Cut Pro, DaVinci Resolve and Frame.io, supported by AI-assisted tools.\"],[\"How long does the editing process take?\",\"It depends on the amount of footage and the complexity of the edit, but a delivery date is always guaranteed before work starts.\"],[\"What is included in video post-production services?\",\"All post-shoot work, that is, the editing, colour, audio, motion graphics, subtitles, revisions, and final delivery files.\"],[\"How do you handle feedback, revisions, and creative direction?\",\"You provide feedback at every stage, the content follows your style guide, and we agree on the number of revision rounds in advance.\"]]',90,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(117,'global','offices','Offices','Office cards in the footer','[{\"flag\":\"flag-india.svg\",\"map\":\"map-india.png\",\"map_opacity\":\".4\",\"name\":\"India\",\"address\":\"Block-B, B912-A, World Trade Tower, Nr. BMW Showroom, SG Highway, Ahmedabad - 380051 Gujarat - India.\",\"phone\":\"+91 92740 02997 , +91 92740 02997\"},{\"flag\":\"flag-usa.svg\",\"map\":\"map-usa-35ebcb.png\",\"map_opacity\":\".4\",\"name\":\"USA\",\"address\":\"5511, Mercier Street,<br>Lewis Center, <br>Ohio 43035\",\"phone\":\"+1 614 999 2286\"},{\"flag\":\"flag-dubai.svg\",\"map\":\"map-dubai.png\",\"map_opacity\":\".5\",\"name\":\"Dubai\",\"address\":\"Office No. 25, 13th Floor, Al Saqar Business Tower, Nr. Future Museum, Sheikh Zayed Road, Dubai, UAE.\",\"phone\":\"+971 56 343 5362\"}]',1,'2026-10-12 04:39:02','2026-10-12 05:11:49'),(174,'2-animaiton','td_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Precision-Driven 3D Modeling\",\"Photorealistic Rendering\",\"Production-Ready 3D Assets\",\"Flexible 3D Workflows\"]',5,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(175,'2-animaiton','td_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"wireframe\":\"Wireframe\",\"material\":\"Material Study\",\"detail\":\"Detail View\",\"360\":\"360\\u00b0 View\",\"exploded\":\"Exploded View\"}',19,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(176,'2-animaiton','td_gallery','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"gallery-1.png\",\"cats\":\"detail\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-2.png\",\"cats\":\"wireframe detail\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-3.png\",\"cats\":\"wireframe\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-4.png\",\"cats\":\"material\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-5.png\",\"cats\":\"material detail\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-featured-4b403a.png\",\"cats\":\"360 exploded\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-6.png\",\"cats\":\"material\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-7.png\",\"cats\":\"detail\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-8.png\",\"cats\":\"material\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-9.png\",\"cats\":\"exploded\"},{\"img\":\"gallery-10.png\",\"cats\":\"exploded detail\"}]',20,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(177,'2-animaiton','td_stats_top','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"30\",\"Industries Served\"]]',30,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(178,'2-animaiton','td_stats_bottom','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(179,'2-animaiton','td_benefit_cards','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"icon\":\"benefit-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"title\":\"In-house 3D Team\",\"text\":\"All 3D modeling and rendering work is handled by our in-house team for consistent quality, control, and communication.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"icon\":\"benefit-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"title\":\"Dedicated project team\",\"text\":\"The same 3D artist or team works on your project from start to finish, carrying your materials, lighting, and quality standards forward without re-briefing.\",\"raised\":true},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"icon\":\"benefit-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-near-black)\",\"title\":\"Data security\",\"text\":\"Your content, files, and unpublished material are handled under strict security, kept within our team and never shared outside.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"icon\":\"benefit-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"title\":\"Transparent pricing\",\"text\":\"All design work produced entirely in-house: no freelancers, no subcontracting.\",\"raised\":false}]',40,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(180,'2-animaiton','td_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-vray.svg\",\"V-Ray and Corona\",\"Realistic Rendering\"],[\"tool-blender.svg\",\"Blender and Cycles\",\"Creative Flexibility\"],[\"tool-3dsmax.png\",\"3ds Max\",\"Precision Modelling\"],[\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Post Production\"]]',50,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(181,'2-animaiton','td_tool_formats_label','Tools','Formats label','[\"CAD and model formats\",\"Works with Your Pipeline\"]',51,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(182,'2-animaiton','td_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Product Rendering\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Studio-style product images for catalogues and eCommerce\",\"Lifestyle and in-context scenes that show the product in use\",\"Material, colour and finish variations from a single model\",\"Exploded views and close-up detail shots for technical clarity\"]},{\"title\":\"Commercial and Marketing\",\"points\":[\"Hero shots and campaign imagery built around your brand\",\"Consistent visuals across product ranges\",\"Assets sized and formatted for every channel\"]},{\"title\":\"Architectural and Interior\",\"points\":[\"Interior and exterior visualisations for approval and marketing\",\"Material and lighting studies for a space\",\"Walkthrough-ready scenes for presentations\"]}]',60,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(183,'2-animaiton','td_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1-160f4f.png\",\"title\":\"Your files.\",\"text\":\"You send a 3D model, a CAD file, or drawings. If you only have drawings, we build the model first. If the model is ready, we move straight to the scene, and we confirm how the images will be used.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2-51cdb9.png\",\"title\":\"Materials and lighting.\",\"text\":\"We apply accurate materials, colours and finishes to match the real product, then light the scene to suit the setting you want, from a clean studio background to a real-world environment.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"title\":\"Draft render.\",\"text\":\"You see a first version at working quality, so you can check the angle, materials and composition before we commit to the final output. Catching a change here saves time later.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4-293cbb.png\",\"title\":\"Review and adjust.\",\"text\":\"You give feedback on the draft, and we refine the materials, lighting, and framing within the agreed rounds. Changes at this stage are quick and inexpensive to make.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5-3348cf.png\",\"title\":\"Final delivery.\",\"text\":\"We render at full resolution, finish each image in post-production, and deliver the files in the sizes and formats you need for print, web, eCommerce, or presentation.\"}]',70,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(184,'2-animaiton','td_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Demo Videos\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"Show how your product works through clear demonstrations created with accurate 3D models and rendered scenes.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"3D Animation\",\"img\":\"offer-2-56586a.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"Bring products, mechanisms and concepts to life with animated sequences that explain movement, assembly and function.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Visual merchandise\",\"img\":\"offer-3-56586b.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"Create polished retail and campaign visuals that present products across displays, environments and promotional formats.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Technical Renders\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"Precise technical visuals for stakeholders and manufacturing partners, built directly from your CAD data.\"}]',80,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 00:57:40'),(185,'2-animaiton','td_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is 3D rendering?\",\"3D rendering is where we produce a photorealistic image or video of a 3D model. Software can add textures to it, a degree of lighting, plus minute details to complete the vision, which will look very real; almost photorealistic. Often used to visualize what an object, a space, or a building will look like before it is even built so that sales can take place in advance.\\nbold text\"],[\"Is 3D rendering difficult?\",\"The process itself takes specialist software and an experienced team, but for you it is straightforward: you send a model or drawings, review a draft, and give feedback within the agreed rounds.\"],[\"Will AI replace 3D rendering?\",\"AI tools can speed up parts of the process, but accurate materials, lighting, and finishing for a specific product or brand still need an experienced in-house team to get right.\"],[\"What software is best for 3D rendering?\",\"We work with V-Ray and Corona for realistic rendering, Blender and Cycles for creative flexibility, and 3ds Max for precision modelling, chosen to suit each project.\"],[\"Why should you use 3D rendering for your business?\",\"A photorealistic image lets a customer picture owning the product, lets a stakeholder sign off with confidence, and lets your marketing and sales teams start work before the product reaches a shelf.\"],[\"What is included in your 3D rendering services?\",\"Model preparation, materials and lighting, a draft render for review, refinement within the agreed rounds, and final delivery in the sizes and formats you need.\"]]',90,'2026-10-13 00:57:40','2026-10-13 01:00:16'),(186,'services','svc_sections','Service Groups','Service groups','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"btn\":\"Explore Services\",\"href\":\"contact-us.php\",\"tab\":\"Branding & Creative\",\"tag\":\"Branding & Creative\",\"title\":\"Build a brand people remember.\",\"text\":\"From brand foundations to digital experiences, we create identities and communication systems that connect with your audience and support you