ogos that reflect your business and remain clear from large signage to small app icons. Each logo is supplied in practical versions and file formats for print and digital use.\",\"href\":\"logo-design\"},{\"title\":\"Brand Identity &amp; Design\",\"text\":\"We bring your logo, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system. The identity is designed to work across websites, packaging, business cards, print and digital touchpoints.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts. Design and adaptation are handled with production requirements in mind, supporting a smooth transition from concept to press.\",\"href\":\"packaging-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"text\":\"We develop the core campaign idea and creative direction before designing individual assets. The approved concept is carried across banners, video and social formats so the campaign feels connected.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"text\":\"We help shape how your business communicates with employees, customers, investors and the public. Strategy, messaging and supporting materials keep communication clear and consistent across audiences.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"text\":\"We structure and design presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication. Clear visual hierarchy helps the audience follow your message, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"ppt-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"text\":\"We bring strategy, creative, media planning and reporting together in one connected advertising process. Campaigns are planned, produced and measured against a shared objective.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes. The process covers websites, mobile apps and other digital products.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"}]',80,'2026-10-13 07:39:06','2026-10-24 04:10:35'),(249,'case-study','cs_profile','Hero','Client box (hero)','[{\"title\":\"Client profile\",\"text\":\"UAE-based diversified business conglomerate with a growing network of businesses\"},{\"title\":\"Industries served\",\"text\":\"Diversified business conglomerate & investment group\"},{\"title\":\"Market reach\",\"text\":\"Stakeholders, partners and customers across multiple verticals\"}]',6,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(250,'case-study','cs_stats','Numbers','Headline numbers','[{\"title\":\"10\",\"text\":\"Services delivered\"},{\"title\":\"6\",\"text\":\"Approach initiatives executed\"},{\"title\":\"5\",\"text\":\"Core challenges addressed\"},{\"title\":\"1\",\"text\":\"Unified identity across every business vertical\"}]',10,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(251,'case-study','cs_highlights','01 Industry Overview','Key highlights','[{\"title\":\"Unified identity\",\"text\":\"One cohesive visual identity for the entire group.\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate website\",\"text\":\"A modern website showcasing its diverse businesses.\"},{\"title\":\"Clear structure\",\"text\":\"Content structured to communicate multiple industry verticals clearly.\"},{\"title\":\"Consistent voice\",\"text\":\"Corporate presentations and social media aligned with the brand identity.\"}]',20,'2026-10-23 03:52:36','2026-10-23 03:52:36'),(252,'case-study','cs_challenges','02 The Challenge','Challenges','[{\"title\":\"Fragmented experience\",\"text\":\"Diverse business verticals lacked a unified brand experience.\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate positioning\",\"text\":\"The group needed stronger corporate positioning.\"},{\"title\":\"Complex offerings\",\"text\":\"Complex offerings required clearer digital communication.\"},{\"title\":\"Incons