7F68CE\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"iw\":296,\"ih\":211,\"title\":\"Pre-Press\",\"text\":\"Validate artwork, refine technical specifications, and prepare accurate print-ready files.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"nx\":31.01,\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":217,\"title\":\"Delivery\",\"text\":\"Deliver production-ready artwork that supports faster approvals and efficient manufacturing.\"}]',70,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 05:45:40'),(269,'brand-identity-and-design','pk_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/logo-design-vrdx5nfr.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We create original, scalable logos with practical variations and editable files, helping your identity remain clear across print, digital and real-world applications.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Marketing and Sales Collaterals\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/marketing-and-sales-collaterals-cmqaiy7h.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We design brochures, presentations, proposals, product sheets and case studies that keep sales and marketing materials clear and on-brand.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/packaging-design-4wftaetb.webp\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts, with production requirements in mind.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/campaign-concepts-ad-creatives-vvodbfkq.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We shape the campaign idea, then carry it across banners, video and social creative so every format feels connected.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/corporate-communication-cmnlcchm.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We align communication for employees, customers, investors and the public through clear strategy, messaging and supporting materials.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/ppt-design-j41qumgd.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We structure and design clear presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/advertising-services-474efjos.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We connect advertising strategy, creative, media and reporting so campaigns work toward a shared goal across platforms.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/ui-ux-design-ipiud4an.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes.\",\"href\":\"\"}]',80,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-24 04:02:35'),(270,'brand-identity-and-design','pk_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is included in your brand identity design services?\",\"Our full system includes: your brand strategy and positioning, logo and a logo system, colour palette, typography, a photographic style and brand guidelines. We also go on to create the day-to-day stationery and collateral that your organisation uses.\"],[\"How long does it take to develop a complete brand identity?\",\"A full identity could take a matter of three to six weeks to design, depending on scale and number of items being designed for. Less detailed projects execute faster and are always preceded by mutually agreeable timelines, so you understand each part of the process.\"],[\"Do you offer brand identity design for startups as well as established companies?\",\"For startups, we will create it from zero; for established brands, we will build on what you have already got. That fits with your brand right where it is - whether that is a brand from scratch that just wants to get better at growing up or you have a grown-up brand that needs us for a specific project.\"],[\"What&#039;s the difference between a logo design and a full brand identity package?\",\"A logo is a single element. A brand identity consists of everything to do with that element: the brand colours, typefaces, graphics, and also voice and manner - all bundled up in identity guidelines. A logo is just another name for the company identity. A brand cannot be consistent unless there&#039;s a completely unified and comprehensive corporate identity.\"],[\"Can you redesign or refresh an existing brand identity (rebranding)?\",\"We provide rebranding services for everything from a simple update of your brand visuals to a comprehensive rebrand if your business has shifted to a new focus, starting by analyzing where your brand is already working well and where it isn\\u2019t.\"],[\"What are the tools that you use in building brand identity?\",\"Mainly the Adobe suite: Illustrator for logo systems and vector work, Photoshop for imagery, and InDesign for guidelines and print collateral, with Figma for digital templates. This keeps your identity consistent across both print and screen.\"],[\"Do you provide brand identity design services for international or multi-region businesses?\",\"We create identities ready to work across regions, languages, and markets - with guidelines that help make the brand look and feel coherent wherever it&#039;s used. Our approach to business branding can help if your company manages a single brand for different geographic locations and teams.\"]]',90,'2026-10-23 05:45:40','2026-10-23 07:41:07'),(271,'brand-identity-and-design~work-kxzx','cl_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','[]',19,'2026-10-23 05:46:22','2026-10-26 03:35:54'),(272,'brand-identity-and-design~work-kxzx','cl_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"assets/images/brand-identity/work-1.webp\",\"cats\":\"brochures\"},{\"img\":\"assets/images/brand-identity/work-2.webp\",\"cats\":\"sales\"},{\"img\":\"assets/images/brand-identity/work-3.webp\",\"cats\":\"digital\"},{\"img\":\"assets/images/brand-identity/work-4.webp\",\"cats\":\"brochures sales\"},{\"img\":\"assets/images/brand-identity/work-5.webp\",\"cats\":\"sales digital\"},{\"img\":\"assets/images/brand-identity/work-6.webp\",\"cats\":\"\"},{\"img\":\"assets/images/brand-identity/work-7.webp\",\"cats\":\"\"},{\"img\":\"assets/images/brand-identity/work-8.webp\",\"cats\":\"\"}]',20,'2026-10-23 05:46:22','2026-10-23 07:17:28'),(273,'brand-identity-and-design~why-uaws','td_benefit_cards','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"icon\":\"benefit-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"title\":\"Dedicated Brand Identity Team\",\"text\":\"Our in-house designers coordinate your brand identity from initial direction through guidelines and final asset delivery.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"icon\":\"benefit-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"title\":\"Strategy-Led Brand Systems\",\"text\":\"We manage your brand identity from initial creative direction to comprehensive brand guidelines and final asset delivery, ensuring consistency, clarity, and alignment with your business objectives at every stage\",\"raised\":true},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"icon\":\"benefit-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-near-black)\",\"title\":\"Confidential Brand Asset Handling\",\"text\":\"The brand guideline documents, identity concepts, and source files files are developed, managed, and delivered through a structured workflow as per agreed timelines.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"icon\":\"benefit-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Deliverables list, QC process, Timelines and Pricing are mutually agreed before the project starts.\",\"raised\":false}]',40,'2026-10-23 05:47:39','2026-10-23 06:08:59'),(274,'brand-identity-and-design~tools-xjvk','ppt_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"svg\",\"assets/images/brand-identity/tools/adobe-indesign.svg\",null,\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Publish\"],[\"mag\",\"assets/images/brand-identity/tools/adobe-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Create\"]],[[\"png\",\"assets/images/brand-identity/tools/figma.svg\",null,\"Figma\",\"Design | Prototype\"],[\"mag\",\"assets/images/brand-identity/tools/adobe-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Retouch\"]],[[\"png\",\"assets/images/brand-identity/tools/adobe-after-effects.svg\",null,\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Animate | Showcase\"]]]',50,'2026-10-23 05:48:45','2026-10-23 07:49:05'),(278,'logo-design','pk_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Custom, Original Concepts\",\"Works at Every Size\",\"Files for Every Use\",\"Consistent Logo Variations\"]',5,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(279,'logo-design','pk_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"rollout\":\"Packaging Rollout & Product Range Extensions\",\"beauty\":\"Beauty & Skincare Packaging\",\"food\":\"Food & Beverage Packaging\",\"appliance\":\"Appliance & Electronics Packaging\"}',19,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(280,'logo-design','pk_tiles','Gallery','Work grid','[{\"img\":\"tile-a.png\",\"x\":0,\"y\":0,\"w\":570,\"h\":685,\"ih\":615,\"rollout\":\"tile-b.png\",\"beauty\":\"tile-c.png\",\"food\":\"tile-d.png\",\"appliance\":\"tile-e.png\"},{\"img\":\"tile-b.png\",\"x\":585,\"y\":0,\"w\":600,\"h\":335,\"ih\":258,\"rollout\":\"tile-c.png\",\"beauty\":\"tile-d.png\",\"food\":\"tile-e.png\",\"appliance\":\"tile-f.png\"},{\"img\":\"tile-c.png\",\"x\":1200,\"y\":0,\"w\":600,\"h\":335,\"ih\":258,\"rollout\":\"tile-d.png\",\"beauty\":\"tile-e.png\",\"food\":\"tile-f.png\",\"appliance\":\"tile-a.png\"},{\"img\":\"tile-d.png\",\"x\":585,\"y\":350,\"w\":395,\"h\":335,\"ih\":258,\"rollout\":\"tile-e.png\",\"beauty\":\"tile-f.png\",\"food\":\"tile-a.png\",\"appliance\":\"tile-b.png\"},{\"img\":\"tile-e.png\",\"x\":995,\"y\":350,\"w\":395,\"h\":335,\"ih\":258,\"rollout\":\"tile-f.png\",\"beauty\":\"tile-a.png\",\"food\":\"tile-b.png\",\"appliance\":\"tile-c.png\"},{\"img\":\"tile-f.png\",\"x\":1405,\"y\":350,\"w\":395,\"h\":335,\"ih\":258,\"rollout\":\"tile-a.png\",\"beauty\":\"tile-b.png\",\"food\":\"tile-c.png\",\"appliance\":\"tile-d.png\"}]',20,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(281,'logo-design','pk_stats','Numbers','Statistics','[[[\"2500\",\"+\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"+\",\"Countries Served\"],[\"30\",\"+\",\"Industries Served\"]],[[\"18\",\"+\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"+\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"+\",\"Skilled Professionals\"]]]',30,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(282,'logo-design','pk_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-1.png\",\"title\":\"In-House Design Team\",\"text\":\"Every marketing and sales collateral piece is designed by our in-house team, with no freelancers or subcontracting.\"},{\"c\":\"#E31E36\",\"no\":\"02\",\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-2.png\",\"title\":\"Dedicated Design Team\",\"text\":\"The skilled designers work across your marketing materials, maintaining brand consistency without repeated briefing.\"},{\"c\":\"#141717\",\"no\":\"03\",\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-3.png\",\"title\":\"Data Security & Confidentiality\",\"text\":\"Your marketing plans, sales materials and confidential business information are handled securely within our in-house team.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-4.png\",\"title\":\"Flexible & Transparent Pricing\",\"text\":\"Choose an engagement model that suits your design requirements, with the scope and pricing agreed before work begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(283,'logo-design','pk_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/tool-illustrator.svg\",\"\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Create\"],[\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/tool-photoshop.svg\",\"\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Retouch\"],[\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/tool-indesign.svg\",\"\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Publish\"],[\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/tool-coreldraw.svg\",\"\",\"CorelDRAW\",\"Vector | Design\"]]',50,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(284,'logo-design','pk_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Logo Types We Design\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Wordmarks, where the business name itself forms the logo, as with Google\",\"Lettermarks, built from initials for longer company names\",\"Pictorial and icon marks, a single recognisable symbol\",\"Abstract marks, a custom shape that represents the brand\",\"Mascot logos, a character that gives the brand a face\",\"Combination marks, a name and symbol designed to work together\"]},{\"title\":\"What You Receive\",\"points\":[\"A choice of initial concepts to review\",\"Primary, horizontal, stacked and single-colour versions\",\"Every format you need: AI, EPS, SVG, PDF, PNG and JPG\",\"Colour codes for print and digital, so the logo stays consistent across media\",\"A short usage guide explaining how to apply the logo correctly\"]}]',60,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(285,'logo-design','pk_flow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"c\":\"#F6B700\",\"nx\":47.51,\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/process\\/step-1.webp\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":222,\"title\":\"Understanding Your Brand\",\"text\":\"We begin with a short brief covering what you do, who you serve, and how you want your business to be seen.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"c\":\"#CF6CB9\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/process\\/step-2.webp\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":222,\"title\":\"Concept Development\",\"text\":\"We design a set of initial logo concepts, each with a clear reason behind it, and share them for your review.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"c\":\"#59B38D\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/process\\/step-3.webp\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":222,\"title\":\"Your Feedback\",\"text\":\"You tell us which concepts work and which do not, and we talk through the options and directions together.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"c\":\"#7F68CE\",\"nx\":34.51,\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/process\\/step-4.webp\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":222,\"title\":\"Refinement\",\"text\":\"We develop your chosen concept, adjusting the type, colour and spacing until the logo is right for your brand.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"nx\":31.01,\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/process\\/step-5.webp\",\"iw\":310,\"ih\":222,\"title\":\"Final Delivery\",\"text\":\"We prepare every version and file format you need, along with your colour codes and a short usage guide.\"}]',70,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(286,'logo-design','pk_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Brand Identity & Design\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/offer\\/brand-identity-and-design.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We bring logos, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system for print, screen and everyday touchpoints.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Marketing and Sales Collaterals\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/offer\\/marketing-and-sales-collaterals.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We design brochures, presentations, proposals, product sheets and case studies that keep sales and marketing materials clear and on-brand.\",\"href\":\"marketing-sales-collaterals.php\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/offer\\/packaging-design.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts, with production requirements in mind.\",\"href\":\"packaging-design.php\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts & Ad Creatives\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/offer\\/campaign-concepts-and-ad-creatives.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We shape the campaign idea, then carry it across banners, video and social creative so every format feels connected.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/offer\\/corporate-communication.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We align communication for employees, customers, investors and the public through clear strategy, messaging and supporting materials.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Visual Identity Systems\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/offer\\/visual-identity-systems.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We unify colour, typography, imagery and graphic style, then define usage rules to keep every touchpoint consistent.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"no\":\"07\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/offer\\/ppt-design.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We structure and design clear presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"ppt-design.php\"},{\"no\":\"08\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/offer\\/advertising-services.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We connect advertising strategy, creative, media and reporting so campaigns work toward a shared goal across platforms.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"no\":\"09\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/offer\\/uiux-design.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"}]',80,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(287,'logo-design','pk_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is included in your logo design services?\",\"You also choose from either a selection of original ideas or your chosen idea fully refined into a logo, which we deliver to you in every format possible. In addition to our basic\\/horizontal and mono options and your colours and brief usage info, the source files will all be included.\"],[\"How much does professional logo design cost?\",\"Depending on the size of the project: a solo logo, or a logo together with a broader visual identity. Once you\\u2019ve defined this need, you\'ll know exactly what to pay from one of our logo packages \\u2013 no hidden extra charges when the work is done.\"],[\"How long does the logo design process take?\",\"Logos generally take 1 to 2 weeks to finalize based on the number of concepts and rounds of revision. We will agree with you on the project turnaround time and stick to it.\"],[\"Do you offer logo design for small businesses and startups?\",\"Definitely. A good portion of the logos we produce are for start-ups and expanding small businesses. We make the logo process straightforward and our logo pricing affordable so a first logo is manageable rather than daunting.\"],[\"What file formats will I receive with my logo?\",\"Vector files (AI, EPS, SVG and PDF) for printing and scaling to any size, and image files (PNG and JPG) for everyday digital use. CorelDRAW (CDR) files are available if your printer requires them.\"],[\"Can you redesign or refresh an existing logo?\",\"Depending on the brand, we might refresh an old one, keeping what our customers know and are used to, or start one from scratch if the brand has outgrown it. We start off looking at the pros and cons of the current logomark, the symbol, image, or graphic form.\"],[\"What tools do you use in logo design?\",\"Primarily Adobe Illustrator, so the logo is built as vector artwork that stays sharp at any size, supported by Photoshop for mockups and CorelDRAW where CDR files are needed.\"]]',90,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(288,'logo-design~work-kxzx','cl_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"wordmarks\":\"Wordmarks\",\"lettermarks\":\"Lettermarks\",\"symbol\":\"Symbol Marks\",\"combination\":\"Combination Marks\",\"redesign\":\"Logo Redesign\"}',19,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(289,'logo-design~work-kxzx','cl_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-1.webp\",\"cats\":\"wordmarks\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-2.webp\",\"cats\":\"wordmarks\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-3.webp\",\"cats\":\"combination\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-4.webp\",\"cats\":\"combination\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-5.webp\",\"cats\":\"wordmarks\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-6.webp\",\"cats\":\"wordmarks\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-7.webp\",\"cats\":\"combination\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-8.webp\",\"cats\":\"combination\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-9.webp\",\"cats\":\"combination\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-10.webp\",\"cats\":\"wordmarks\"},{\"img\":\"assets\\/images\\/logo-design\\/selected-work\\/work-11.webp\",\"cats\":\"combination\"}]',20,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:32:19'),(291,'logo-design~tools-xjvk','ppt_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"svg\",\"tool-powerpoint.svg\",null,\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Publish\"],[\"mag\",\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Create\"]],[[\"png\",\"tool-slides.png\",null,\"Figma\",\"Design | Prototype\"],[\"mag\",\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Retouch\"]],[[\"png\",\"tool-keynote.png\",null,\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Animate | Showcase\"]]]',50,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(292,'logo-design~services-scse','seo_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Technical SEO\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Site architecture and crawlability\",\"Core Web Vitals and page speed\",\"Schema and structured data\",\"Indexation management\",\"JavaScript SEO\",\"Site-health monitoring\"]},{\"title\":\"On-Page & Content SEO\",\"points\":[\"Keyword and intent mapping\",\"On-page optimisation\",\"Internal linking structure\",\"SEO content and copywriting\",\"Topical authority building\",\"Content optimised for AI answer engines\"]},{\"title\":\"Off-Page SEO & Link Building\",\"points\":[\"Digital PR and editorial outreach\",\"Backlink strategy and vetting\",\"Brand-authority building\",\"Competitor link analysis\",\"Local and international link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"B2B & International SEO\",\"points\":[\"Long, considered buying cycles\",\"Multi-language, multi-region rollouts\",\"Hreflang implementation\",\"Market-specific content\"]},{\"title\":\"Local SEO\",\"points\":[\"Google Business Profile management\",\"Local visibility and citations\",\"Local link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"SEO Reporting & Analytics\",\"points\":[\"Transparent monthly reporting\",\"Traffic, leads, and revenue tracking\",\"Clear next steps\"]}]',60,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(293,'logo-design~services-scse','seo_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"art\":[-0.92,0,301.84,300],\"title\":\"Discover\",\"text\":\"Understand your business, market, competitors, target audience, and commercial objectives.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"art\":[0,31.19,300,237.61],\"title\":\"Audit\",\"text\":\"Assess technical health, content gaps, backlink profile, and ranking opportunities in a clear, prioritised report.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Strategy\",\"text\":\"Build a keyword and content roadmap mapped to buyer intent and ranked by commercial impact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Execution\",\"text\":\"Implement technical fixes, on-page optimisation, content, and authority building against the roadmap.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"text\":\"Deliver transparent monthly reporting tied to traffic, leads, and revenue, with clear next steps.\"}]',70,'2026-10-23 06:19:51','2026-10-23 06:19:51'),(294,'logo-design~why-vopx','mg_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"noa\":0.25,\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"shadow\":true,\"border\":false,\"title\":\"Dedicated In-House Designers\",\"text\":\"Our skilled in-house team develops comprehensive brand guidelines and produces high volumes of accurate, production-ready vector artwork. Proficient in Adobe Illustrator, Photoshop, and CorelDRAW, our team delivers scalable design assets that maintain brand consistency across corporate stationery, print production, and diverse branding applications.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"no\":\"02\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"shadow\":true,\"border\":true,\"title\":\"Original Design Concepts\",\"text\":\"We create original logo concepts based on your business identity, target audience, brand values and design requirements.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-charcoal)\",\"no\":\"03\",\"noa\":0.15,\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"shadow\":false,\"border\":true,\"title\":\"Confidential File Handl