sign\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/brand-identity-design-oklw0mbh.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We bring logos, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system for print, screen and everyday touchpoints.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/packaging-design-cdduhohq.webp\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts, with production requirements in mind.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/campaign-concepts-ad-creatives-yajptult.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We shape the campaign idea, then carry it across banners, video and social creative so every format feels connected.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/corporate-communication-egaswotl.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We align communication for employees, customers, investors and the public through clear strategy, messaging and supporting materials.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/ppt-design-rhavyyqo.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We structure and design clear presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication, with 