 is continuous, we keep it consistent over time as your business grows.\"]]',70,'2026-10-24 05:15:25','2026-10-24 05:15:25'),(348,'corporate-communication~offers-lhpl','pk_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/logo-design-glssk2br-qxvx.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We create original, scalable logos with practical variations and editable files, helping your identity remain clear across print, digital and real-world applications.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Brand Identity &amp; Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/brand-identity-design-oklw0mbh-hn5p.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We bring logos, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system for print, screen and everyday touchpoints.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Marketing and Sales Collaterals\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/marketing-and-sales-collaterals-cmqaiy7h.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We design brochures, presentations, proposals, product sheets and case studies that keep sales and marketing materials clear and on-brand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/packaging-design-cdduhohq-gpcc.webp\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts, with production requirements in mind.\"},{\