ences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes.\",\"href\":\"\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 05:15:25','2026-10-24 05:30:44'),(349,'advertising-services','cl_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Advertising Strategy & Planning\",\"Print & Digital Advertising\",\"Campaign Creative Development\",\"Media Performance Reporting\"]',5,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(350,'advertising-services','cl_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','[]',19,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-26 03:38:44'),(351,'advertising-services','cl_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/01-xhcomaqn-ryqv.webp\",\"cats\":\"strategy\"},{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/02-mnmcnkyu-tf7m.webp\",\"cats\":\"creative\"},{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/03-ofvhxbeg-sjt4.webp\",\"cats\":\"media\"},{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/04-tserzl6t-wtvo.webp\",\"cats\":\"creative strategy\"},{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/05-6dzeoemt-vrbh.webp\",\"cats\":\"media creative\"}]',20,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(352,'advertising-services','cl_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-send.svg\",\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-briefcase.svg\",\"30\",\"Industries Served\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(353,'advertising-services','cl_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"num\":\"#53A2BC\",\"no\":\"01\",\"tab\":\"tab-1.svg\",\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-1.png\",\"title\":\"Consistent Brand Standard\",\"text\":\"We design brochures, presentations and proposals to share one clear visual standard across your sales and marketing materials.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"num\":\"#E32329\",\"no\":\"02\",\"tab\":\"tab-2.svg\",\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-2.png\",\"title\":\"Brand-Led Design\",\"text\":\"Each piece begins with your brand, so colours, typography and messaging stay aligned across every format.\"},{\"c\":\"#141717\",\"num\":\"#141717\",\"no\":\"03\",\"tab\":\"tab-3.svg\",\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-3.png\",\"title\":\"Reusable Templates\",\"text\":\"Editable templates help your team produce recurring materials faster while keeping layouts and brand details consistent.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"num\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"no\":\"04\",\"tab\":\"tab-4.svg\",\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-4.png\",\"title\":\"Print and Digital Files\",\"text\":\"Receive print-ready and digital files, with source files provided so your team can use and adapt the work.\"}]',40,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(354,'advertising-services','cl_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-indesign.svg\",\"#54001A\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Publish\"],[\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Create\"],[\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Retouch\"],[\"tool-ppt.png\",null,\"PowerPoint & Google Slides\",\"Design | Present\"],[\"tool-acrobat.svg\",\"#B40B00\",\"Adobe Acrobat\",\"Review | Share\"]]',50,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(355,'advertising-services','cl_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Marketing Material\",\"points\":[\"Brochures, flyers and leaflets\",\"Company profiles and corporate presentations\",\"Posters, banners and event material\",\"Product catalogues and datasheets\"],\"open\":true},{\"title\":\"Sales Material\",\"points\":[\"Sales decks and pitch presentations\",\"Proposals and quotation templates\",\"Case studies and one-pagers\",\"Product and price sheets\"]},{\"title\":\"Digital Collateral\",\"points\":[\"Editable presentation and document templates\",\"PDFs built for email and download\",\"Social media and campaign graphics\",\"Branded email and newsletter layouts\"]}]',60,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(356,'advertising-services','cl_flow','Process','Workflow steps','[{\"c\":\"#C42030\",\"seg\":0,\"img\":29.33,\"dot\":145,\"tx\":37,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"1. Brief\",\"text\":\"We begin with what you need, who it is for, and how your team will use it. That defines the format and the approach.\"},{\"c\":\"#CF6CB9\",\"seg\":304,\"img\":337.1,\"dot\":452.77,\"tx\":335.27,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"2. Brand and content\",\"text\":\"We work from your brand and your content, and address anything missing before design begins.\"},{\"c\":\"#59B38D\",\"seg\":608,\"img\":655.95,\"dot\":771.61,\"tx\":663.61,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"3. Design\",\"text\":\"We design the piece, or the template, and present it for your review.\"},{\"c\":\"#C9AC61\",\"seg\":912,\"img\":940.35,\"dot\":1056.02,\"tx\":948.02,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"4. Refinement\",\"text\":\"You share your feedback, and we refine it across the revision rounds we agree upfront.\"},{\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"seg\":1216,\"img\":1245.33,\"dot\":1361,\"tx\":1253,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"5. Delivery\",\"text\":\"We hand over print-ready and digital files, along with editable templates where you need them.\"},{\"c\":\"#7F68CE\",\"seg\":1520,\"img\":1568.76,\"dot\":1684.43,\"tx\":1554.93,\"tw\":269,\"title\":\"6. Ongoing partnership\",\"text\":\"Where the work is continuous, we keep producing new material to the same standard, so your brand stays consistent over time.\"}]',70,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(357,'advertising-services','cl_flow_next','Process','Arrow positions','[291,611,921,1241,1551]',100,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(358,'advertising-services','cl_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What types of advertising services do you offer?\",\"We cover the full campaign: strategy and planning, creative development, ad production for digital, social and print, media planning and management, and performance reporting. You can take the complete service or the specific parts you need, from a single campaign to ongoing advertising support.\"],[\"How can advertising services help my business grow?\",\"Great advertising reaches the target audience with the relevant message and persuades to action that will get your leads, sales, and awareness. By combining strategy, creative, and the delivery process, advertising outsourcing services reduce time and cost and ensure it stays consistent with the relevant message delivered in an organized process.\"],[\"What platforms do you run advertising campaigns on?\",\"We run digital campaigns across our own sites, social channels, and by working on your paid social campaigns, and have the in-house team to design campaigns in print or for any other channel you think is appropriate to speak to your customers in.\"],[\"How do you measure the performance of advertising campaigns?\",\"We align on our objectives as a campaign begins before monitoring our performance against them all - from reach to engagement, clicks to conversions. Since we’re an international advertising agency, our measurement is universal across all markets so performance can be easily compared, wherever your campaigns run.\"],[\"Do you provide reporting and analytics for advertising campaigns?\",\"Yes, you’ll get recurring reports that clearly connect your spend to your results, and provide clear recommendations and guidance for how to optimize. The reporting has been written with stakeholders in mind - not just technical people - so that the insights truly guide you to the next step.\"],[\"Can advertising services be customized for different industries?\",\"Yes, each campaign works around your business, audience, and target market so the way it works reflects what industry you’re in rather than a general approach. We have worked and provided advertising for various industries before, and the way it’s carried out changes per sector.\"]]',90,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(359,'advertising-services','ve_form_fields','Enquiry form','Enquiry form fields','[[\"Full Name\",\"Enter your full name\",\"text\",\"name\"],[\"Company Name\",\"Enter your company name\",\"text\",\"company\"],[\"Email ID\",\"Enter your email address\",\"email\",\"email\"],[\"Contact Number\",\"Enter your contact number\",\"tel\",\"phone\"]]',2,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(360,'advertising-services','cl_related','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','Related service cards','[{\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"text\":\"We design logos that reflect your business and remain clear from large signage to small app icons. Each logo is supplied in practical versions and file formats for print and digital use.\",\"href\":\"logo-design\"},{\"title\":\"Brand Identity &amp; Design\",\"text\":\"We bring your logo, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system. The identity is designed to work across websites, packaging, business cards, print and digital touchpoints.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts. Design and adaptation are handled with production requirements in mind, supporting a smooth transition from concept to press.\",\"href\":\"packaging-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"text\":\"We develop the core campaign idea and creative direction before designing individual assets. The approved concept is carried across banners, video and social formats so the campaign feels connected.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"text\":\"We help shape how your business communicates with employees, customers, investors and the public. Strategy, messaging and supporting materials keep communication clear and consistent across audiences.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"text\":\"We structure and design presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication. Clear visual hierarchy helps the audience follow your message, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"ppt-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"text\":\"We bring strategy, creative, media planning and reporting together in one connected advertising process. Campaigns are planned, produced and measured against a shared objective.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes. The process covers websites, mobile apps and other digital products.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(361,'advertising-services~stats-nzja','ve_stats_top','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"30\",\"Industries Served\"]]',30,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(362,'advertising-services~stats-nzja','ve_stats_bottom','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(364,'advertising-services~tools-q8lj','ppt_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"svg\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-indesign-eyqg02r3-23uo.svg\",null,\"Analytics and reporting tools\",\"Measure | Report\"],[\"mag\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-illustrator-nadzfphk-nsty.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Creative Suite\",\"Design | Produce\"]],[[\"png\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-photoshop-80ldktcz-6fre.svg\",null,\"Strategy and planning\",\"\"],[\"mag\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/powerpoint-and-google-slides-qp6m9cpr-yx5o.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Creative and design\",\"\"]],[[\"png\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-acrobat-8gfkudlb-5p0p.svg\",null,\"Digital advertising platforms\",\"\"]]]',50,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(365,'advertising-services~services-cqqg','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Strategy and Planning\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Advertising strategy and campaign planning\",\"Audience research and targeting\",\"Message and positioning development\",\"Budget and channel planning\"]},{\"title\":\"Creative Development\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Campaign concepts and creative direction\",\"Ad creative for digital, social and print\",\"Video and motion advertising\",\"Copywriting and campaign messaging\"]},{\"title\":\"Media and Delivery\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Media planning across digital and social platforms\",\"Campaign setup, launch and management\",\"Ongoing optimisation during the campaign\",\"Adaptation of creative for different markets and languages\"]}]',60,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(366,'advertising-services~services-cqqg','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"uploads/images/2026/10/01-qbdluuyc-b5zl.webp\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Discovery\",\"We start with your business, your audience, and what you need the advertising to achieve, so the strategy has a clear target from the outset.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"uploads/images/2026/10/02-ivobma9r-optj.webp\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Strategy\",\"We plan the campaign, the message, the platforms and the budget, before any creative is produced.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/03-atou7svd-6rj9.webp\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"Creative\",\"We develop the concept and produce the ads, built on your brand and shaped for each platform.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/04-ow2wzv5u-bugw.webp\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Launch\",\"We set up and launch the campaign, then manage it closely in the early stages.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/05-nk6rwzuy-fayo.webp\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Optimisation\",\"We track performance and adjust the campaign as it runs, so the budget works as hard as possible.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/06-mxeqzjlh-a3sm.webp\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Reporting\",\"We report on results against your goals, with clear insights to guide the next campaign.\"]]',70,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 05:40:18'),(367,'advertising-services~offers-lhpl','pk_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/logo-design-glssk2br-qxvx.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We create original, scalable logos with practical variations and editable files, helping your identity remain clear across print, digital and real-world applications.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Brand Identity &amp; Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/brand-identity-design-oklw0mbh-hn5p.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We bring logos, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system for print, screen and everyday touchpoints.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Marketing and Sales Collaterals\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/marketing-and-sales-collaterals-cmqaiy7h.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We design brochures, presentations, proposals, product sheets and case studies that keep sales and marketing materials clear and on-brand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/packaging-design-cdduhohq-gpcc.webp\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts, with production requirements in mind.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/campaign-concepts-ad-creatives-yajptult-pe20.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We shape the campaign idea, then carry it across banners, video and social creative so every format feels connected.\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/corporate-communication-egaswotl.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We align communication for employees, customers, investors and the public through clear strategy, messaging and supporting materials.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"08\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/advertising-services-c6o0oblq-pkoa.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We structure and design clear presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"09\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"img\":\"\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes.\",\"href\":\"\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 05:40:18','2026-10-24 06:08:45'),(368,'advertising-services~why-m7of','seo_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House Advertising Team\",\"text\":\"Our in-house team coordinates advertising strategy, campaign creatives, execution and reporting around your brief.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"no\":\"02\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Goal-Aligned Advertising Campaigns\",\"text\":\"We align campaign messaging, creative assets and channels with your audience, business objectives and planned budget.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-charcoal)\",\"no\":\"03\",\"noa\":0.15,\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Campaign Data Handling\",\"text\":\"Media plans, account information and draft advertising assets are handled within the agreed campaign workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Media budgets, creative deliverables, campaign dates and service fees are defined before launch.\"}]',40,'2026-10-24 05:42:56','2026-10-24 05:42:56'),(369,'ui-ux-design','cl_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Website Design\",\"Mobile App Design\",\"Web Application Design\",\"Interactive UI/UX Prototypes\"]',5,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(370,'ui-ux-design','cl_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\"}',19,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:42:20'),(371,'ui-ux-design','cl_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/01-xhcomaqn-8yeq.webp\",\"cats\":\"website\"},{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/02-mnmcnkyu-ztiu.webp\",\"cats\":\"enterprise\"},{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/03-ofvhxbeg-7d5p.webp\",\"cats\":\"cover\"},{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/04-tserzl6t-lko2.webp\",\"cats\":\"website enterprise\"},{\"img\":\"uploads/images/2026/10/05-6dzeoemt-yxkl.webp\",\"cats\":\"enterprise cover\"}]',20,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(372,'ui-ux-design','cl_metrics