& Google Slides\",\"Design | Present\"],[\"tool-acrobat.svg\",\"#B40B00\",\"Adobe Acrobat\",\"Review | Share\"]]',50,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(375,'ui-ux-design','cl_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Marketing Material\",\"points\":[\"Brochures, flyers and leaflets\",\"Company profiles and corporate presentations\",\"Posters, banners and event material\",\"Product catalogues and datasheets\"],\"open\":true},{\"title\":\"Sales Material\",\"points\":[\"Sales decks and pitch presentations\",\"Proposals and quotation templates\",\"Case studies and one-pagers\",\"Product and price sheets\"]},{\"title\":\"Digital Collateral\",\"points\":[\"Editable presentation and document templates\",\"PDFs built for email and download\",\"Social media and campaign graphics\",\"Branded email and newsletter layouts\"]}]',60,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(376,'ui-ux-design','cl_flow','Process','Workflow steps','[{\"c\":\"#C42030\",\"seg\":0,\"img\":29.33,\"dot\":145,\"tx\":37,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"1. Brief\",\"text\":\"We begin with what you need, who it is for, and how your team will use it. That defines the format and the approach.\"},{\"c\":\"#CF6CB9\",\"seg\":304,\"img\":337.1,\"dot\":452.77,\"tx\":335.27,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"2. Brand and content\",\"text\":\"We work from your brand and your content, and address anything missing before design begins.\"},{\"c\":\"#59B38D\",\"seg\":608,\"img\":655.95,\"dot\":771.61,\"tx\":663.61,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"3. Design\",\"text\":\"We design the piece, or the template, and present it for your review.\"},{\"c\":\"#C9AC61\",\"seg\":912,\"img\":940.35,\"dot\":1056.02,\"tx\":948.02,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"4. Refinement\",\"text\":\"You share your feedback, and we refine it across the revision rounds we agree upfront.\"},{\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"seg\":1216,\"img\":1245.33,\"dot\":1361,\"tx\":1253,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"5. Delivery\",\"text\":\"We hand over print-ready and digital files, along with editable templates where you need them.\"},{\"c\":\"#7F68CE\",\"seg\":1520,\"img\":1568.76,\"dot\":1684.43,\"tx\":1554.93,\"tw\":269,\"title\":\"6. Ongoing partnership\",\"text\":\"Where the work is continuous, we keep producing new material to the same standard, so your brand stays consistent over time.\"}]',70,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(377,'ui-ux-design','cl_flow_next','Process','Arrow positions','[291,611,921,1241,1551]',100,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(378,'ui-ux-design','cl_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is included in your UI/UX design services?\",\"The scope can cover user research, user journeys, information architecture, wireframes, interface design, interactive prototypes and developer-ready design files. We agree the deliverables for your website, application or digital product before work begins.\"],[\"How long does a UI/UX design project take?\",\"The timeline depends on the number of screens, product complexity, research requirements and review rounds. After understanding your scope, we provide a project plan with milestones for design and feedback.\"],[\"What is the difference between UI design and UX design?\",\"UX design focuses on how people move through and use a product, including its structure, flows and usability. UI design focuses on the visual interface, such as layout, typography, colour and interactive elements. Both work together.\"],[\"Which industries do you provide UI/UX design services for?\",\"We can design interfaces for business websites, mobile applications, SaaS products and enterprise systems. The research and design approach is adapted to your users, workflows and industry requirements.\"],[\"Do you work with international or remote clients?\",\"Yes. Project discussions, design reviews and file handovers can be managed remotely. We agree communication channels, review schedules and deliverables at the start.\"],[\"Do you design for both web and mobile app UI/UX?\",\"Yes. We can design responsive websites, web applications and mobile app interfaces, taking into account screen size, navigation patterns and platform requirements.\"],[\"What deliverables will I receive at the end of the project?\",\"Deliverables depend on the agreed scope and may include user flows, wireframes, high-fidelity screens, clickable prototypes, design specifications and organised source files for developers.\"]]',90,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(379,'ui-ux-design','ve_form_fields','Enquiry form','Enquiry form fields','[[\"Full Name\",\"Enter your full name\",\"text\",\"name\"],[\"Company Name\",\"Enter your company name\",\"text\",\"company\"],[\"Email ID\",\"Enter your email address\",\"email\",\"email\"],[\"Contact Number\",\"Enter your contact number\",\"tel\",\"phone\"]]',2,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(380,'ui-ux-design','cl_related','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','Related service cards','[{\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"text\":\"We design logos that reflect your business and remain clear from large signage to small app icons. Each logo is supplied in practical versions and file formats for print and digital use.\",\"href\":\"logo-design\"},{\"title\":\"Brand Identity &amp; Design\",\"text\":\"We bring your logo, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system. The identity is designed to work across websites, packaging, business cards, print and digital touchpoints.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts. Design and adaptation are handled with production requirements in mind, supporting a smooth transition from concept to press.\",\"href\":\"packaging-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"text\":\"We develop the core campaign idea and creative direction before designing individual assets. The approved concept is carried across banners, video and social formats so the campaign feels connected.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"text\":\"We help shape how your business communicates with employees, customers, investors and the public. Strategy, messaging and supporting materials keep communication clear and consistent across audiences.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"text\":\"We structure and design presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication. Clear visual hierarchy helps the audience follow your message, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"ppt-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"text\":\"We bring strategy, creative, media planning and reporting together in one connected advertising process. Campaigns are planned, produced and measured against a shared objective.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes. The process covers websites, mobile apps and other digital products.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(381,'ui-ux-design~stats-nzja','ve_stats_top','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"30\",\"Industries Served\"]]',30,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(382,'ui-ux-design~stats-nzja','ve_stats_bottom','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-24 06:01:55','2026-10-24 06:01:55'),(384,'ui-ux-design~tools-q8lj','ppt_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"svg\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-indesign-eyqg02r3-oqad.svg\",null,\"Figma\",\"Wireframe | Prototype\"],[\"mag\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-illustrator-nadzfphk-lapp.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe XD\",\"Wireframe | Prototype\"]],[[\"png\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-photoshop-80ldktcz-cu2f.svg\",null,\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Support\"],[\"mag\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/powerpoint-and-google-slides-qp6m9cpr-ddhh.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Mockup\"]]]',50,'2026-10-24 06:01:56','2026-10-24 06:01:56'),(385,'ui-ux-design~services-cqqg','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Website UI\\/UX Design\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Your website is normally the first point of digital contact customers may have with you. With the help of our web UI\\/UX design services, we plan and implement intuitive navigational paths, interactive and engaging web experiences, and a goal-oriented flow through your site to drive interaction, browsing, and action.\"},{\"title\":\"Mobile App UI\\/UX Design\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"People on their mobiles demand efficiency, ease-of-use, and predictability; our Android, iOS, and hybrid mobile app UI\\/UX services help build the perfect interface so that your users reach objectives smoothly without breaking concentration.\"},{\"title\":\"Product Design Services\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Every great digital product is grounded in a clear understanding of user needs. Our product design services take care of the entire process of concept validation, feature roadmap, user flow &amp; journey, and UX\\/UI prototyping. Partner with us to deliver products that tackle actual problems.\"},{\"title\":\"Enterprise Application Design\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Most enterprise systems rely on complex processes and multiple users. We design business applications, dashboards, operational dashboards, and even internal portals that simplify your life and enhance productivity and decision-making.\"},{\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design Consulting\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Certain organizations have a product, but we recommend best practices. UI\\/UX design consulting. We audit interfaces and products, suggest ways of enhancing their user interfaces, and also evaluate ease of use by analyzing the user journey of any product.\"},{\"title\":\"Design Systems &amp; Prototyping\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Certain organizations have a product, but we recommend best practices. UI\\/UX design consulting. We audit interfaces and products, suggest ways of enhancing their user interfaces, and also evaluate ease of use by analyzing the user journey of any product.\"}]',60,'2026-10-24 06:01:56','2026-10-24 07:08:02'),(386,'ui-ux-design~services-cqqg','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"uploads/images/2026/10/01-qbdluuyc-7rwy.webp\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Discovery &amp; Research\",\"We begin by understanding your business goals, target users, competitors, and existing challenges. Through stakeholder discussions and research, we define the foundation for the product experience.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"uploads/images/2026/10/02-ivobma9r-chof.webp\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"UX Strategy &amp; Wireframing\",\"Our team maps user journeys, information architecture, and workflows before creating wireframes that establish the structure and functionality of the product.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/03-atou7svd-nw9f.webp\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"UI Design &amp; Prototyping\",\"Once the user experience is finalized, we create visually engaging interfaces, interactive prototypes, and design systems that reflect your brand while maintaining usability across devices. Whether it&#039;s website UI UX design or mobile app UI UX design, every screen is designed with consistency and user behaviour in mind.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/04-ow2wzv5u-qbay.webp\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"User Testing &amp; Refinement\",\"Interactive prototypes are tested to gather feedback, validate usability, and identify opportunities for improvement. Based on these insights, we refine layouts, interactions, and user flows before finalizing the designs.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/05-nk6rwzuy-mofh.webp\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Developer Handoff\",\"After approval, we prepare developer-ready design files, specifications, assets, and documentation, ensuring a smooth transition from design to development.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/06-mxeqzjlh-pa4v.webp\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Design Support\",\"Our involvement doesn&#039;t end after delivery. We continue supporting your team during implementation, ensuring the final product accurately reflects the approved design and user experience.\"]]',70,'2026-10-24 06:01:56','2026-10-24 06:01:56'),(387,'ui-ux-design~offers-lhpl','pk_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/logo-design-glssk2br-qxvx.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We create original, scalable logos with practical variations and editable files, helping your identity remain clear across print, digital and real-world applications.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Brand Identity &amp; Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/brand-identity-design-oklw0mbh-hn5p.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We bring logos, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system for print, screen and everyday touchpoints.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Marketing and Sales Collaterals\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/marketing-and-sales-collaterals-cmqaiy7h.webp\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We design brochures, presentations, proposals, product sheets and case studies that keep sales and marketing materials clear and on-brand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/packaging-design-cdduhohq-gpcc.webp\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts, with production requirements in mind.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/campaign-concepts-ad-creatives-yajptult-pe20.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We shape the campaign idea, then carry it across banners, video and social creative so every format feels connected.\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/corporate-communication-egaswotl.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We align communication for employees, customers, investors and the public through clear strategy, messaging and supporting materials.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"08\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/advertising-services-c6o0oblq-pkoa.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We structure and design clear presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"\"},{\"no\":\"09\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"img\":\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/ui-ux-design-gowtpvlc-oxt9.webp\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We connect advertising strategy, creative, media and reporting so campaigns work toward a shared goal across platforms.\",\"href\":\"\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 06:01:56','2026-10-24 06:51:54'),(388,'ui-ux-design~why-ovr2','td_benefit_cards','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"icon\":\"benefit-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"title\":\"Dedicated In-House UI/UX Team\",\"text\":\"Our in-house designers coordinate user flows, interfaces, prototypes, design reviews and developer handoff.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"icon\":\"benefit-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"title\":\"Research-Led UI/UX Design\",\"text\":\"We use user needs, workflows, wireframes and prototypes to shape interfaces that are clear and practical.\",\"raised\":true},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"icon\":\"benefit-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-near-black)\",\"title\":\"Confidential Product Information\",\"text\":\"User flows, prototypes, research inputs and product details are handled within the agreed project workflow.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"icon\":\"benefit-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Screens, prototypes, handoff deliverables, review rounds, timelines and fees are agreed before design starts.\",\"raised\":false}]',40,'2026-10-24 06:03:41','2026-10-24 06:03:41'),(389,'digital-marketing','cl_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Search & Paid Marketing\",\"Social Media Campaigns\",\"Content & Email Marketing\",\"Campaign Tracking & Analytics\"]',5,'20