team produce recurring materials faster while keeping layouts and brand details consistent.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"num\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"no\":\"04\",\"tab\":\"tab-4.svg\",\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"bg\":\"why-bg-4.png\",\"title\":\"Print and Digital Files\",\"text\":\"Receive print-ready and digital files, with source files provided so your team can use and adapt the work.\"}]',40,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(394,'digital-marketing','cl_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-indesign.svg\",\"#54001A\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Publish\"],[\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Create\"],[\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Retouch\"],[\"tool-ppt.png\",null,\"PowerPoint & Google Slides\",\"Design | Present\"],[\"tool-acrobat.svg\",\"#B40B00\",\"Adobe Acrobat\",\"Review | Share\"]]',50,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(395,'digital-marketing','cl_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Marketing Material\",\"points\":[\"Brochures, flyers and leaflets\",\"Company profiles and corporate presentations\",\"Posters, banners and event material\",\"Product catalogues and datasheets\"],\"open\":true},{\"title\":\"Sales Material\",\"points\":[\"Sales decks and pitch presentations\",\"Proposals and quotation templates\",\"Case studies and one-pagers\",\"Product and price sheets\"]},{\"title\":\"Digital Collateral\",\"points\":[\"Editable presentation and document templates\",\"PDFs built for email and download\",\"Social media and campaign graphics\",\"Branded email and newsletter layouts\"]}]',60,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(396,'digital-marketing','cl_flow','Process','Workflow steps','[{\"c\":\"#C42030\",\"seg\":0,\"img\":29.33,\"dot\":145,\"tx\":37,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"1. Brief\",\"text\":\"We begin with what you need, who it is for, and how your team will use it. That defines the format and the approach.\"},{\"c\":\"#CF6CB9\",\"seg\":304,\"img\":337.1,\"dot\":452.77,\"tx\":335.27,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"2. Brand and content\",\"text\":\"We work from your brand and your content, and address anything missing before design begins.\"},{\"c\":\"#59B38D\",\"seg\":608,\"img\":655.95,\"dot\":771.61,\"tx\":663.61,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"3. Design\",\"text\":\"We design the piece, or the template, and present it for your review.\"},{\"c\":\"#C9AC61\",\"seg\":912,\"img\":940.35,\"dot\":1056.02,\"tx\":948.02,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"4. Refinement\",\"text\":\"You share your feedback, and we refine it across the revision rounds we agree upfront.\"},{\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"seg\":1216,\"img\":1245.33,\"dot\":1361,\"tx\":1253,\"tw\":230,\"title\":\"5. Delivery\",\"text\":\"We hand over print-ready and digital files, along with editable templates where you need them.\"},{\"c\":\"#7F68CE\",\"seg\":1520,\"img\":1568.76,\"dot\":1684.43,\"tx\":1554.93,\"tw\":269,\"title\":\"6. Ongoing partnership\",\"text\":\"Where the work is continuous, we keep producing new material to the same standard, so your brand stays consistent over time.\"}]',70,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(397,'digital-marketing','cl_flow_next','Process','Arrow positions','[291,611,921,1241,1551]',100,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(398,'digital-marketing','cl_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What are digital marketing services?\",\"It’s the term businesses use to sum up all efforts to reach and convert customers or leads online, and that includes SEO and paid ads. A digital marketing company devises a plan for and then executes all of these different digital channels to make sure people can find out when they\'re looking for you, while making sure each strategy has the same objective in mind.\"],[\"What services are included in digital marketing?\",\"This could be things like SEO, paid search and social advertising, social media management, content marketing, email marketing, landing pages and conversion optimisation, and analytics and reporting. You can use all of them, or choose one of them for what you want to achieve, and this is one of the areas a digital marketing consultant can assist in.\"],[\"How long does it take to see results from digital marketing?\",\"Paid campaigns may generate measurable activity soon after launch, while SEO and content usually require sustained work. We set realistic channel-specific goals and review performance as the campaign develops.\"],[\"Do you provide monthly performance reports?\",\"Yes - We send you out a concise monthly report clearly identifying what’s being done, how each channel performed, and what we recommend you next. The reporting is put together so a decision-maker can understand it and not just technical experts.\"],[\"What tools do digital marketing agencies use?\",\"Standard tools include Google Analytics and Tag Manager for measurement, Google and Meta Ads for paid campaigns, and Semrush or Ahrefs for SEO. The tools matter less than the people using them, which is what separates the best digital marketing agencies from the rest.\"],[\"How do I choose the best digital marketing agency for my business?\",\"Look for one that ties its work to revenue rather than a list of deliverables, reports honestly, and can cover the channels you need under one team. For a smaller business, a digital marketing agency for small business that understands your budget and goals will serve you better than a large agency built for enterprise spend.\"]]',90,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(399,'digital-marketing','ve_form_fields','Enquiry form','Enquiry form fields','[[\"Full Name\",\"Enter your full name\",\"text\",\"name\"],[\"Company Name\",\"Enter your company name\",\"text\",\"company\"],[\"Email ID\",\"Enter your email address\",\"email\",\"email\"],[\"Contact Number\",\"Enter your contact number\",\"tel\",\"phone\"]]',2,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(400,'digital-marketing','cl_related','What We Offer + CTA + Engagement','Related service cards','[{\"title\":\"Logo Design\",\"text\":\"We design logos that reflect your business and remain clear from large signage to small app icons. Each logo is supplied in practical versions and file formats for print and digital use.\",\"href\":\"logo-design\"},{\"title\":\"Brand Identity &amp; Design\",\"text\":\"We bring your logo, colours, typography, imagery and brand language together into one consistent system. The identity is designed to work across websites, packaging, business cards, print and digital touchpoints.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Packaging Design\",\"text\":\"We develop and adapt packaging artwork for new launches, redesigns and multi-SKU rollouts. Design and adaptation are handled with production requirements in mind, supporting a smooth transition from concept to press.\",\"href\":\"packaging-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Campaign Concepts &amp; Ad Creatives\",\"text\":\"We develop the core campaign idea and creative direction before designing individual assets. The approved concept is carried across banners, video and social formats so the campaign feels connected.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"Corporate Communication\",\"text\":\"We help shape how your business communicates with employees, customers, investors and the public. Strategy, messaging and supporting materials keep communication clear and consistent across audiences.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"PPT Design\",\"text\":\"We structure and design presentations for sales, company profiles, pitches and internal communication. Clear visual hierarchy helps the audience follow your message, with reusable templates where needed.\",\"href\":\"ppt-design.php\"},{\"title\":\"Advertising Services\",\"text\":\"We bring strategy, creative, media planning and reporting together in one connected advertising process. Campaigns are planned, produced and measured against a shared objective.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"},{\"title\":\"UI\\/UX Design\",\"text\":\"We design digital experiences around user needs and business goals, from research and user flows to interfaces and prototypes. The process covers websites, mobile apps and other digital products.\",\"href\":\"services.php#svc-1\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(404,'digital-marketing~tools-q8lj','ppt_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"svg\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-indesign-eyqg02r3-23uo-zu5y.svg\",null,\"Google Analytics 4 and Google Tag Manager\",\"Measure | Track\"],[\"mag\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-illustrator-nadzfphk-nsty-plky.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Google Ads and Meta Ads Manager\",\"Target | Advertise\"]],[[\"png\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-photoshop-80ldktcz-6fre-dfdg.svg\",null,\"Google Search Console, Semrush and Ahrefs\",\"Research | Audit\"],[\"mag\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/powerpoint-and-google-slides-qp6m9cpr-yx5o-j4dj.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Meta Business Suite and LinkedIn\",\"\"]],[[\"png\",\"uploads/images/2026/10/adobe-acrobat-8gfkudlb-5p0p-nfwa.svg\",null,\"Email and automation platforms\",\"\"]]]',50,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(405,'digital-marketing~services-cqqg','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Get Found\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Search engine optimisation (SEO)\",\"Answer engine and AI search optimisation (AEO and GEO)\",\"Local and Google Business Profile optimisation\",\"Content marketing and blogging\"]},{\"title\":\"Drive Traffic and Leads\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Google Ads and paid search\",\"Paid social advertising\",\"LinkedIn marketing for B2B\",\"Remarketing and display campaigns\"]},{\"title\":\"Engage and Convert\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Social media management\",\"Email marketing and automation\",\"Landing pages and conversion optimisation\",\"Creative, video and ad production\"]}]',60,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(406,'digital-marketing~services-cqqg','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"uploads/images/2026/10/01-qbdluuyc-b5zl-voky.webp\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Audit and goals\",\"We start by reviewing your current status: your website, your current marketing, your competitors, and your results. Then we agree clear goals, so every channel has something specific to work toward.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"uploads/images/2026/10/02-ivobma9r-optj-jeoy.webp\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Strategy\",\"We build a plan across the channels that fits your business and budget, and decide where to focus first for the fastest return, rather than spreading spend thin across everything.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/03-atou7svd-6rj9-tiwa.webp\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"Setup and launch\",\"We set up tracking, build the campaigns, and launch. Proper measurement goes in from the start, so we can see what is working from day one.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/04-ow2wzv5u-bugw-gc5d.webp\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Manage and optimise\",\"We run the campaigns and improve them as the data comes in, moving budget toward what performs and adjusting what does not. This is continuous, not set-and-forget.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/05-nk6rwzuy-fayo-8zrf.webp\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Report and review\",\"Each month you get a clear report tied to leads and revenue, along with what we changed and what we plan next. We review the strategy regularly as your results and priorities shift.\"]]',70,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(407,'digital-marketing~offers-lhpl','pk_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"SEO Services\",\"img\":\"assets/images/seo/offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We improve search visibility through technical audits, on-page optimisation, content planning and practical implementation, with performance tracked against business goals.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"AEO Services\",\"img\":\"assets/images/seo/offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise content around customer questions, clear answers and structured signals that make information easier for search engines and assistants to understand.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"GEO Services\",\"img\":\"assets/images/seo/offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We strengthen content structure, entity information and technical signals to help AI-powered discovery systems understand and reference your brand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Content Marketing\",\"img\":\"assets/images/seo/offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We plan, research and develop useful content for each stage of the buyer journey, aligned with your audience, brand voice and search goals.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Lead Generation Campaigns\",\"img\":\"assets/images/seo/offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We build and manage campaigns around your ideal customers, agreed lead criteria and measurable enquiries, connecting acquisition channels with follow-up workflows.\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 06:09:43','2026-10-24 06:09:43'),(408,'digital-marketing~stats-w9pt','mg_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-send.svg\",\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countrie