ich answer slots you win and lose today across snippets, People Also Ask, and voice, in a clear, prioritised report.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Strategy\",\"text\":\"Map the questions and topics worth owning, ranked by commercial relevance and intent.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Execution\",\"text\":\"Rewrite content into clean, extractable answers, then ship the supporting FAQ and HowTo schema.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"text\":\"Track snippet capture, answer visibility, and voice presence over time, with clear next steps.\"}]',70,'2026-10-24 06:21:52','2026-10-24 06:21:52'),(418,'aeo-services','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Digital Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We coordinate search, paid advertising, social campaigns, content and measurement to help businesses reach relevant audiences and turn attention into enquiries.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"SEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We improve search visibility through technical audits, on-page optimisation, content planning and practical implementation, with performance tracked against business goals.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"GEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We strengthen content structure, entity information and technical signals to help AI-powered discovery systems understand and reference your brand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Content Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We plan, research and develop useful content for each stage of the buyer journey, aligned with your audience, brand voice and search goals.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Lead Generation Campaigns\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We build and manage campaigns around your ideal customers, agreed lead criteria and measurable enquiries, connecting acquisition channels with follow-up workflows.\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 06:21:52','2026-10-24 06:21:52'),(419,'aeo-services','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What are answer engine optimization services and why do I need them?\",\"AEO structures your content so search engines and assistants use it as the direct answer to a question. You need it because a large share of searches now end without a click. If the answer box, the voice assistant, or the AI overview satisfies the query, your ranking never gets seen. AEO puts you inside the answer itself rather than ten places below it.\"],[\"How is AI search optimization different from regular SEO?\",\"SEO earns you a position on a results page. AI search optimization earns you the answer. The foundations overlap, since both need clean technical setup and strong content, but the signals differ. Answer engines favour concise, well-structured responses backed by schema and clear entity data. You want both running together.\"],[\"Can you help improve our visibility in Google AI Overviews?\",\"Yes. AI Overviews pull heavily from content that already performs well in snippets and structured data, so the work is closely linked. We audit which queries trigger an overview in your category, restructure your content so it can be lifted cleanly, and ship the schema underneath. Then we track whether you start appearing.\"],[\"Is there a way to monitor project status without constant follow-ups?\",\"Yes. Every account gets a dedicated project manager and a shared reporting view, so you can check progress whenever you like rather than chasing updates. Most clients settle into a monthly report and call, with the dashboard available in between.\"],[\"How do I know if I\'m choosing the best AEO agency for my business?\",\"Ask three things. Can they implement, or do they hand you a list of recommendations for someone else to build? What do they actually measure, snippet capture and answer visibility, or just rankings? And will the same people stay on your account? A team that ships its own schema and reports on answers rather than impressions is doing real AEO.\"],[\"How long does AEO take to show results?\",\"Some snippet wins land within four to six weeks, particularly on lower-competition questions where your content already ranks on page one. Broader answer visibility usually builds over three to six months. We track from the start so you can see movement instead of waiting for it.\"],[\"Do you offer white-label AEO for agencies?\",\"Yes. We deliver under your brand, with NDA-protected confidentiality and reporting formatted so you can pass it straight to your clients. A number of agencies use us to add AEO without hiring for it.\"],[\"Do I still need SEO if I invest in AEO?\",\"Yes. Traditional search still drives most traffic for the majority of businesses, and the technical groundwork SEO builds is what makes AEO possible. The two belong together, which is why our SEO and GEO services sit alongside this one.\"]]',90,'2026-10-24 06:21:52','2026-10-24 06:21:52'),(420