\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Strategy\",\"text\":\"Map the topics, entities, and queries worth owning, prioritised by commercial relevance.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Execution\",\"text\":\"Build entity authority, citation-ready content, and clean structured data across the sources AI trusts.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"text\":\"Track AI citations, share of voice, and sentiment over time, with clear next steps.\"}]',70,'2026-10-24 06:26:25','2026-10-24 06:26:25'),(430,'geo-services','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Digital Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We coordinate search, paid advertising, social campaigns, content and measurement to help businesses reach relevant audiences and turn attention into enquiries.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"SEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We improve search visibility through technical audits, on-page optimisation, content planning and practical implementation, with performance tracked against business goals.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"AEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise content around customer questions, clear answers and structured signals that make information easier for search engines and assistants to understand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Content Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We plan, research and develop useful content for each stage of the buyer journey, aligned with your audience, brand voice and search goals.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Lead Generation Campaigns\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We build and manage campaigns around your ideal customers, agreed lead criteria and measurable enquiries, connecting acquisition channels with follow-up workflows.\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 06:26:25','2026-10-24 06:26:25'),(431,'geo-services','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"How is GEO different from traditional SEO?\",\"SEO gets you ranked on a results page. GEO gets you named inside the answer an AI writes. The two share foundations, clean technical setup and strong content, but the signals differ. AI models weigh entity recognition, source credibility, and how easily your content can be extracted and quoted. You need both, since Google still sends most traffic while AI increasingly shapes the first impression.\"],[\"How do AI tools like ChatGPT or Gemini decide which brands to cite?\",\"They look for sources they can verify and trust. That usually means a recognised brand entity, consistent information across the web, third-party mentions on credible sites, and content structured so a specific claim can be lifted cleanly. Statistics, clear sourcing, and direct answers all help. Keyword density does nothing.\"],[\"Can GEO help fix inaccurate information AI tools say about my brand?\",\"Yes, and it is one of the more common reasons clients come to us. Our audit shows exactly what each model says about you today. Where the information is wrong or outdated, we correct it at the source by fixing your own content, tightening entity data across Knowledge Graph and Wikidata, and earning accurate mentions on the sites AI leans on. Models pick up the corrections as they refresh.\"],[\"Do you offer white-label GEO services for agencies?\",\"Yes. We deliver under your brand, with NDA-protected confidentiality and reporting formatted so you can pass it straight to your clients. Plenty of agencies use us to add GEO without hiring for it.\"],[\"How do you measure GEO success and ROI?\",\"Three things mainly. Citation frequency, meaning how often AI names you for the queries that matter. Share of voice against competitors in those same answers. And sentiment, meaning how you are described when you do appear. We tie all of it back to referral traffic and enquiries so you can see what the visibility is worth.\"],[\"Is GEO relevant for B2B companies?\",\"Particularly so. B2B buyers research heavily before they ever contact a supplier, and a growing share of that research now starts with an AI assistant. If a model does not mention you when someone asks for options in your category, you are cut from the shortlist before a human ever sees your site.\"],[\"How long does GEO take to show results?\",\"Some brand mentions appear within a few weeks, especially where the groundwork is already in place. Durable visibility usually takes three to six months, since entity signals and third-party credibility build slowly. We track from day one so you can see movement rather than wait for it.\"],[\"Do I still need SEO if I invest in GEO?\",\"Yes. Traditional search still drives the majority of traffic for most businesses, and the technical foundation SEO builds is what makes GEO possible in the first place. The two work together, which is why our SEO and AEO services sit alongside this one.\"]]',90,'2026-10-24 06:26:25','2026-10-24 06:26:25'),(432,'geo-services~tools-rpaj','mg_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Profound\",\"Research | Audit\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Peec AI\",\"Analyze | Research\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Otterly\",\"Monitor | Analyze\"],[\"assets/images/seo/tool-semrush.png\",\"#FFFFFF\",\"Semrush\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/tool-ahrefs.svg\",\"#FFFFFF\",\"Ahrefs\",\"\"],[\"assets/images/seo/tool-gsc.png\",\"#FFFFFF\",\"Google Search Console\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-24 06:26:25','2026-10-24 06:26:25'),(433,'content-marketing','seo_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Content Strategy & Planning\",\"Industry-Focused Content Writing\",\"SEO Content Optimization\",\"Blog & Article Development\"]',5,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(434,'content-marketing','seo_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"strategy\":\"Strategy and Planning\",\"written\":\"Written Content\",\"formats\":\"Content Formats\"}',19,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(435,'content-marketing','seo_gallery','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"thumb-1.png\",\"cats\":\"strategy\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-2.png\",\"cats\":\"written\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-3.png\",\"cats\":\"formats\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-4.png\",\"cats\":\"strategy written\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-5.png\",\"cats\":\"written formats\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-featured.png\",\"cats\":\"strategy formats\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-6.png\",\"cats\":\"strategy\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-7.png\",\"cats\":\"written\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-8.png\",\"cats\":\"formats\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-9.png\",\"cats\":\"strategy written\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-10.png\",\"cats\":\"written formats\"}]',20,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(436,'content-marketing','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(437,'content-marketing','seo_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House Content Team\",\"text\":\"Our in-house team coordinates content research, writing, editing, review rounds and planned delivery.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"no\":\"02\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Audience-Focused Content Planning\",\"text\":\"We plan and write content around audience questions, brand voice and goals across the customer journey.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-charcoal)\",\"no\":\"03\",\"noa\":0.15,\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Content Planning\",\"text\":\"Unreleased content plans, business information and draft materials are handled within the agreed workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Content types, monthly volumes, approval rounds, timelines and pricing are agreed before production starts.\"}]',40,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(438,'content-marketing','seo_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"tool-gsc.png\",\"Google Search Console\",\"Monitor | Optimise\"],[\"tool-gtm.png\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Manage | Track\"],[\"tool-ahrefs.svg\",\"Ahrefs\",\"Backlinks | Research\"]],[[\"tool-gbp.png\",\"Google Business Profile\",\"Local | Visibility\"],[\"tool-bing.png\",\"Bing Webmaster\",\"Index | Monitor\"],[\"tool-screamingfrog.png\",\"Screaming Frog\",\"Crawl | Audit\"]],[[\"tool-ga4.png\",\"Google Analytics 4\",\"Track | Analyse\"],[\"tool-semrush.png\",\"Semrush\",\"Research | Analyse\"],[\"tool-surfer.svg\",\"Surfer\",\"Content | Optimise\"]]]',50,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(439,'content-marketing','seo_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Technical SEO\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Site architecture and crawlability\",\"Core Web Vitals and page speed\",\"Schema and structured data\",\"Indexation management\",\"JavaScript SEO\",\"Site-health monitoring\"]},{\"title\":\"On-Page & Content SEO\",\"points\":[\"Keyword and intent mapping\",\"On-page optimisation\",\"Internal linking structure\",\"SEO content and copywriting\",\"Topical authority building\",\"Content optimised for AI answer engines\"]},{\"title\":\"Off-Page SEO & Link Building\",\"points\":[\"Digital PR and editorial outreach\",\"Backlink strategy and vetting\",\"Brand-authority building\",\"Competitor link analysis\",\"Local and international link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"B2B & International SEO\",\"points\":[\"Long, considered buying cycles\",\"Multi-language, multi-region rollouts\",\"Hreflang implementation\",\"Market-specific content\"]},{\"title\":\"Local SEO\",\"points\":[\"Google Business Profile management\",\"Local visibility and citations\",\"Local link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"SEO Reporting & Analytics\",\"points\":[\"Transparent monthly reporting\",\"Traffic, leads, and revenue tracking\",\"Clear next steps\"]}]',60,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(440,'content-marketing','seo_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"art\":[-0.92,0,301.84,300],\"title\":\"Discover\",\"text\":\"Understand your business, market, competitors, target audience, and commercial objectives.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"art\":[0,31.19,300,237.61],\"title\":\"Audit\",\"text\":\"Assess technical health, content gaps, backlink profile, and ranking opportunities in a clear, prioritised report.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Strategy\",\"text\":\"Build a keyword and content roadmap mapped to buyer intent and ranked by commercial impact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Execution\",\"text\":\"Implement technical fixes, on-page optimisation, content, and authority building against the roadmap.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"text\":\"Deliver transparent monthly reporting tied to traffic, leads, and revenue, with clear next steps.\"}]',70,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(441,'content-marketing','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Digital Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We coordinate search, paid advertising, social campaigns, content and measurement to help businesses reach relevant audiences and turn attention into enquiries.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"SEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We improve search visibility through technical audits, on-page optimisation, content planning and practical implementation, with performance tracked against business goals.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"AEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise content around customer questions, clear answers and structured signals that make information easier for search engines and assistants to understand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"GEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We strengthen content structure, entity information and technical signals to help AI-powered discovery systems understand and reference your brand.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Lead Generation Campaigns\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We build and manage campaigns around your ideal customers, agreed lead criteria and measurable enquiries, connecting acquisition channels with follow-up workflows.\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(442,'content-marketing','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is included in your content marketing services?\",\"Strategy, audience and keyword analysis, multichannel content generation, SEO, and reporting. The list can be as varied as the formats that you use: from blogs to articles to white papers, case studies, and website text. You can opt for our total package, or choose specific sections. Additionally, our content development services can also improve the content you already have.\"],[\"How do you develop a content marketing strategy?\",\"We begin by learning about your business, your buyers, your competitors, and auditing your existing content. Next, we identify the topics your buyers are searching for in each funnel phase and structure a strategy to connect every content asset to an objective. At a content strategy agency, we know strategy is the step to make the rest of the work.\"],[\"Do you create SEO-friendly content?\",\"Yes. SEO is built into every piece from the research stage, not added afterwards. Our seo content marketing services target the terms your buyers actually search, and structure each piece to rank while still reading as credible, expert content.\"],[\"How do you measure the success of a content marketing campaign?\",\"We measure against your goals: organic traffic, engagement, leads, and conversions. Rankings and traffic are tracked as signs of progress, but the report focuses on the leads and pipeline your content produces.\"],[\"Do you offer B2B content marketing services?\",\"Yes. As a b2b content marketing agency, we produce the content your buyers rely on, such as white papers, case studies, and technical articles, written to build trust with the several decision-makers involved in a considered purchase.\"],[\"Can I outsource content marketing to your company?\",\"Absolutely. Once you outsource content marketing, we manage the entire process- strategy, research, writing, editing, and reporting- so you get consistently high-quality content, no new hires. You approve the plan; we do the rest.\"]]',90,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(443,'content-marketing~tools-rpaj','mg_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"assets/images/seo/tool-semrush.png\",\"#FFFFFF\",\"Semrush and Ahrefs\",\"Research | Analyze\"],[\"assets/images/seo/tool-gsc.png\",\"#FFFFFF\",\"Google Search Console and Analytics 4\",\"Monitor | Measure\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/tool-surfer.svg\",\"#FFFFFF\",\"Surfer\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Grammarly and editing tools\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"AI-assisted research tools\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-24 06:29:08','2026-10-24 06:29:08'),(444,'content-marketing~services-8be1','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Strategy and Planning\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Content strategy mapped to your buying cycle\",\"Audience, competitor and keyword research\",\"Content audits of your existing material\",\"Editorial calendars aligned to your business goals\"]},{\"title\":\"Written Content\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Blog posts and long-form articles\",\"White papers, eBooks and industry guides\",\"Case studies and customer success stories\",\"Website, landing-page and sales-enablement copy\"]},{\"title\":\"Content Formats\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Infographics and data visualisation\",\"Video scripts and short-form video\",\"Email sequences and newsletter content\",\"Social content built from your core pieces\"]},{\"title\":\"SEO and Measurement\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"SEO content writing and optimisation\",\"Internal linking and content structure\",\"Lead and conversion tracking\",\"Quarterly performance reviews and recommendations\"]}]',60,'2026-10-24 06:31:01','2026-10-24 06:31:01'),(445,'content-marketing~services-8be1','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"uploads/images/2026/10/01-qbdluuyc-vaab.webp\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Research and strategy\",\"We research your business, your buyers, and your competitors and review any existing content you hold, creating a strategy defining the content to be covered, the format of that content, keywords to be used in your content, and the aim of that content.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"uploads/images/2026/10/02-ivobma9r-oijj.webp\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Content plan\",\"We turn the strategy into a monthly plan and share it for your approval, so you know exactly what is being produced and the purpose behind each piece before any work begins.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/03-atou7svd-tnrk.webp\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"Creation\",\"Our writers research each topic in depth and produce the content, with SEO built in and the tone matched to your brand. Every piece is reviewed and edited internally before it reaches you.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/04-ow2wzv5u-dtt3.webp\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Review\",\"You review each piece against your knowledge of your market, and we make your changes within the agreed rounds. Once approved, the content is ready to publish.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/05-nk6rwzuy-7dno.webp\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Publishing and optimisation\",\"We either publish these articles, send you ready-to-post, then come back over time to update these for any search terms, competing articles, or when business goals change to make sure they continue performing.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/06-mxeqzjlh-axrv.webp\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Reporting\",\"Each month you receive a report on how your content is performing, which pieces are producing traffic, leads, and conversions, and what we recommend prioritising next.\"]]',70,'2026-10-24 06:31:01','2026-10-24 06:31:01'),(446,'lead-generation-campaigns','seo_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Search & Social Lead Campaigns\",\"Landing Page Optimization\",\"Lead Qualification & Scoring\",\"Campaign Analytics & Reporting\"]',5,'2026-10-24 06:34:43','2026-10-24 06:34:43'),(447,'lead-generation-campaigns','seo_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"capture\":\"Capture Demand\",\"convert\":\"Convert Interest\",\"qualify\":\"Qualify and Nurture\"}',19,'2026-10-24 06:34:43','2026-10-24 06:34:43'),(448,'lead-generation-campaigns','seo_gallery','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"thumb-1.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-2.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-3.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-4.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-5.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-featured.png\",\"cats\":\"capture qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-6.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-7.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-8.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-9.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-10.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"}]',20,'2026-10-24 06:34:43','2026-10-24 06:34:43'),(449,'lead-generation-campaigns','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Profe