:\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We strengthen content structure, entity information and technical signals to help AI-powered discovery systems understand and reference your brand.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Content Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We plan, research and develop useful content for each stage of the buyer journey, aligned with your audience, brand voice and search goals.\"}]',80,'2026-10-24 06:34:43','2026-10-24 06:34:43'),(455,'lead-generation-campaigns','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What are lead generation services?\",\"Lead gen campaigns are used to source and secure prospective customers who are interested in buying what you’re selling, who you will then “qualify” for sales. Typically, this requires bringing together search advertising, pay-per-click ads, valuable content, and lead pages to get you connected to prospects who are eager to engage with your company.\"],[\"What lead generation channels do you use?\",\"We utilize the channels most apt to find and engage your buyers: SEO for relevant search intent, Google & paid social ads, LinkedIn to engage individuals by role and industry, content offers, and optimized landing pages. The appropriate marketing blend will be customized based on how your buyers invest their time.\"],[\"How do you measure lead generation success?\",\"We analyze the volume of leads, their qualification level based on what’s important to you, lead quality by volume and cost per lead, and where your leads come from. Volume is just numbers; our report highlights qualified leads and the cost associated with obtaining said leads.\"],[\"How long does it take to see results from lead generation?\",\"With paid channels, you can have new leads within the first few weeks; SEO will take 3-6 months (along with content). From the start, we align with expectations of every channel.\"],[\"Why does my business need lead generation services?\",\"Without a reliable stream of quality leads, sales teams inevitably waste their time chasing up cold prospects, and revenue becomes difficult to forecast. A managed lead generation programme gives your team a consistent supply of prospects worth pursuing, which is why lead generation companies for small businesses and larger firms alike are used to support growth.\"],[\"Why should I outsource lead generation services?\",\"Setting up an in-house lead generation function involves recruiting for several skills (SEO, paid, content, analytics) and then maintaining several tools to serve these. Outsourcing can provide you with that full capability more cheaply than building a team. That is why several businesses, as well as lead generation for marketing agencies operating under their own brand, rely on a professional.\"]]',90,'2026-10-24 06:34:43','2026-10-24 06:34:43'),(456,'lead-generation-campaigns~tools-rpaj','mg_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Google Ads and Meta Ads Manager\",\"Target | Advertise\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"LinkedIn Campaign Manager\",\"Target | Promote\"],[\"assets/images/seo/tool-ga4.png\",\"#FFFFFF\",\"Google Analytics 4 and Tag Manager\",\"Track | Measure\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Landing page and form tools\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"CRM and email platforms\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-24 06:34:43','2026-10-24 06:34:43'),(457,'lead-generation-campaigns~services-8be1','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Capture Demand\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Search engine optimisation for high-intent terms\",\"Google Ads and paid search campaigns\",\"Paid social and LinkedIn advertising\",\"Remarketing to re-engage past visitors\"]},{\"title\":\"Convert Interest\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Landing page design and optimisation\",\"Lead capture forms and lead magnets\",\"Content offers, guides and gated resources\",\"Conversion rate optimisation\"]},{\"title\":\"Qualify and Nurture\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Lead scoring and qualification\",\"Email nurture sequences\",\"CRM setup and lead handover\",\"Follow-up and re-engagement campaigns\"]},{\"title\":\"Measure and Improve\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Cost-per-lead and conversion tracking\",\"Campaign reporting tied to lead quality\",\"Ongoing testing and optimisation\",\"Regular strategy reviews\"]}]',60,'2026-10-24 06:34:43','2026-10-24 06:34:43'),(458,'lead-generation-campaigns~services-8be1','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"uploads/images/2026/10/01-qbdluuyc-vaab-ej7f.webp\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Define the lead\",\"We agree what a qualified lead looks like for your business: the industry, company size, role and intent that mark a real opportunity. Every campaign is built to reach and capture that specific profile.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"uploads/images/2026/10/02-ivobma9r-oijj-eoyf.webp\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Plan the campaign\",\"We choose the channels most likely to reach those buyers within your budget, and plan the campaigns, messages and offers designed to convert them into leads.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/03-atou7svd-tnrk-7giz.webp\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"Build and launch\",\"We build the campaigns, landing pages, forms and tracking, and launch. Measurement is in place from the start, so we can see the quality of leads from day one, not just the quantity.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/04-ow2wzv5u-dtt3-chxe.webp\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Qualify and hand over\",\"As leads come in, we score them against your definition and pass the qualified ones to your sales team or CRM, with the context they need for a productive first conversation.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/05-nk6rwzuy-7dno-dokp.webp\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Optimise\",\"We review which channels, messages and offers produce the best leads at the lowest cost, and shift budget and effort toward them. This is continuous, so results improve over time.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/06-mxeqzjlh-axrv-rnqt.webp\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Report\",\"Each month you receive a report on leads generated, their quality, the cost per lead, and what we recommend next, tied to the outcomes that matter to your sales team.\"]]',70,'2026-10-24 06:34:43','2026-10-24 06:34:43'),(459,'pre-press-service~why-hrhx','td_benefit_cards','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"icon\":\"benefit-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"title\":\"In-House Pre-Press Specialists\",\"text\":\"Our in-house specialists coordinate artwork preparation, print checks, proofing and production-ready file delivery.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"icon\":\"benefit-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"title\":\"Production-Ready Pre-Press Artwork\",\"text\":\"We check artwork specifications, colour settings, bleeds and proofs before files move to print production.\",\"raised\":true},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"icon\":\"benefit-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-near-black)\",\"title\":\"Confidential Production File Handling\",\"text\":\"Artwork, product specifications and print-ready files are handled within the agreed production workflow.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"icon\":\"benefit-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"File checks, proofing rounds, production deadlines and fees are agreed before pre-press begins.\",\"raised\":false}]',40,'2026-10-25 23:36:39','2026-10-26 01:49:34'),(460,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Scientific Journals & Periodical\",\"Research Document Formatting\",\"Prepress and Print Production\",\"Digital Publication E-Pub production\"]',5,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(461,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"capture\":\"Capture Demand\",\"convert\":\"Convert Interest\",\"qualify\":\"Qualify and Nurture\"}',19,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(462,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_gallery','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"thumb-1.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-2.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-3.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-4.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-5.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-featured.png\",\"cats\":\"capture qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-6.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-7.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-8.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-9.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-10.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"}]',20,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(463,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(464,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House Publishing Specialists\",\"text\":\"Our in-house team coordinates manuscript editing, formatting, quality checks and publishing-ready file delivery.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"no\":\"02\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Guideline-Aligned Academic Publishing\",\"text\":\"We support manuscript editing, formatting and submission preparation around your target journal\'s stated author requirements.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-charcoal)\",\"no\":\"03\",\"noa\":0.15,\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Manuscript Handling\",\"text\":\"Unpublished research, manuscript drafts and supporting documents are handled within the agreed publishing workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Editing and formatting scope, target guidelines, review stages, deadlines and pricing are agreed before work begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(465,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"tool-gsc.png\",\"Google Search Console\",\"Monitor | Optimise\"],[\"tool-gtm.png\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Manage | Track\"],[\"tool-ahrefs.svg\",\"Ahrefs\",\"Backlinks | Research\"]],[[\"tool-gbp.png\",\"Google Business Profile\",\"Local | Visibility\"],[\"tool-bing.png\",\"Bing Webmaster\",\"Index | Monitor\"],[\"tool-screamingfrog.png\",\"Screaming Frog\",\"Crawl | Audit\"]],[[\"tool-ga4.png\",\"Google Analytics 4\",\"Track | Analyse\"],[\"tool-semrush.png\",\"Semrush\",\"Research | Analyse\"],[\"tool-surfer.svg\",\"Surfer\",\"Content | Optimise\"]]]',50,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(466,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Technical SEO\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Site architecture and crawlability\",\"Core Web Vitals and page speed\",\"Schema and structured data\",\"Indexation management\",\"JavaScript SEO\",\"Site-health monitoring\"]},{\"title\":\"On-Page & Content SEO\",\"points\":[\"Keyword and intent mapping\",\"On-page optimisation\",\"Internal linking structure\",\"SEO content and copywriting\",\"Topical authority building\",\"Content optimised for AI answer engines\"]},{\"title\":\"Off-Page SEO & Link Building\",\"points\":[\"Digital PR and editorial outreach\",\"Backlink strategy and vetting\",\"Brand-authority building\",\"Competitor link analysis\",\"Local and international link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"B2B & International SEO\",\"points\":[\"Long, considered buying cycles\",\"Multi-language, multi-region rollouts\",\"Hreflang implementation\",\"Market-specific content\"]},{\"title\":\"Local SEO\",\"points\":[\"Google Business Profile management\",\"Local visibility and citations\",\"Local link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"SEO Reporting & Analytics\",\"points\":[\"Transparent monthly reporting\",\"Traffic, leads, and revenue tracking\",\"Clear next steps\"]}]',60,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(467,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"art\":[-0.92,0,301.84,300],\"title\":\"Discover\",\"text\":\"Understand your business, market, competitors, target audience, and commercial objectives.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"art\":[0,31.19,300,237.61],\"title\":\"Audit\",\"text\":\"Assess technical health, content gaps, backlink profile, and ranking opportunities in a clear, prioritised report.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Strategy\",\"text\":\"Build a keyword and content roadmap mapped to buyer intent and ranked by commercial impact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Execution\",\"text\":\"Implement technical fixes, on-page optimisation, content, and authority building against the roadmap.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"text\":\"Deliver transparent monthly reporting tied to traffic, leads, and revenue, with clear next steps.\"}]',70,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(468,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Pre-Press Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We prepare, inspect and refine artwork for production, checking layouts, colours, bleeds and specifications before files reach the printer.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Magazine Design\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design editorial layouts, covers and recurring templates for print and digital magazines, maintaining a consistent reading experience across every issue.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Multilingual Publishing &amp; Localization\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We adapt page layouts, typography and document formatting across languages, accounting for text expansion, reading patterns and production requirements.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Catalog\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise product imagery, specifications and categories into clear, consistent catalogue layouts that help buyers compare options and find relevant information.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"InDesign Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We create structured, editable layouts for brochures, reports, publications and catalogues, using consistent styles and print or digital output settings.\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Newsletter Design\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design branded newsletters for email and print, using clear hierarchy, reusable layouts and readable content blocks for recurring communication.\"}]',80,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(469,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is scientific journal publication?\",\"The process for having your final, ready manuscript accepted for publication into an open peer-reviewed journal. Includes choosing the correct journal, formatting according to its instructions, submitting, and responding to the review process.\"],[\"What services are included in scientific journal support?\",\"Journal selection, Manuscript editing & language polishing, Formatting as per the author’s guidelines, Figure and artwork generation, Plagiarism check, Submission guidance, and reviewer comments response guidance. You can get them individually or as the entire package.\"],[\"Can you publish a scientific journal paper without any data or experiments?\",\"Absolutely not; legitimate research and publishing come from real data and actual work, and you can\'t pass off fake research or real data to a published peer review.\"],[\"What software do you use for scientific journal publication?\",\"LaTeX and Overleaf for equation-heavy fields, Word with tracked changes for editing, MathType for scientific notation, Illustrator and Photoshop for figures, Turnitin and iThenticate for plagiarism checks, and reference managers such as EndNote and Mendeley for citations.\"],[\"How long does the scientific journal publication process take?\",\"Our part is quick: journal selection and formatting usually take three to five business days, and a full pre-submission review takes seven to ten. The journal\'s own review, however, can take anywhere from a few weeks to several months, which is outside any support service\'s control.\"],[\"What are the steps involved in scientific journal publication?\",\"Manuscript preparation, journal search, editing and formatting, pre-submission proofreading, manuscript submission, and subsequent revision and resubmission after peer review are part of the paper publication journey. You can join at any point during this process, where you are in the lifecycle of your manuscript.\"]]',90,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(470,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support~tools-rpaj','mg_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"assets\\/icons\\/seo\\/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"LaTeX and Overleaf\",\"\"],[\"assets\\/icons\\/seo\\/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Microsoft Word with tracked changes\",\"\"],[\"assets\\/icons\\/seo\\/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"MathType and MathML\",\"\"],[\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator and Photoshop\",\"\"],[\"assets\\/icons\\/seo\\/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Turnitin and iThenticate\",\"\"],[\"assets\\/icons\\/seo\\/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Reference managers (EndNote, Mendeley, Zotero)\",\"\"],[\"\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Reporting guidelines (CONSORT, PRISMA, STROBE)\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-26 03:46:36'),(471,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support~services-8be1','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Journal Selection\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Based on your study’s size and the research approach, we evaluate the unique contribution your manuscript adds to the literature and select 3-5 target journals that align best with your domain and chosen indexing source (Scopus, Web of Science, PubMed, or SCIE).\"},{\"title\":\"Manuscript Editing and Language Polishing\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Our Subject editors help refine English grammar, clarity, and the level of academic English. This may be extremely useful for those research projects in English written by non-native speakers. The edit sharpens how the work reads without changing the meaning of what is written.\"},{\"title\":\"Formatting and Artwork Preparation\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"We format the full manuscript as per your target journal&#039;s author guidelines: headings, margins, spacing, reference style and abstract structure. Figures, tables and charts are prepared to the journal&#039;s technical requirements for resolution, file type and colour.\"},{\"title\":\"Pre-Submission Peer Review\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"A senior peer within your area reviews the manuscript as a journal referee would and spots flaws in your methodology, data, or coverage of existing literature before the journal does. That’s the absolute best way to avoid desk rejection.\"},{\"title\":\"Plagiarism and Similarity Check\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"We test your manuscript using a professional similarity checking system and, in cases where the score is too high, highlight the problem areas for amendment before your work is submitted.\"},{\"title\":\"Submission Assistance\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"We prepare every file the submission needs, including the blinded manuscript, title page, cover letter and declarations, and guide you step by step through the journal&#039;s submission portal.\"},{\"title\":\"Response to Reviewers and Resubmission\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"When the reviewers return your comments, we work with you to develop a concise, point-by-point reply to reviewers and edit your document according to the recommendations, for anything from major to minor revisions.\"}]',60,'2026-10-25 23:40:20','2026-10-25 23:40:20'),(472,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support~services-8be1','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"uploads/images/2026/10/01-qbdluuyc-vaab-ej7f-sg4e.webp\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Manuscript assessment\",\"We review your finished paper to understand its scope, quality and readiness, then recommend which services it actually needs.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"uploads/images/2026/10/02-ivobma9r-oijj-eoyf-vf0w.webp\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Journal selection\",\"We match your research to three to five suitable journals based on scope, audience and indexing, and explain the trade-offs between them.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/03-atou7svd-tnrk-7giz-9ivd.webp\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"Editing and formatting\",\"We polish the language and format the manuscript, figures and references to your chosen journal&#039;s author guidelines.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/04-ow2wzv5u-dtt3-chxe-1isi.webp\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Pre-submission review\",\"A field expert reviews the paper for methodological or structural weaknesses so they can be fixed before the journal sees them.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/05-nk6rwzuy-7dno-dokp-seyx.webp\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Submission\",\"We prepare the complete submission package and guide you through the journal&#039;s portal to submit.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/06-mxeqzjlh-axrv-rnqt-h1ts.webp\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Revision and resubmission\",\"When reviewers comment, we help you respond point by point and revise the manuscript accordingly.\"]]',70,'2026-10-25 23:40:21','2026-10-25 23:40:21'),(473,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support~work-hxa5','pp_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"packaging\":\"Packaging Pre-Press\",\"commercial\":\"Commercial Print\",\"digital\":\"Digital Pre-Press\",\"colour\":\"Colour Management & Proofing\"}',19,'2026-10-25 23:41:53','2026-10-25 23:41:53'),(474,'academic-and-technical-publishing-support~work-hxa5','pp_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"packaging\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"commercial\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"digital\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"colour\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"packaging commercial\"}]',20,'2026-10-25 23:41:53','2026-10-25 23:41:53'),(475,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization','seo_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Content Localization\",\"Multilingual Design Adaptation\",\"Instructional Manuals\",\"Multilingual Typesetting & Layout\"]',5,'2026-10-25 23:43:56','2026-10-25 23:43:56'),(476,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization','seo_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"capture\":\"Capture Demand\",\"convert\":\"Convert Interest\",\"qualify\":\"Qualify and Nurture\"}',19,'2026-10-25 23:43:56','2026-10-25 23:43:56'),(477,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization','seo_gallery','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"thumb-1.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-2.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-3.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-4.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-5.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-featured.png\",\"cats\":\"capture qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-6.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-7.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-8.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-9.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-10.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"}]',20,'2026-10-25 23:43:56','2026-10-25 23:43:56'),(478,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"1