-10-25 23:43:56'),(481,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization','seo_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Book Typesetting Services\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Chapter formatting\",\"Page layouts\",\"Typesetting\",\"Headers and footers\",\"Page numbering\",\"Table of contents formatting\",\"Image and illustration placement\",\"Print-ready file preparation\"]},{\"title\":\"Magazine Typesetting Services\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Editorial page layouts\",\"Typography management\",\"Image placement\",\"Article formatting\",\"Advertisement placement\",\"Consistent visual styling\",\"Print-ready magazine files\"]},{\"title\":\"Document Layout &amp; Formatting\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Business reports\",\"White papers\",\"Proposals\",\"Presentations\",\"Training documents\",\"Internal publications\",\"Process documents\"]},{\"title\":\"Annual Reports &amp; Corporate Documents\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Annual reports\",\"Financial reports\",\"ESG reports\",\"Corporate presentations\",\"Business proposals\",\"Company publications\"]},{\"title\":\"Product Catalogues, Brochures &amp; Marketing Collateral\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Product catalogues\",\"Brochures\",\"Flyers\",\"Sales documents\",\"Marketing materials\",\"Promotional publications\"]},{\"title\":\"Technical Manuals &amp; Training Materials\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"User manuals\",\"Installation guides\",\"Operating instructions\",\"Maintenance manuals\",\"Standard Operating Procedures (SOPs)\",\"Training materials\",\"Process documentation\"]},{\"title\":\"Scientific &amp; Research Publications\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Research papers\",\"Academic journals\",\"Conference proceedings\",\"Dissertations\",\"White papers\",\"Institutional publications\"]}]',60,'2026-10-25 23:43:56','2026-10-25 23:43:56'),(482,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization','seo_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"art\":[-0.92,0,301.84,300],\"title\":\"Discover\",\"text\":\"We understand your document requirements, templates, style guides, and publishing goals.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"art\":[0,31.19,300,237.61],\"title\":\"Format\",\"text\":\"We organize the content into the proper design using appropriate fonts, spacing, images, and styles.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Quality Check\",\"text\":\"The document is thoroughly checked for its formatting, graphics, tables, and other features.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Finalize\",\"text\":\"We make the required changes and prepare the document for print or digital publishing.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Delivery\",\"text\":\"Files ready to use are delivered to you for printing or online publishing.\"}]',70,'2026-10-25 23:43:56','2026-10-25 23:43:56'),(483,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Pre-Press Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We prepare, inspect and refine artwork for production, checking layouts, colours, bleeds and specifications before files reach the printer.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Magazine Design\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design editorial layouts, covers and recurring templates for print and digital magazines, maintaining a consistent reading experience across every issue.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Academic &amp; Technical Publishing Support\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We assist with manuscript editing, journal-aligned formatting, technical figures and submission preparation while keeping your research content and intended meaning intact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Catalog\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise product imagery, specifications and categories into clear, consistent catalogue layouts that help buyers compare options and find relevant information.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"InDesign Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We create structured, editable layouts for brochures, reports, publications and catalogues, using consistent styles and print or digital output settings.\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Newsletter Design\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design branded newsletters for email and print, using clear hierarchy, reusable layouts and readable content blocks for recurring communication.\"}]',80,'2026-10-25 23:43:56','2026-10-25 23:43:56'),(484,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What are desktop publishing services?\",\"Desktop publishing services assist in transforming unformatted content into professionally formatted publications that can be printed or published digitally. These include document formatting, layout, typesetting, image placement, template creation, and preparation of print-ready files, among others.\"],[\"What does a DTP company do?\",\"A DTP firm will take your content and prepare it to be a structured and professional document for you. This may comprise book typesetting, magazine layout design, document formatting, multilingual printing, PDF creation, and final quality control processes.\"],[\"Do you offer multilingual desktop publishing services?\",\"Yes, we help prepare documents in multiple languages while maintaining proper layouts, formatting, and overall consistency. Our team ensures translated content fits correctly within the document design.\"],[\"What software do you use for DTP projects?\",\"We work with industry-standard tools like Adobe InDesign, Adobe Illustrator, Adobe Photoshop, and Adobe Acrobat Pro. We can also work with your existing templates and publishing guidelines.\"],[\"What\'s included in your document production services?\",\"Our document production services cover everything from layout and formatting to the final publication-ready files. Depending on your requirements, we can help with book typesetting, magazine layouts, corporate documents, technical manuals, multilingual publications, and print-ready PDF preparation.\"],[\"Can you handle book typesetting for self-published authors?\",\"Yes, we work with self-published authors as well as publishers, educational institutions, and businesses. We help format your manuscript with proper layouts, typography, page numbering, table of contents, and other elements to prepare it for print or digital publishing.\"]]',90,'2026-10-25 23:43:56','2026-10-25 23:43:56'),(485,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization~work-hxa5','pp_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','[]',19,'2026-10-25 23:43:56','2026-10-26 04:00:21'),(486,'multilingual-publishing-and-localization~work-hxa5','pp_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"i