,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Strategy\",\"text\":\"Build a keyword and content roadmap mapped to buyer intent and ranked by commercial impact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Execution\",\"text\":\"Implement technical fixes, on-page optimisation, content, and authority building against the roadmap.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"text\":\"Deliver transparent monthly reporting tied to traffic, leads, and revenue, with clear next steps.\"}]',70,'2026-10-25 23:48:09','2026-10-25 23:48:09'),(498,'product-catalog','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Pre-Press Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We prepare, inspect and refine artwork for production, checking layouts, colours, bleeds and specifications before files reach the printer.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Magazine Design\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design editorial layouts, covers and recurring templates for print and digital magazines, maintaining a consistent reading experience across every issue.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Academic &amp; Technical Publishing Support\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We assist with manuscript editing, journal-aligned formatting, technical figures and submission preparation while keeping your research content and intended meaning intact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Multilingual Publishing &amp; Localization\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We adapt page layouts, typography and document formatting across languages, accounting for text expansion, reading patterns and production requirements.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"InDesign Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We create structured, editable layouts for brochures, reports, publications and catalogues, using consistent styles and print or digital output settings.\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Newsletter Design\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design branded newsletters for email and print, using clear hierarchy, reusable layouts and readable content blocks for recurring communication.\"}]',80,'2026-10-25 23:48:09','2026-10-25 23:48:09'),(499,'product-catalog','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is included in product catalog design services?\",\"Cover and layout design, product page templates, image editing, product data organisation, and print-ready and digital files. In short, everything from your raw product list to a finished catalog ready to print or share online.\"],[\"How long does it take to design a full product catalog?\",\"It depends on the number of products and how ready your data is. A small catalog can take a week or two, while a large range of several hundred products takes longer.\"],[\"Can a product catalog designer create both print and digital catalogs?\",\"Yes. We produce the print edition and a digital PDF from the same layout, adjusting each for its format. The digital version can include clickable contents and links to your website or order pages.\"],[\"What information should be included in a product catalog?\",\"Clear product images, names and codes, key specifications, prices where relevant, and enough description to help a buyer decide. A good catalog also groups products logically so people can compare options quickly.\"],[\"Can you create a custom product catalog for my business?\",\"Yes. Every catalog is designed around your products, your brand, and how your customers actually buy. Our product catalog creation work starts from your range and your goals, not a fixed template. If you already have brand guidelines, we design within them.\"],[\"What software and tools do you use for product catalog design?\",\"Mainly Adobe InDesign for layout, with Photoshop for product images and Illustrator for icons and diagrams. For large ranges, we use InDesign\'s data merge to bring your product list straight into the design accurately.\"]]',90,'2026-10-25 23:48:09','2026-10-25 23:48:09'),(500,'product-catalog~work-hxa5','pp_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"design\":\"Design and Layout\",\"content\":\"Product Content and Images\",\"output\":\"Print and Digital Output\"}',19,'2026-10-25 23:48:09','2026-10-25 23:48:09'),(501,'product-catalog~work-hxa5','pp_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"design\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"content\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"output\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"design content\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"content output\"}]',20,'2026-10-25 23:48:09','2026-10-25 23:48:09'),(502,'product-catalog~tools-rpaj','mg_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-indesign.svg\",\"#54001A\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Layout | Catalogue\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"InDesign data merge\",\"Merge | Automate\"],[\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Retouch | Enhance\"],[\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Diagram\"],[\"tool-acrobat.svg\",\"#B40B00\",\"Adobe Acrobat Pro\",\"Preflight | Proof\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Excel and CSV handling\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-25 23:48:09','2026-10-25 23:48:09'),(503,'product-catalog~services-8be1','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Design and Layout\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Cover design and section dividers\",\"Page grid, layout and typography\",\"Category and product page templates\",\"Comparison tables and spec sheets\",\"Pricing tables and order forms\"]},{\"title\":\"Product Content and Images\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Product data organisation and formatting\",\"Image editing, cropping, background cleanup and colour correction\",\"Writing or refining product descriptions\",\"Consistent naming, codes and units across the range\"]},{\"title\":\"Print and Digital Output\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Print-ready files with bleed, crop marks and correct colour profiles\",\"Custom catalog printing coordinated to your chosen size, paper and finish\",\"Interactive PDF catalogs with clickable contents and links\",\"Digital versions sized for web download and email\"]}]',60,'2026-10-25 23:48:09','2026-10-25 23:48:09'),(504,'product-catalog~services-8be1','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"uploads/images/2026/10/01-qbdluuyc-vaab-ej7f-sg4e-qus1.webp\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Product list and goals\",\"We start with your product data and what the catalog is for: a sales tool, a trade handout, a website download. That decides the structure.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"uploads/images/2026/10/02-ivobma9r-oijj-eoyf-vf0w-t8ql.webp\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Data check\",\"We organise your product information and flag anything missing or low-resolution while there is still time to fix it.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/03-atou7svd-tnrk-7giz-9ivd-q6cu.webp\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"Template design\",\"We design the cover, the grid and the product page templates, and get them approved before the full build.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"uploads/images/2026/10/04-ow2wzv5u-dtt3-chxe-1isi-mbhi.webp\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Full layout\",\"We include every product in the approved template and lay out the complete catalog.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/05-nk6rwzuy-7dno-dokp-seyx-luky.webp\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Your review\",\"You review a full proof, and we make changes across the agreed guidelines.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"uploads/images/2026/10/06-mxeqzjlh-axrv-rnqt-h1ts-s5ns.webp\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Final files\",\"We deliver print-ready files for your printer and a digital PDF for web and email.\"]]',70,'2026-10-25 23:48:09','2026-10-25 23:48:09'),(505,'indesign-services','seo_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Magazine Layout\",\"Scientific Journals\",\"Newsletter Design\",\"Factsheets\"]',5,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(506,'indesign-services','seo_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"capture\":\"Capture Demand\",\"convert\":\"Convert Interest\",\"qualify\":\"Qualify and Nurture\"}',19,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(507,'indesign-services','seo_gallery','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"thumb-1.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-2.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-3.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-4.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-5.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-featured.png\",\"cats\":\"capture qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-6.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-7.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-8.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-9.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-10.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"}]',20,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(508,'indesign-services','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(509,'indesign-services','seo_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House InDesign Specialists\",\"text\":\"Our in-house team manages editorial layouts, formatting, production checks and document handoff.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"no\":\"02\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Professional InDesign Layouts\",\"text\":\"We use structured styles, grids and master pages to build editable, consistent documents for print and digital.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-charcoal)\",\"no\":\"03\",\"noa\":0.15,\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Publishing File Handling\",\"text\":\"Unpublished manuscripts, design files and client content are handled within the agreed publishing workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Document formats, page counts, design changes, deadlines and pricing are agreed before layout begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(510,'indesign-services','seo_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"tool-gsc.png\",\"Google Search Console\",\"Monitor | Optimise\"],[\"tool-gtm.png\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Manage | Track\"],[\"tool-ahrefs.svg\",\"Ahrefs\",\"Backlinks | Research\"]],[[\"tool-gbp.png\",\"Google Business Profile\",\"Local | Visibility\"],[\"tool-bing.png\",\"Bing Webmaster\",\"Index | Monitor\"],[\"tool-screamingfrog.png\",\"Screaming Frog\",\"Crawl | Audit\"]],[[\"tool-ga4.png\",\"Google Analytics 4\",\"Track | Analyse\"],[\"tool-semrush.png\",\"Semrush\",\"Research | Analyse\"],[\"tool-surfer.svg\",\"Surfer\",\"Content | Optimise\"]]]',50,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(511,'indesign-services','seo_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Technical SEO\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Site architecture and crawlability\",\"Core Web Vitals and page speed\",\"Schema and structured data\",\"Indexation management\",\"JavaScript SEO\",\"Site-health monitoring\"]},{\"title\":\"On-Page & Content SEO\",\"points\":[\"Keyword and intent mapping\",\"On-page optimisation\",\"Internal linking structure\",\"SEO content and copywriting\",\"Topical authority building\",\"Content optimised for AI answer engines\"]},{\"title\":\"Off-Page SEO & Link Building\",\"points\":[\"Digital PR and editorial outreach\",\"Backlink strategy and vetting\",\"Brand-authority building\",\"Competitor link analysis\",\"Local and international link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"B2B & International SEO\",\"points\":[\"Long, considered buying cycles\",\"Multi-language, multi-region rollouts\",\"Hreflang implementation\",\"Market-specific content\"]},{\"title\":\"Local SEO\",\"points\":[\"Google Business Profile management\",\"Local visibility and citations\",\"Local link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"SEO Reporting & Analytics\",\"points\":[\"Transparent monthly reporting\",\"Traffic, leads, and revenue tracking\",\"Clear next steps\"]}]',60,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(512,'indesign-services','seo_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"art\":[-0.92,0,301.84,300],\"title\":\"Discover\",\"text\":\"Understand your business, market, competitors, target audience, and commercial objectives.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"art\":[0,31.19,300,237.61],\"title\":\"Audit\",\"text\":\"Assess technical health, content gaps, backlink profile, and ranking opportunities in a clear, prioritised report.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Strategy\",\"text\":\"Build a keyword and content roadmap mapped to buyer intent and ranked by commercial impact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Execution\",\"text\":\"Implement technical fixes, on-page optimisation, content, and authority building against the roadmap.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"text\":\"Deliver transparent monthly reporting tied to traffic, leads, and revenue, with clear next steps.\"}]',70,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(513,'indesign-services','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Pre-Press Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We prepare, inspect and refine artwork for production, checking layouts, colours, bleeds and specifications before files reach the printer.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Magazine Design\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design editorial layouts, covers and recurring templates for print and digital magazines, maintaining a consistent reading experience across every issue.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Academic &amp; Technical Publishing Support\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We assist with manuscript editing, journal-aligned formatting, technical figures and submission preparation while keeping your research content and intended meaning intact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Multilingual Publishing &amp; Localization\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We adapt page layouts, typography and document formatting across languages, accounting for text expansion, reading patterns and production requirements.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Catalog\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise product imagery, specifications and categories into clear, consistent catalogue layouts that help buyers compare options and find relevant information.\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Newsletter Design\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design newsletters that are brand-consistent and ready to print or for digital publication.\"}]',80,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(514,'indesign-services','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What are InDesign services?\",\"InDesign services cover professional page layout and typesetting for documents such as catalogues, brochures, magazines, books and reports. They also include preparing the files for the required print or digital output.\"],[\"What types of documents can you design in InDesign?\",\"We can work on product catalogues, brochures, magazines, annual reports, newsletters, academic documents, manuals and other multi-page publications, following the approved content and design brief.\"],[\"Do you provide print-ready InDesign files?\",\"Yes. Where print delivery is part of the agreed scope, we prepare publication files and PDFs against the printer\'s specifications for page size, bleed, fonts, images and colour.\"],[\"Do you create interactive PDFs and digital publications?\",\"We can prepare digital PDFs with appropriate navigation and links where the document format supports them. Interactive features and final compatibility requirements are agreed during scoping.\"],[\"Do you provide editable InDesign source files?\",\"Editable source files can be included in the handover when agreed. We confirm the expected file package, linked assets and fonts before delivery.\"],[\"Why should I outsource Adobe InDesign services?\",\"Outsourcing can give your team additional layout and production capacity without managing every formatting task internally. It is particularly useful for recurring publications, complex documents or large sets of similar assets.\"],[\"Do you design brochures and catalogs in Adobe InDesign?\",\"Yes. We use InDesign for structured multi-page collateral, including brochures and product catalogues, with consistent typography, image placement and print or digital output files.\"]]',90,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(515,'indesign-services~work-hxa5','pp_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"prepress\":\"Pre-Press Services\",\"journal\":\"Scientific Journal Publishing\",\"catalog\":\"Product Catalog Design\"}',19,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(516,'indesign-services~work-hxa5','pp_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"prepress\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"journal\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"catalog\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"prepress journal\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"journal catalog\"}]',20,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(517,'indesign-services~tools-rpaj','mg_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-indesign.svg\",\"#54001A\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"Typeset | Publish\"],[\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Support\"],[\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Edit | Retouch\"],[\"tool-acrobat.svg\",\"#B40B00\",\"Adobe Acrobat Pro\",\"Preflight | Proof\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Adobe Creative Cloud\",\"Create | Collaborate\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Esko ArtPro+\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Microsoft Office Suite\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Preflight & Print Proofing Tools\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Digital Publishing Platforms\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"AI-assisted publishing and document workflow tools\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-25 23:50:26','2026-10-25 23:50:26'),(520,'indesign-services~services-esnj','pp_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Pre-Press Services\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Every successful print job begins with accurate file preparation. Our Adobe InDesign pre-press expertise ensures every file is thoroughly checked for bleed settings, typography, image quality, colour specifications, and layout accuracy before production. This helps prevent costly printing errors, minimise rework, and deliver a polished, production-ready final output.\"},{\"title\":\"Magazine &amp; Newsletter Design\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"The layouts of professional magazines and newsletters are always, in a way, so as to keep readers interested; however, visual cohesiveness and readability do not go from their look. With our Adobe InDesign services, we at present publish magazines, annual reports, newsletters &amp; editorial publications, with good organization, efficient typography, and publishing (ready format), and are able to deliver as far as printing &amp; online dissemination are concerned.\"},{\"title\":\"Scientific Journal Publishing\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Scientific article formatting requires precision, consistency, and strict adherence to publisher guidelines. We ensure appropriate, legible typography and consistent formatting of author names, tables, graphs, figures, captions, and references to meet publication standards and maintain accuracy throughout the article.\"},{\"title\":\"Desktop Publishing (DTP)\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Our Adobe InDesign DTP services combine scalable production capacity, rigorous quality assurance, and dependable delivery timelines to support projects of any volume. From brochures and corporate reports to technical manuals and multilingual books, we follow standardised workflows and structured quality checks to maintain layout consistency, accuracy, and adherence to specifications—even across large, complex projects. The result: professionally formatted, production-ready documents delivered on schedule, without compromising quality.\"},{\"title\":\"Product Catalog Design\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"An efficient catalogue will increase the ease of finding product data while highlighting your brand more successfully. Professionally presented InDesign product catalog layouts created using Adobe InDesign to integrate with photos, price list, specs, and content to deliver attractive print and digital catalogs.\"}]',60,'2026-10-25 23:52:30','2026-10-25 23:52:30'),(521,'indesign-services~services-esnj','pp_flow','Process','Process cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"bg\":\"#EFF7FA\",\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"Project Discovery\",\"text\":\"The discovery session is primarily planned through a scheduled call, where stake holders in the design and production process are involved. Expectations, existing workflows, QA and delivery timelines are discussed.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"bg\":\"#FAEFEF\",\"c\":\"#CF6CB9\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"Content Structuring &amp; Layout Design\",\"text\":\"We integrate client-provided content, imagery, brand guidelines, and InDesign style guides into structured page layouts that meet the publication’s design and formatting requirements. A standardised production workflow, supported by systematic quality checks, ensures consistency across pages and documents while minimising errors and maintaining accuracy throughout the publication.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"bg\":\"#FAF6EF\",\"c\":\"#C9AC61\",\"iy\":263.23,\"title\":\"Typography &amp; Visual Formatting\",\"text\":\"The document is formatted in adherence to the style guide or brand guideline so that it conforms to your branding and publishing specifications.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"bg\":\"#EFF7FA\",\"c\":\"#59B38D\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"Quality Review &amp; Pre-Press Preparation\",\"text\":\"Stringent QA process and Pre-flight steps ensure error free output\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"bg\":\"#FAEFFA\",\"c\":\"#7F68CE\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"Client Review &amp; Revisions\",\"text\":\"Initial draft is shared with the client for review and feedback\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"bg\":\"#FAF6EF\",\"c\":\"#53A2BC\",\"iy\":234,\"title\":\"Final Delivery\",\"text\":\"Final print ready files are delivered after incorporating feedbacks.\"}]',70,'2026-10-25 23:52:30','2026-10-25 23:52:30'),(522,'newsletter-design','seo_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Magazine Layout\",\"Scientific Journals\",\"InDesign Layout\",\"Factsheets\"]',5,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(523,'newsletter-design','seo_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"capture\":\"Capture Demand\",\"convert\":\"Convert Interest\",\"qualify\":\"Qualify and Nurture\"}',19,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(524,'newsletter-design','seo_gallery','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"thumb-1.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-2.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-3.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-4.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-5.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-featured.png\",\"cats\":\"capture qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-6.png\",\"cats\":\"capture\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-7.png\",\"cats\":\"convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-8.png\",\"cats\":\"qualify\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-9.png\",\"cats\":\"capture convert\"},{\"img\":\"thumb-10.png\",\"cats\":\"convert qualify\"}]',20,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(525,'newsletter-design','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(526,'newsletter-design','seo_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House Newsletter Designers\",\"text\":\"Our in-house team coordinates newsletter templates, each issue\'s layout, review cycles and delivery.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"no\":\"02\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Repeatable Newsletter Design\",\"text\":\"We create clear layouts for recurring issues, balancing headlines, stories, graphics and brand consistency.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-charcoal)\",\"no\":\"03\",\"noa\":0.15,\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Newsletter Handling\",\"text\":\"Internal announcements, subscriber-facing drafts and planned editorial content are handled within the agreed workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Issue length, template needs, revision rounds, publishing schedules and fees are confirmed before work begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(527,'newsletter-design','seo_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"tool-gsc.png\",\"Google Search Console\",\"Monitor | Optimise\"],[\"tool-gtm.png\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Manage | Track\"],[\"tool-ahrefs.svg\",\"Ahrefs\",\"Backlinks | Research\"]],[[\"tool-gbp.png\",\"Google Business Profile\",\"Local | Visibility\"],[\"tool-bing.png\",\"Bing Webmaster\",\"Index | Monitor\"],[\"tool-screamingfrog.png\",\"Screaming Frog\",\"Crawl | Audit\"]],[[\"tool-ga4.png\",\"Google Analytics 4\",\"Track | Analyse\"],[\"tool-semrush.png\",\"Semrush\",\"Research | Analyse\"],[\"tool-surfer.svg\",\"Surfer\",\"Content | Optimise\"]]]',50,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(528,'newsletter-design','seo_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Email Newsletter Design\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Layout design built for email clients and mobile screens from the ground up\",\"Template setup within your email platform of choice\",\"Content block structure that makes identifying each issue straightforward\",\"Testing across major email clients before delivery\"]},{\"title\":\"Print Newsletter Design\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Grid and typography system set up for consistent print production\",\"Spread and content layout designed to your page count and format\",\"Press ready PDF production to your printer specifications\",\"Print file checks completed before submission\"]},{\"title\":\"Newsletter Template Design\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Newsletter template design built around your brand identity and content structure\",\"Reusable layouts your internal team can populate without designer involvement each time\",\"Separate templates for email and print so neither format is a compromise of the other\"]},{\"title\":\"Ongoing Newsletter Production\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Full design of each issue produced against your approved template\",\"Content integration covering copy, images, headers, and all supporting elements\",\"Consolidated review rounds and final file delivery to your publishing schedule\"]},{\"title\":\"Brand and Visual System for Newsletters\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Typography, colour, and layout rules documented as a working reference\",\"Visual standards that apply consistently across print and email formats\",\"Design system extensions for teams that have brand guidelines but no newsletter specific layout rules\"]}]',60,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(529,'newsletter-design','seo_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"art\":[-0.92,0,301.84,300],\"title\":\"Brief and format confirmation\",\"text\":\"We establish what the newsletter needs to do, who it goes to, and how it will be delivered. Print, email, or both are confirmed at this stage along with the publishing frequency and delivery timeline.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"art\":[0,31.19,300,237.61],\"title\":\"Layout system or template development\",\"text\":\"For new newsletters, we build the layout system and visual direction before any issue goes into production. For existing newsletters, we review what you currently have and agree on what stays, what changes, and what gets documented properly.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Issue design and content placement\",\"text\":\"Each issue is produced against the approved layout system. Copy, images, headers, and supporting elements are placed, checked for consistency, and prepared for your review.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Review and revisions\",\"text\":\"You review the full issue and provide feedback in one consolidated round. Revisions are completed within the agreed scope.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Final delivery\",\"text\":\"Print newsletters go out as press ready PDFs built to your printer specifications. Email newsletters are delivered as tested, platform ready files. Source files are transferred on completion.\"}]',70,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(530,'newsletter-design','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Pre-Press Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We prepare, inspect and refine artwork for production, checking layouts, colours, bleeds and specifications before files reach the printer.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Magazine Design\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We design editorial layouts, covers and recurring templates for print and digital magazines, maintaining a consistent reading experience across every issue.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Academic &amp; Technical Publishing Support\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We assist with manuscript editing, journal-aligned formatting, technical figures and submission preparation while keeping your research content and intended meaning intact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Multilingual Publishing &amp; Localization\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We adapt page layouts, typography and document formatting across languages, accounting for text expansion, reading patterns and production requirements.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Catalog\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise product imagery, specifications and categories into clear, consistent catalogue layouts that help buyers compare options and find relevant information.\"},{\"no\":\"06\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"InDesign Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We create structured, editable layouts for brochures, reports, publications and catalogues, using consistent styles and print or digital output settings.\"}]',80,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(531,'newsletter-design','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What do newsletter design services include?\",\"Newsletter design services cover the layout, typography, image placement, and file preparation for a newsletter - whether it goes out in print or by email. At Intelliworkz, it also includes building the template system and production process that makes every issue after the first one faster and more consistent.\"],[\"What is the difference between print and email newsletter design?\",\"Print newsletters are built to press specifications: correct bleed, colour profiles, and resolution for the press. Email newsletters are designed and tested as platform ready templates that render correctly across different email clients and screen sizes.\"],[\"Do you handle ongoing newsletter production or just the initial design?\",\"Both. We can build the template and hand it over for your team to manage, or handle the full production of every issue - design, content integration, review, and delivery - on your publishing schedule.\"],[\"How long does it take to design a newsletter?\",\"The first issue takes the longest because the layout system is being established. Once that is approved, each subsequent issue is produced faster and to a consistent standard. A timeline is agreed before work begins so your publishing schedule is not affected.\"],[\"Can you manage both our print and email newsletter design?\",\"Yes. We handle both formats as part of one engagement. Print and email templates are developed separately so each is built correctly for its delivery format, but the visual identity and brand standards run consistently across both.\"],[\"Do you work with existing brand guidelines?\",\"Yes. We design within your existing guidelines. If those guidelines do not include newsletter specific layout rules, we build that out as part of the first issue and document it so every edition that follows has a clear production reference.\"]]',90,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(532,'newsletter-design~work-hxa5','pp_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"email\":\"Email Newsletter Design\",\"print\":\"Print Newsletter Design\",\"template\":\"Newsletter Template Design\"}',19,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(533,'newsletter-design~work-hxa5','pp_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"email\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"print\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"template\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"email print\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"print template\"}]',20,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(536,'newsletter-design~tools-rpaj','mg_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-indesign.svg\",\"#54001A\",\"Adobe InDesign\",\"\"],[\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"\"],[\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"\"],[\"tool-acrobat.svg\",\"#B40B00\",\"Adobe Acrobat\",\"\"],[\"tool-figma.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Figma\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Mailchimp\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"HubSpot\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Canva Pro\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-25 23:55:40','2026-10-25 23:55:40'),(537,'motion-graphics','ve_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Educational Videos\",\"Training Videos\",\"Process Videos\",\"Marketing Videos\"]',5,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(538,'motion-graphics','ve_form_fields','Enquiry form','Enquiry form fields','[[\"Full Name\",\"Enter your first name\",\"text\",\"name\"],[\"Company Name\",\"Enter your company name\",\"text\",\"company\"],[\"Email ID\",\"Enter your email ID\",\"email\",\"email\"],[\"Contact Number\",\"Enter your contact number\",\"tel\",\"phone\"]]',2,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(539,'motion-graphics','ve_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"concept\":\"Concept and Pre-Production\",\"2d\":\"2D Motion Graphics\",\"3d\":\"3D Motion Graphics\"}',19,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(540,'motion-graphics','ve_cards','Portfolio','Portfolio videos','[{\"title\":\"Brand Film\",\"meta\":\"Brand Films&nbsp; /&nbsp; Commercials\",\"cats\":\"concept\",\"overlay\":null,\"video\":\"uploads/videos/2026/10/hiring-video-new-trfkwnwb-nfai.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"meta\":\"Product Videos&nbsp; /&nbsp; Social\",\"cats\":\"2d\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-1.png\",\"video\":\"https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Commercial\",\"meta\":\"Commercials&nbsp; /&nbsp; Brand Films\",\"cats\":\"3d\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-2.png\",\"video\":\"https://interactive-examples.mdn.mozilla.net/media/cc0-videos/flower.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Event Film\",\"meta\":\"Events&nbsp; /&nbsp; Social\",\"cats\":\"2d 3d\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/AEICMeqa1B8\"}]',20,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(541,'motion-graphics','ve_stats_top','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"30\",\"Industries Served\"]]',30,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(542,'motion-graphics','ve_stats_bottom','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(543,'motion-graphics','ve_pillars','Why Intelliworkz','Feature cards','[{\"img\":\"feature-1.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"bg\":\"#EDF4FA\",\"x\":116.58,\"title\":\"In-house editing team\",\"text\":\"All video editing work is handled entirely in-house. No freelancers, no subcontracting.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-2-19c91a.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"bg\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"x\":116.58,\"title\":\"Dedicated project team\",\"text\":\"The same team works on your project from start to finish. Your standards and feedback are carried forward.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-3.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #EDF2FC 0%, #FFFFFF 100%), #F5F5F5\",\"x\":56,\"title\":\"Secure your content\",\"text\":\"Your footage, files and unpublished material are handled under strict security protocols.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-4-68b7aa.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"bg\":\"#FEFEFE\",\"x\":77.82,\"title\":\"Transparent pricing\",\"text\":\"All video editing work is quoted clearly in advance. No hidden costs, no surprises.\"}]',40,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(544,'motion-graphics','ve_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-aftereffects.png\",\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Animate | Composite\"],[\"assets/icons/magazine/tool-illustrator-full.svg\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Prepare\"],[\"assets/icons/magazine/tool-photoshop-full.svg\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Prepare | Composite\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"Cinema 4D\",\"Model | Animate\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"Blender\",\"Model | Animate\"]]',50,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(545,'motion-graphics','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Concept and Pre-Production\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Scripting from your brief, or review of a script you supply\",\"Storyboarding and shot sequencing\",\"Style frames establishing the visual direction\",\"Illustration and asset creation in your brand style\"]},{\"title\":\"2D Motion Graphics\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"2D character, object, and scene animation\",\"Kinetic typography and text-led sequences\",\"Infographic, chart, and data animation\",\"Logo stings and transition packages\",\"Interface and product motion for websites and applications\"]},{\"title\":\"3D Motion Graphics\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"3D modelling, texturing, rigging, and rendering\",\"Product visualisation and 3D walkthroughs\",\"Motion sequences\",\"Environmental and scene builds for campaign content\"]},{\"title\":\"Sound, Localisation and Delivery\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Sound design, music selection, and mixing\",\"Voiceover recording and integration\",\"Subtitling, captions, and localised language versions\",\"Exports for broadcast, digital, social, and in-product placement\",\"Editable source files transferred on completion\"]}]',60,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(546,'motion-graphics','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"step-art-1.png\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Brief and objective\",\"We confirm what the animation is required to communicate, the intended audience, the duration, and the channels it will be published on.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"step-art-2.png\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Script and storyboard\",\"You approve the narrative and shot sequence before production begins. Revisions at this stage carry no cost, as no animation has been produced.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"step-art-3.png\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"Style frames\",\"Two or three key frames establish the visual direction and are signed off on before full animation starts.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"step-art-4.png\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Animation\",\"Assets are built and animated against the approved storyboard and the agreed motion specification.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"step-art-5.png\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Sound and refinement\",\"Music, sound design, voiceover, and final timing are completed.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"step-art-6.png\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Review and final delivery\",\"You provide feedback, and we implement the changes across the revision rounds your agreement covers. We then export in every required format and aspect ratio and transfer the structured source files.\"]]',70,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(547,'motion-graphics','ve_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Video Editing\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"text\":\"We turn supplied footage into clear, engaging videos through editing, pacing, colour adjustments, sound and graphics, prepared for the intended platforms.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Explainer Videos\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-2-56586a.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We turn products, services and complex ideas into understandable video stories through scripting, storyboards, visual design and animation.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-3-56586b.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"text\":\"We create product-focused videos that demonstrate features, benefits and real-world use, helping audiences understand what the product does and why it matters.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Social Media Reels\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We edit short-form videos with purposeful pacing, captions and platform-appropriate formats that keep your message clear and visually consistent.\"}]',80,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(548,'motion-graphics','ve_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What types of motion graphics do you create?\",\"Explainers, product and interface animation, kinetic typography, infographic and data animation, logo stings, brand idents and 3D product visualisation.\"],[\"What\'s included in your motion graphics design services?\",\"Scripting, storyboarding, style frames, illustration, animation, sound design, subtitling, per-platform exports, source files.\"],[\"What motion graphics software and tools do you use?\",\"After Effects, Illustrator, and Photoshop for 2D, and Cinema 4D and Blender for 3D. Additionally, there is a Lottie export, where the animation is played on a website or an app.\"],[\"Are your motion graphics optimized for different platforms?\",\"Yes. Each asset is rendered to match the exact aspect ratios and resolutions required for each channel, such as 16:9 for broadcast and web use, 9:16 for vertical, and 1:1 for feed placement.\"],[\"Why should you use motion graphics for your business?\",\"Animation captures your audience\'s attention for longer than a static image and clarifies an explanation, the function of a product, or a group of figures a lot quicker. An animated asset can be used on your website, in a sales presentation, and distributed on social networks.\"],[\"What file formats do motion graphics come in?\",\"MP4 and MOV for standard use, GIF for email and lightweight web placements, and Lottie or JSON where the animation runs within a website or application.\"],[\"How much do professional motion graphics services cost?\",\"The price will vary according to complexity, length, and the output (2D/3D). Once we\'ve looked at your brief, we can confirm the price. Monthly fees apply to retainer clients.\"]]',90,'2026-10-26 00:07:13','2026-10-26 00:07:13'),(549,'motion-graphics~stats-6whk','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-26 00:11:32','2026-10-26 00:11:32'),(550,'motion-graphics~why-1jqb','seo_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House Motion Design Team\",\"text\":\"Our in-house designers coordinate style frames, motion design, review rounds and final animation delivery.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"no\":\"02\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Storyboard-Led Motion Graphics\",\"text\":\"We develop style frames and motion sequences around your message before building the final animated content.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-charcoal)\",\"no\":\"03\",\"noa\":0.15,\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Creative Asset Handling\",\"text\":\"Unreleased storyboards, scripts and source assets are handled within the agreed motion design workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Animation duration, visual style, revision stages, deadlines and pricing are agreed before production begins.\"}]',40,'2026-10-26 00:12:04','2026-10-26 00:12:04'),(551,'explainer-videos','ve_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Product Explainer Videos\",\"Service Explainer Videos\",\"Process & Workflow Animations\",\"Educational Explainer Videos\"]',5,'2026-10-26 00:20:46','2026-10-26 00:20:46'),(552,'explainer-videos','ve_form_fields','Enquiry form','Enquiry form fields','[[\"Full Name\",\"Enter your first name\",\"text\",\"name\"],[\"Company Name\",\"Enter your company name\",\"text\",\"company\"],[\"Email ID\",\"Enter your email ID\",\"email\",\"email\"],[\"Contact Number\",\"Enter your contact number\",\"tel\",\"phone\"]]',2,'2026-10-26 00:20:46','2026-10-26 00:20:46'),(553,'explainer-videos','ve_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"corporate\":\"Corporate & Brand Explainer Videos\",\"training\":\"Training & Educational Videos\",\"covers\":\"What Our Explainer Video Production Covers\"}',19,'2026-10-26 00:20:46','2026-10-26 00:20:46'),(554,'explainer-videos','ve_cards','Portfolio','Portfolio videos','[{\"title\":\"Brand Film\",\"meta\":\"Brand Films&nbsp; /&nbsp; Commercials\",\"cats\":\"corporate\",\"overlay\":null,\"video\":\"uploads/videos/2026/10/hiring-video-new-trfkwnwb-dpdb.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"meta\":\"Product Videos&nbsp; /&nbsp; Social\",\"cats\":\"training\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-1.png\",\"video\":\"https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Commercial\",\"meta\":\"Commercials&nbsp; /&nbsp; Brand Films\",\"cats\":\"covers\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-2.png\",\"video\":\"https://interactive-examples.mdn.mozilla.net/media/cc0-videos/flower.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Event Film\",\"meta\":\"Events&nbsp; /&nbsp; Social\",\"cats\":\"corporate training\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"video\":\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/AEICMeqa1B8\"}]',20,'2026-10-26 00:20:48','2026-10-26 00:20:48'),(555,'explainer-videos','ve_stats_top','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"2500\",\"Projects Delivered\"],[\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"30\",\"Industries Served\"]]',30,'2026-10-26 00:20:48','2026-10-26 00:20:48'),(556,'explainer-videos','ve_stats_bottom','Numbers','Statistic','[[\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-26 00:20:48','2026-10-26 00:20:48'),(557,'explainer-videos','ve_pillars','Why Intelliworkz','Feature cards','[{\"img\":\"feature-1.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"bg\":\"#EDF4FA\",\"x\":116.58,\"title\":\"In-house editing team\",\"text\":\"All video editing work is handled entirely in-house. No freelancers, no subcontracting.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-2-19c91a.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"bg\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"x\":116.58,\"title\":\"Dedicated project team\",\"text\":\"The same team works on your project from start to finish. Your standards and feedback are carried forward.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-3.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(135deg, #EDF2FC 0%, #FFFFFF 100%), #F5F5F5\",\"x\":56,\"title\":\"Secure your content\",\"text\":\"Your footage, files and unpublished material are handled under strict security protocols.\"},{\"img\":\"feature-4-68b7aa.png\",\"icon\":\"feat-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"bg\":\"#FEFEFE\",\"x\":77.82,\"title\":\"Transparent pricing\",\"text\":\"All video editing work is quoted clearly in advance. No hidden costs, no surprises.\"}]',40,'2026-10-26 00:20:48','2026-10-26 00:20:48'),(558,'explainer-videos','ve_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-premiere.png\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro\",\"Edit | Assemble\"],[\"tool-aftereffects.png\",\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Animate | Composite\"],[\"tool-finalcut.png\",\"Final Cut Pro\",\"Edit | Deliver\"],[\"tool-davinci.png\",\"DaVinci Resolve\",\"Grade | Finish\"],[\"tool-audition.png\",\"Adobe Audition\",\"Clean | Mix\"],[\"tool-frameio-1658d8.png\",\"Frame.io\",\"Review | Approve\"]]',50,'2026-10-26 00:20:48','2026-10-26 00:20:48'),(559,'explainer-videos','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Corporate &amp; Brand Explainer Videos\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Our corporate &amp; brand explainer videos dive into your brand’s essence – services, mission, vision, and value – and present them as a story that’s professional, appealing, and easily grasped, whether on a website, in presentations, in exhibitions, or in corporate settings.\"},{\"title\":\"Software &amp; SaaS Explainer Videos\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"We bring software and SaaS products into sharp focus. Whether it’s an intro to how it works, how to onboard users, explaining new features, or showing the platform, our SaaS explainers help customers understand and experience your solution better.\"},{\"title\":\"Training &amp; Educational Videos\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Even internal communication deserves a strong visual impact. Our training and educational videos will present training, processes, compliance standards, or simply facts in a clear, memorable, and engaging animated or illustrated way.\"},{\"title\":\"Marketing &amp; Promotional Videos\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"Launching a new product or service, finishing a campaign, whatever your circumstances, the delivery of your promotional message needs to be quick and conclusive. Explainer promotional videos tell your story when it&#039;s live – keep it appearing on the platforms that matter; across ad campaigns, at events and on social media.\"},{\"title\":\"Motion Graphics &amp; Visual Storytelling\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[],\"para\":\"If your story may defy a live-action format, then you need to see it in motion. We leverage motion graphics to translate your statistics, processes, concepts, and data into visually compelling stories for better understanding and memorability.\"}]',60,'2026-10-26 00:20:48','2026-10-26 00:20:48'),(560,'explainer-videos','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"step-art-1.png\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Discovery and Brief\",\"We get to understand your business, audience, goals, and what you need your video to say. From here we establish the creative journey.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"step-art-2.png\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Script &amp; Storyboard\",\"We write a script and design concepts and a visual storyboard for you to see before animation starts.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"step-art-3.png\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"Design &amp; Animation\",\"Our designers and animators create unique illustrations, motion graphics, characters, visual effects and transitions, aligned with your brand guidelines.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"step-art-4.png\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Voiceover and Sound Design\",\"A professional voiceover, soundtrack, and sound effects are laid down to enhance viewing and engagement.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"step-art-5.png\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Review and Redo\",\"You get to review a first draft, and we implement your feedback to develop the animation, visuals, motion, and messages to your expectations.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"step-art-6.png\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Final Delivery\",\"The finished video is exported in whatever format/s (i.e., file size, resolution, and aspect ratio) you need for your website, presentations, social campaigns, YouTube, LinkedIn, Instagram, etc.\"]]',70,'2026-10-26 00:20:48','2026-10-26 00:20:48'),(561,'explainer-videos','ve_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Video Editing\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"text\":\"We turn supplied footage into clear, engaging videos through editing, pacing, colour adjustments, sound and graphics, prepared for the intended platforms.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Motion Graphics\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-2-56586a.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We create animated typography, illustrations and graphic sequences that make messages more engaging while maintaining your brand\'s visual style.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-3-56586b.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"text\":\"We create product-focused videos that demonstrate features, benefits and real-world use, helping audiences understand what the product does and why it matters.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Social Media Reels\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We edit short-form videos with purposeful pacing, captions and platform-appropriate formats that keep your message clear and visually consistent.\"}]',80,'2026-10-26 00:20:48','2026-10-26 00:20:48'),(562,'explainer-videos','ve_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What is an explainer video, and how can it benefit my business?\",\"An explainer video presents a product, service or process in a focused visual story. It can help visitors, prospects or internal teams understand an idea quickly and see what action to take next.\"],[\"Why should I hire a professional explainer video company?\",\"A production team can help shape the message, develop the script and storyboard, create suitable visuals and handle animation, audio and editing as one coordinated project.\"],[\"What industries use explainer video services?\",\"Explainer videos can support manufacturing, technology, healthcare, education, finance, consumer products and other sectors that need to make products, services or processes easier to understand.\"],[\"What is included in explainer video production services?\",\"Depending on the brief, the process can include concept development, scripting, storyboard design, illustration, animation, voiceover, music, editing, revisions and delivery in the agreed formats.\"],[\"How long does it take to produce an animated explainer video?\",\"The schedule depends on duration, illustration or animation complexity, voiceover requirements and approval rounds. We confirm milestones and turnaround after reviewing the brief.\"],[\"What should I look for when choosing an explainer video agency?\",\"Review whether the agency can explain your message clearly, show relevant production work, manage script-to-delivery steps and specify revisions, timelines and final file formats.\"]]',90,'2026-10-26 00:20:48','2026-10-26 00:20:48'),(563,'explainer-videos~why-8fom','td_benefit_cards','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#7FB5C8\",\"icon\":\"benefit-1.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"title\":\"In-House Explainer Video Team\",\"text\":\"We define the video’s objective, target audience, key message, style, duration, deliverables, timelines, and budget before production begins.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"icon\":\"benefit-2.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"title\":\"Script-to-Screen Explainers\",\"text\":\"We develop the script and visual flow, then bring the story to life through illustration, animation, voice-over, graphics, and sound, aligned with your brand and communication goals.\",\"raised\":true},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#2D2D2D\",\"icon\":\"benefit-3.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-near-black)\",\"title\":\"Confidential Script and Asset Handling\",\"text\":\"Allprovided assets and work-in-progress files are handled securely. Final videos are delivered in the agreed formats and resolutions, within the approved timeline, with revisions managed according to the project scope.\",\"raised\":false},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#6B8F3E\",\"icon\":\"benefit-4.svg\",\"ring\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Deliverables, project scope, revision limits, timelines, and pricing are clearly defined upfront, ensuring transparency, avoiding unexpected costs, and setting clear expectations from the start\",\"raised\":false}]',40,'2026-10-26 00:23:25','2026-10-26 00:23:25'),(564,'explainer-videos~tools-j15z','mg_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-illustrator.svg\",\"#330000\",\"Adobe Illustrator\",\"Illustrate | Prepare\"],[\"tool-photoshop.svg\",\"#001834\",\"Adobe Photoshop\",\"Prepare | Refine\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Animate | Composite\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro\",\"Edit | Assemble\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Blender\",\"Model | Animate\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Frame.io\",\"\"],[\"assets/icons/seo/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"AI-assisted production tools\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-26 00:25:12','2026-10-26 00:25:12'),(565,'product-video','ve_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"Product Demonstration Videos\",\"Feature Walkthrough Videos\",\"Product Launch Videos\",\"Software Demo Videos\"]',5,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(566,'product-video','ve_form_fields','Enquiry form','Enquiry form fields','[[\"Full Name\",\"Enter your first name\",\"text\",\"name\"],[\"Company Name\",\"Enter your company name\",\"text\",\"company\"],[\"Email ID\",\"Enter your email ID\",\"email\",\"email\"],[\"Contact Number\",\"Enter your contact number\",\"tel\",\"phone\"]]',2,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(567,'product-video','ve_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All Work\",\"demo\":\"Demo and Explainer Videos\",\"saas\":\"SaaS and Software\",\"sales\":\"Sales and Launch\"}',19,'2026-10-26 00:27:58','2026-10-26 00:27:58'),(568,'product-video','ve_cards','Portfolio','Portfolio videos','[{\"title\":\"Brand Film\",\"meta\":\"Brand Films&nbsp; /&nbsp; Commercials\",\"cats\":\"demo\",\"overlay\":null,\"video\":\"uploads/videos/2026/10/hiring-video-new-trfkwnwb-nfai-jkka.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"meta\":\"Product Videos&nbsp; /&nbsp; Social\",\"cats\":\"saas\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-1.png\",\"video\":\"https://www.w3schools.com/html/mov_bbb.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"