cture early.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"step-art-4.png\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Production\",\"We animate, edit, and add voiceover and sound, building the video to your brand.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"step-art-5.png\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Your feedback\",\"You review the work, and we refine it across the revision rounds we agree on upfront.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"step-art-6.png\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Delivery\",\"We deliver the video in every format and size you need, ready for your website, sales, and social.\"]]',70,'2026-10-26 00:28:01','2026-10-26 00:28:01'),(575,'product-video','ve_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Video Editing\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"text\":\"We turn supplied footage into clear, engaging videos through editing, pacing, colour adjustments, sound and graphics, prepared for the intended platforms.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Motion Graphics\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-2-56586a.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We create animated typography, illustrations and graphic sequences that make messages more engaging while maintaining your brand\'s visual style.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Explainer Videos\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-3-56586b.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"text\":\"We turn products, services and complex ideas into understandable video stories through scripting, storyboards, visual design and animation.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Social Media Reels\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We edit short-form videos with purposeful pacing, captions and platform-appropriate formats that keep your message clear and visually consistent.\"}]',80,'2026-10-26 00:28:01','2026-10-26 00:28:01'),(576,'product-video','ve_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What are product demo videos?\",\"They\'re short videos that highlight how your product works and why it matters – it’s typically under two minutes. A demonstration emphasizes the problem your product solves, as well as what it gives customers value from, over simply being an index of every single feature. It is usually what will make these of value for Sales, Web pages, and Onboarding\"],[\"What\'s included in your product demo video production process?\",\"Discovery, scripting, storyboarding, filming or animation, voiceover, sound design, and deliver the final video in all required formats and short formats for social as needed. You have final say on both the script and the storyboard prior to commencing production.\"],[\"What types of videos can a product demo company create?\",\"Product demos and walkthroughs, animated explainers, UI and SaaS screen demos, onboarding videos, launch videos, and sales videos. As one of the more versatile best product demo videos producers, we match the format to your product and your goal rather than using one template for everything.\"],[\"Can you create custom product demo videos based on our brand guidelines?\",\"Yes. Every video is built to your brand: your colours, fonts, tone and visual style, with voiceover to match. The demo looks like it came from your business, which keeps your brand consistent across every video you produce.\"],[\"What file formats and platforms do you deliver for?\",\"We supply in both MP4 and MOV formats for most uses, together with all the different size/aspect ratios required by each platform, e.g., 16:9 for your website and YouTube as well as 9:16 and 1:1 for social media. Captioned and silent versions are also available.\"],[\"Why should I hire a product demo video company?\",\"Because a demo video has to do a sales job, and that takes more than good animation. Working with a product demo video maker who understands how to structure a story and lead a viewer to a decision is what turns a nice-looking video into one that actually converts.\"]]',90,'2026-10-26 00:28:01','2026-10-26 00:28:01'),(577,'product-video~stats-6whk','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-26 00:28:01','2026-10-26 00:28:01'),(579,'product-video~offers-1qa8','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Video Editing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We turn supplied footage into clear, engaging videos through editing, pacing, colour adjustments, sound and graphics, prepared for the intended platforms.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Motion Graphics\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We create animated typography, illustrations and graphic sequences that make messages more engaging while maintaining your brand\'s visual style.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Explainer Videos\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We turn products, services and complex ideas into understandable video stories through scri