on records are handled within the agreed project workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Lead criteria, channel activity, reporting, timelines and pricing are agreed before campaigns begin.\"}]',40,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(604,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial','seo_tools','Tools','Tools','[[[\"tool-gsc.png\",\"Google Search Console\",\"Monitor | Optimise\"],[\"tool-gtm.png\",\"Google Tag Manager\",\"Manage | Track\"],[\"tool-ahrefs.svg\",\"Ahrefs\",\"Backlinks | Research\"]],[[\"tool-gbp.png\",\"Google Business Profile\",\"Local | Visibility\"],[\"tool-bing.png\",\"Bing Webmaster\",\"Index | Monitor\"],[\"tool-screamingfrog.png\",\"Screaming Frog\",\"Crawl | Audit\"]],[[\"tool-ga4.png\",\"Google Analytics 4\",\"Track | Analyse\"],[\"tool-semrush.png\",\"Semrush\",\"Research | Analyse\"],[\"tool-surfer.svg\",\"Surfer\",\"Content | Optimise\"]]]',50,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(605,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial','seo_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Technical SEO\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Site architecture and crawlability\",\"Core Web Vitals and page speed\",\"Schema and structured data\",\"Indexation management\",\"JavaScript SEO\",\"Site-health monitoring\"]},{\"title\":\"On-Page & Content SEO\",\"points\":[\"Keyword and intent mapping\",\"On-page optimisation\",\"Internal linking structure\",\"SEO content and copywriting\",\"Topical authority building\",\"Content optimised for AI answer engines\"]},{\"title\":\"Off-Page SEO & Link Building\",\"points\":[\"Digital PR and editorial outreach\",\"Backlink strategy and vetting\",\"Brand-authority building\",\"Competitor link analysis\",\"Local and international link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"B2B & International SEO\",\"points\":[\"Long, considered buying cycles\",\"Multi-language, multi-region rollouts\",\"Hreflang implementation\",\"Market-specific content\"]},{\"title\":\"Local SEO\",\"points\":[\"Google Business Profile management\",\"Local visibility and citations\",\"Local link acquisition\"]},{\"title\":\"SEO Reporting & Analytics\",\"points\":[\"Transparent monthly reporting\",\"Traffic, leads, and revenue tracking\",\"Clear next steps\"]}]',60,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(606,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial','seo_workflow','Process','Process steps','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"color\":\"var(--c-yellow)\",\"img\":\"step-1.png\",\"art\":[-0.92,0,301.84,300],\"title\":\"Discover\",\"text\":\"Understand your business, market, competitors, target audience, and commercial objectives.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"color\":\"var(--c-pink)\",\"img\":\"step-2.png\",\"art\":[0,31.19,300,237.61],\"title\":\"Audit\",\"text\":\"Assess technical health, content gaps, backlink profile, and ranking opportunities in a clear, prioritised report.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"color\":\"var(--c-green)\",\"img\":\"step-3.png\",\"art\":[9.76,23.52,280.49,252.96],\"title\":\"Strategy\",\"text\":\"Build a keyword and content roadmap mapped to buyer intent and ranked by commercial impact.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"color\":\"var(--c-gold)\",\"img\":\"step-4.png\",\"art\":[9.44,34.91,281.13,230.19],\"title\":\"Execution\",\"text\":\"Implement technical fixes, on-page optimisation, content, and authority building against the roadmap.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"color\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"img\":\"step-5.png\",\"art\":[1.29,29.14,297.43,241.72],\"title\":\"Reporting\",\"text\":\"Deliver transparent monthly reporting tied to traffic, leads, and revenue, with clear next steps.\"}]',70,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(607,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Digital Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We coordinate search, paid advertising, social campaigns, content and measurement to help businesses reach relevant audiences and turn attention into enquiries.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"SEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We improve search visibility through technical audits, on-page optimisation, content planning and practical implementation, with performance tracked against business goals.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"AEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise content around customer questions, clear answers and structured signals that make information easier for search engines and assistants to understand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"GEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We strengthen content structure, entity information and technical signals to help AI-powered discovery systems understand and reference your brand.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Content Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We plan, research and develop useful content for each stage of the buyer journey, aligned with your audience, brand voice and search goals.\"}]',80,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(608,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial','seo_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What are lead generation services?\",\"Lead gen campaigns are used to source and secure prospective customers who are interested in buying what you\\u2019re selling, who you will then \\u201cqualify\\u201d for sales. Typically, this requires bringing together search advertising, pay-per-click ads, valuable content, and lead pages to get you connected to prospects who are eager to engage with your company.\"],[\"What lead generation channels do you use?\",\"We utilize the channels most apt to find and engage your buyers: SEO for relevant search intent, Google & paid social ads, LinkedIn to engage individuals by role and industry, content offers, and optimized landing pages. The appropriate marketing blend will be customized based on how your buyers invest their time.\"],[\"How do you measure lead generation success?\",\"We analyze the volume of leads, their qualification level based on what\\u2019s important to you, lead quality by volume and cost per lead, and where your leads come from. Volume is just numbers; our report highlights qualified leads and the cost associated with obtaining said leads.\"],[\"How long does it take to see results from lead generation?\",\"With paid channels, you can have new leads within the first few weeks; SEO will take 3-6 months (along with content). From the start, we align with expectations of every channel.\"],[\"Why does my business need lead generation services?\",\"Without a reliable stream of quality leads, sales teams inevitably waste their time chasing up cold prospects, and revenue becomes difficult to forecast. A managed lead generation programme gives your team a consistent supply of prospects worth pursuing, which is why lead generation companies for small businesses and larger firms alike are used to support growth.\"],[\"Why should I outsource lead generation services?\",\"Setting up an in-house lead generation function involves recruiting for several skills (SEO, paid, content, analytics) and then maintaining several tools to serve these. Outsourcing can provide you with that full capability more cheaply than building a team. That is why several businesses, as well as lead generation for marketing agencies operating under their own brand, rely on a professional.\"]]',90,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(609,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~work-hxa5','pp_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"packaging\":\"Packaging Pre-Press\",\"commercial\":\"Commercial Print\",\"digital\":\"Digital Pre-Press\",\"colour\":\"Colour Management & Proofing\"}',19,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(610,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~work-hxa5','pp_strip','Gallery','Gallery images','[{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"packaging\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"commercial\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"digital\"},{\"img\":\"strip-b.png\",\"cats\":\"colour\"},{\"img\":\"strip-a.png\",\"cats\":\"packaging commercial\"}]',20,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(612,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~services-8be1','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Capture Demand\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Search engine optimisation for high-intent terms\",\"Google Ads and paid search campaigns\",\"Paid social and LinkedIn advertising\",\"Remarketing to re-engage past visitors\"]},{\"title\":\"Convert Interest\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Landing page design and optimisation\",\"Lead capture forms and lead magnets\",\"Content offers, guides and gated resources\",\"Conversion rate optimisation\"]},{\"title\":\"Qualify and Nurture\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Lead scoring and qualification\",\"Email nurture sequences\",\"CRM setup and lead handover\",\"Follow-up and re-engagement campaigns\"]},{\"title\":\"Measure and Improve\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Cost-per-lead and conversion tracking\",\"Campaign reporting tied to lead quality\",\"Ongoing testing and optimisation\",\"Regular strategy reviews\"]}]',60,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(613,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~services-8be1','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/01-qbdluuyc-vaab-ej7f-sg4e-qus1-gfhp.webp\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Define the lead\",\"We agree what a qualified lead looks like for your business: the industry, company size, role and intent that mark a real opportunity. Every campaign is built to reach and capture that specific profile.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/02-ivobma9r-oijj-eoyf-vf0w-t8ql-otl5.webp\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Plan the campaign\",\"We choose the channels most likely to reach those buyers within your budget, and plan the campaigns, messages and offers designed to convert them into leads.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/03-atou7svd-tnrk-7giz-9ivd-q6cu-yqz2.webp\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"Build and launch\",\"We build the campaigns, landing pages, forms and tracking, and launch. Measurement is in place from the start, so we can see the quality of leads from day one, not just the quantity.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/04-ow2wzv5u-dtt3-chxe-1isi-mbhi-keyj.webp\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Qualify and hand over\",\"As leads come in, we score them against your definition and pass the qualified ones to your sales team or CRM, with the context they need for a productive first conversation.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/05-nk6rwzuy-7dno-dokp-seyx-luky-c7yv.webp\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Optimise\",\"We review which channels, messages and offers produce the best leads at the lowest cost, and shift budget and effort toward them. This is continuous, so results improve over time.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"uploads\\/images\\/2026\\/10\\/06-mxeqzjlh-axrv-rnqt-h1ts-s5ns-2rpq.webp\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Report\",\"Each month you receive a report on leads generated, their quality, the cost per lead, and what we recommend next, tied to the outcomes that matter to your sales team.\"]]',70,'2026-10-26 00:53:41','2026-10-26 00:53:41'),(614,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~tools-utti','ve_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"tool-premiere.png\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro\",\"Edit | Assemble\"],[\"tool-aftereffects.png\",\"Adobe After Effects\",\"Animate | Composite\"],[\"tool-finalcut.png\",\"Final Cut Pro\",\"Edit | Deliver\"],[\"tool-davinci.png\",\"DaVinci Resolve\",\"Grade | Finish\"],[\"tool-audition.png\",\"Adobe Audition\",\"Clean | Mix\"],[\"tool-frameio-1658d8.png\",\"Frame.io\",\"Review | Approve\"]]',50,'2026-10-26 00:57:52','2026-10-26 00:57:52'),(615,'3d-visualization-product-architectural-industrial~why-ilgj','ppt_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"tint\":\"#B5DEEB\",\"no\":\"01\",\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House Digital Marketing Team\",\"text\":\"Our in-house specialists coordinate digital channels, campaign execution, performance reviews and reporting.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"tint\":\"#FFD5D9\",\"no\":\"02\",\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Coordinated Channel Strategy\",\"text\":\"We connect content, search, paid media and analytics around a defined business objective and audience.\"},{\"c\":\"#141717\",\"tint\":\"#666666\",\"no\":\"03\",\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Account and Data Handling\",\"text\":\"Campaign access, audience data and reporting information are handled within the agreed working process.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"tint\":\"#8DAC65\",\"no\":\"04\",\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Channel scope, deliverables, reporting schedules, timelines and service fees are clarified before campaigns begin.\"}]',40,'2026-10-26 00:59:59','2026-10-26 00:59:59'),(616,'3d-animation','ve_benefits','Hero','Benefit chips under the intro','[\"100% In-House Editing Team\",\"Turnaround Confirmed Upfront\",\"Same \\/ Similar Editors Across Projects\",\"Multi-Format & Multi-Platform Delivery\"]',5,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(617,'3d-animation','ve_form_fields','Enquiry form','Enquiry form fields','[[\"Full Name\",\"Enter your first name\",\"text\",\"name\"],[\"Company Name\",\"Enter your company name\",\"text\",\"company\"],[\"Email ID\",\"Enter your email ID\",\"email\",\"email\"],[\"Contact Number\",\"Enter your contact number\",\"tel\",\"phone\"]]',2,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(618,'3d-animation','ve_filters','Gallery','Filter tab names','{\"all\":\"All\",\"brand-films\":\"Brand Films\",\"commercials\":\"Commercials\",\"product-videos\":\"Product Videos\",\"events\":\"Events\",\"social\":\"Social\",\"training\":\"Training\"}',19,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(619,'3d-animation','ve_cards','Portfolio','Portfolio videos','[{\"title\":\"Brand Film\",\"meta\":\"Brand Films&nbsp; \\/&nbsp; Commercials\",\"cats\":\"brand-films commercials\",\"overlay\":null,\"video\":\"uploads\\/videos\\/2026\\/10\\/hiring-video-new-trfkwnwb-nfai-bqgx.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"meta\":\"Product Videos&nbsp; \\/&nbsp; Social\",\"cats\":\"product-videos social\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-1.png\",\"video\":\"https:\\/\\/www.w3schools.com\\/html\\/mov_bbb.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Commercial\",\"meta\":\"Commercials&nbsp; \\/&nbsp; Brand Films\",\"cats\":\"commercials brand-films\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-2.png\",\"video\":\"https:\\/\\/interactive-examples.mdn.mozilla.net\\/media\\/cc0-videos\\/flower.mp4\"},{\"title\":\"Event Film\",\"meta\":\"Events&nbsp; \\/&nbsp; Social\",\"cats\":\"events social\",\"overlay\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"video\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/shorts\\/AEICMeqa1B8\"}]',20,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(620,