\"Review | Approve\"]]',50,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(624,'3d-animation','ve_services','Services','Services accordion','[{\"title\":\"Editing and Assembly\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-1.svg\",\"open\":true,\"points\":[\"Footage review, take selection, and story structure\",\"Multi-camera synchronisation\",\"Rough Cut\",\"Pacing, sequencing, and narrative construction\",\"Audio Sync\"]},{\"title\":\"Finishing and Post\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-2.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Colour grading\",\"Audio cleanup and sound design\",\"Motion graphics and VFX\",\"Subtitling and captions\",\"Platform-specific exports\"]},{\"title\":\"Digital Magazine Design\",\"icon\":\"acc-icon-3.svg\",\"open\":false,\"points\":[\"Corporate brand films\",\"Commercials\",\"Product videos\",\"Documentaries\",\"Training content\",\"Event coverage\",\"Short-form social content\"]}]',60,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(625,'3d-animation','ve_workflow','Process','Process steps','[[\"01\",\"#F6B700\",46,51,\"step-art-1.png\",48.89,69.84,103.41,124.16,\"Brief and Goal\",\"We start by agreeing on what the video is for, who it is for, and where it will be shown. Everything after this follows from it.\"],[\"02\",\"#CF6CB9\",26,71,\"step-art-2.png\",48.89,91.91,100,102.09,\"Footage Review\",\"We go through all your raw footage, pick the best material, and plan the edit before we start.\"],[\"03\",\"#59B38D\",25,72,\"step-art-3.png\",42.45,99.4,112.88,94.6,\"First Cut\",\"We put together the first version so you can see the structure and pacing early.\"],[\"04\",\"#C9AC61\",25,72,\"step-art-4.png\",40.33,99.4,117.12,94.6,\"Refinement\",\"We add color grading, sound, motion graphics, and final timing to complete the video.\"],[\"05\",\"#53A2BC\",22,75,\"step-art-5.png\",33.65,83.32,130.48,110.68,\"Final Delivery\",\"We export the video in every resolution and aspect ratio you need, ready for each platform.\"],[\"06\",\"#7F68CE\",22,75,\"step-art-6.png\",48.89,74.4,100,119.6,\"Your Review\",\"You share your feedback, and we make the changes for as many rounds as you need.\"]]',70,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(626,'3d-animation','ve_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Motion Graphics\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-1-625569.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"text\":\"From animated logos and lower thirds to full-sequence motion design, we create graphics that bring energy, clarity, and brand consistency to every frame.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"Explainer Videos\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-2-56586a.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"We distil complex ideas into clear, engaging narratives using a mix of live action, animation, and motion graphics tailored to your audience and platform.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"Product Video\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"img\":\"offer-3-56586b.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"text\":\"Showcase your product with polished visuals, precise pacing, and platform-ready edits designed to drive engagement and conversion across every channel.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"Event Films\",\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"img\":\"pf-overlay-3.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"text\":\"Complete coverage of conferences, launches and live events, edited into highlight reels, recaps and social-ready clips.\"}]',80,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(627,'3d-animation','ve_faqs','FAQs','Questions & answers','[[\"What video editing services do professional video editing companies offer?\",\"Editing and assembly, colour grading, audio, motion graphics, subtitling, and platform-ready exports.\"],[\"What are the different types of video editing?\",\"Corporate brand films, commercials, product videos, documentaries, training content, event coverage and short-form social content.\"],[\"What video editing software do you use?\",\"Adobe Premiere Pro, Adobe After Effects, Final Cut Pro, DaVinci Resolve, Adobe Audition and Frame.io.\"],[\"How long does the editing process take?\",\"Turnaround is confirmed upfront, based on the length and complexity of the video and the delivery date you have agreed on.\"],[\"What is included in video post-production services?\",\"Finishing work is part of the scope rather than quoted separately: colour grading, sound, motion graphics, subtitling and final exports.\"],[\"How do you handle feedback, revisions, and creative direction?\",\"You share your feedback, and we make the changes for as many rounds as you need.\"]]',90,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(628,'3d-animation~stats-6whk','seo_metrics','Numbers','Dark number strip','[[\"m-globe.svg\",\"7\",\"Countries Global Presence\"],[\"m-clock.svg\",\"18\",\"Years of Experience\"],[\"m-users.svg\",\"1200\",\"Global Clients\"],[\"m-award.svg\",\"120\",\"Skilled Professional\"]]',30,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(629,'3d-animation~why-1jqb','seo_why','Why Intelliworkz','\"Why Intelliworkz\" cards','[{\"c\":\"var(--c-teal)\",\"no\":\"01\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-1.svg\",\"title\":\"In-House Lead Generation Team\",\"text\":\"Our in-house team coordinates targeting, campaigns, lead qualification, reviews and reporting.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-red)\",\"no\":\"02\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-2.svg\",\"title\":\"Qualified Lead Generation\",\"text\":\"We shape campaigns and qualification steps around your customer profile and agreed definition of a qualified lead.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-charcoal)\",\"no\":\"03\",\"noa\":0.15,\"icon\":\"why-3.svg\",\"title\":\"Confidential Lead Data Handling\",\"text\":\"Prospect information, campaign access and qualification records are handled within the agreed project workflow.\"},{\"c\":\"var(--c-olive)\",\"no\":\"04\",\"noa\":0.2,\"icon\":\"why-4.svg\",\"title\":\"Clear Scope and Pricing\",\"text\":\"Lead criteria, channel activity, reporting, timelines and pricing are agreed before campaigns begin.\"}]',40,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(630,'3d-animation~offers-z7z5','seo_offers','What We Offer','\"What we offer\" cards','[{\"no\":\"01\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Digital Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We coordinate search, paid advertising, social campaigns, content and measurement to help businesses reach relevant audiences and turn attention into enquiries.\"},{\"no\":\"02\",\"noc\":\"#EAD3C4\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #FBE7DB 0%, #FFFDFD 100%)\",\"title\":\"SEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-1.png\",\"x\":58,\"y\":277,\"w\":457,\"h\":341,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-1.svg\",\"text\":\"We improve search visibility through technical audits, on-page optimisation, content planning and practical implementation, with performance tracked against business goals.\"},{\"no\":\"03\",\"noc\":\"#A2DDDD\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #C5E3E3 0%, #F0FAFB 100%)\",\"title\":\"AEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We organise content around customer questions, clear answers and structured signals that make information easier for search engines and assistants to understand.\"},{\"no\":\"04\",\"noc\":\"#D9D3A0\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #F5F1C4 0%, #FFFEF8 100%)\",\"title\":\"GEO Services\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-2.png\",\"x\":45,\"y\":265,\"w\":486,\"h\":372,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-2.svg\",\"text\":\"We strengthen content structure, entity information and technical signals to help AI-powered discovery systems understand and reference your brand.\"},{\"no\":\"05\",\"noc\":\"#D1C7E6\",\"bg\":\"linear-gradient(-42deg, #EAE2F3 0%, #FBF8FF 100%)\",\"title\":\"Content Marketing\",\"dir\":\"seo\",\"img\":\"offer-3.png\",\"x\":34,\"y\":265,\"w\":505,\"h\":343,\"arrow\":\"offer-arrow-3.svg\",\"text\":\"We plan, research and develop useful content for each stage of the buyer journey, aligned with your audience, brand voice and search goals.\"}]',80,'2026-10-26 01:03:58','2026-10-26 01:03:58'),(631,'3d-animation~tools-rmdx','mg_tools','Tools','Tools','[[\"assets\\/icons\\/seo\\/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Google Ads and Meta Ads Manager\",\"Target | Advertise\"],[\"assets\\/icons\\/seo\\/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"LinkedIn Campaign Manager\",\"Target | Promote\"],[\"assets\\/images\\/seo\\/tool-ga4.png\",\"#FFFFFF\",\"Google Analytics 4 and Tag Manager\",\"Track | Measure\"],[\"assets\\/icons\\/seo\\/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"Landing page and form tools\",\"\"],[\"assets\\/icons\\/seo\\/why-1.svg\",\"#1A1A1A\",\"CRM and email platforms\",\"\"]]',50,'2026-10-26 01:05:27','2026-10-26 01:05:27');
